export const bridgeGameTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"en":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Contract Bridge Practice Game","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.","One hand from deal to score":"One hand from deal to score","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.","A beginner practice version":"A beginner practice version","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.","Questions":"Questions","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"What bidding system do the computer players use?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.","Can I play online with other people?":"Can I play online with other people?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.","How does the game score a hand?":"How does the game score a hand?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.","Scope and limitations":"Scope and limitations","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.","Starter bidding agreement":"Starter bidding agreement","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Vulnerability for this hand","Neither side vulnerable":"Neither side vulnerable","North–South vulnerable":"North–South vulnerable","East–West vulnerable":"East–West vulnerable","Both sides vulnerable":"Both sides vulnerable","Dealer":"Dealer","North":"North","East":"East","South · you":"South · you","West":"West","North–South":"North–South","East–West":"East–West","Hand":"Hand","Auction":"Auction","Contract":"Contract","To act":"To act","Your turn":"Your turn","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} is thinking…","Level":"Level","Strain":"Strain","Clubs":"Clubs","Diamonds":"Diamonds","Hearts":"Hearts","Spades":"Spades","No trump":"No trump","Bid":"Bid","Pass":"Pass","Double":"Double","Redouble":"Redouble","No bid is available at that level.":"No bid is available at that level.","Declarer":"Declarer","Dummy":"Dummy","Opening leader":"Opening leader","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.","Your hand":"Your hand","Dummy hand":"Dummy hand","Hidden hand":"Hidden hand","Current trick":"Current trick","Tricks won":"Tricks won","Duplicate-style score":"Duplicate-style score","North–South total":"North–South total","East–West total":"East–West total","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.","Hand result":"Hand result","Deal next hand":"Deal next hand","New hand":"New hand","Export score sheet":"Export score sheet","Choose a legal call.":"Choose a legal call.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Follow the led suit when you can.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.","Rules reference":"Rules reference","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024"},"es":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Juego de práctica de puente de contrato","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Juega Contract Bridge en línea contra jugadores informáticos locales","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Practica una mano de bridge con contrato duplicado contra tres jugadores de computadora locales de nivel principiante. Oferte, haga lo mismo, controle el muerto como declarante y vea un resultado claro. Sin multijugador en línea.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Juega una mano completa de bridge por contrato contra tres jugadores de la computadora local. El idioma de la interfaz nunca selecciona una convención de licitación ni reglas específicas de un país.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Las cartas, pujas y puntuaciones permanecen en este navegador. El juego no utiliza una cuenta, carga ni oponente en línea.","One hand from deal to score":"Una mano del trato al gol","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"La subasta finaliza en 4♠ duplicado. El bando declarante debe realizar diez bazas; la ventaja inicial proviene del jugador a la izquierda del declarante. Después de esa salida, se muestra el muerto y el declarante elige cartas de ambas manos.","A beginner practice version":"Una versión de práctica para principiantes","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Esta es una mano de práctica de puente duplicado de una sola mesa. Aplica orden de oferta legal, pase, doble, redoblo, juego de seguimiento, comparación de triunfo, control del muerto por parte del declarante y una puntuación de estilo duplicado para la mano. Los jugadores integrados en la computadora utilizan un pequeño acuerdo inicial natural: 1NT muestra un equilibrio de 15 a 17 puntos de cartas altas; las aperturas de palos comienzan en 12 puntos; Las respuestas y las sobredeclaraciones son deliberadamente básicas. Estos oponentes son robots de práctica, no software de bridge experto. Las reglas de torneos, alertas, convenciones de asociaciones y comparaciones de puntos de partido están fuera de esta versión.","Questions":"Preguntas","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"¿Es este puente de goma o puente duplicado?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Califica cada mano por separado utilizando la puntuación de contrato de estilo duplicado. No traslada las puntuaciones parciales como lo hace el puente de goma y no compara su resultado con otras tablas.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"¿Qué sistema de pujas utilizan los jugadores informáticos?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"En la página se muestra un acuerdo inicial natural para principiantes. Es igual sea cual sea el idioma de interfaz que elijas; No es un sistema de bridge nacional ni una tarjeta de convención de torneo completa.","Can I play online with other people?":"¿Puedo jugar online con otras personas?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"No. Una persona juega Sur contra tres jugadores de computadora locales. No hay juego de emparejamiento, cuenta o servidor.","How does the game score a hand?":"¿Cómo puntúa una mano el juego?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Muestra el contrato, la vulnerabilidad, las bazas requeridas y una puntuación de estilo duplicado basada en el nivel del contrato, tensión, doble/redoblo, sobrebazas o subbazas y bonificaciones de juego o slam.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"¿La computadora juega como un fuerte compañero de puente?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"No. Los bots siguen llamadas y jugadas legales, pero utilizan heurísticas simples para principiantes. Sus decisiones no son un modelo de subasta experta o de juego de cartas.","Scope and limitations":"Alcance y limitaciones","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Esta es una mesa de práctica, no un servicio de bridge en línea, un director de torneo o un solucionador experto. El acuerdo de oferta inicial es intencionalmente pequeño y está documentado. Se muestra la puntuación de la mano en estilo duplicado; Los puntos de partido, IMP, puntuación de goma, alertas, reclamos, rectificaciones de revocación y decisiones del director no se implementan.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Una mano de práctica completa estilo duplicado. Siempre te sientas al sur; Norte-Sur y Este-Oeste son socios.","Starter bidding agreement":"Acuerdo de oferta inicial","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Acuerdo natural para principiantes: 1NT = balanceado entre 15 y 17 puntos de cartas altas; una apertura de palo comienza en 12 puntos. Las respuestas y las sobredeclaraciones son simples prácticas heurísticas, no consejos de expertos ni un sistema nacional.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Vulnerabilidad para esta mano","Neither side vulnerable":"Ningún lado vulnerable","North–South vulnerable":"Norte-Sur vulnerable","East–West vulnerable":"Este-Oeste vulnerable","Both sides vulnerable":"Ambos lados vulnerables","Dealer":"Distribuidor","North":"Norte","East":"Este","South · you":"Sur · tú","West":"Oeste","North–South":"Norte-Sur","East–West":"Este-Oeste","Hand":"Mano","Auction":"Subasta","Contract":"Contrato","To act":"Actuar","Your turn":"Tu turno","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} está pensando…","Level":"Nivel","Strain":"Cepa","Clubs":"Palos","Diamonds":"Diamantes","Hearts":"Corazones","Spades":"Espadas","No trump":"Sin triunfo","Bid":"Oferta","Pass":"Pase","Double":"Doble","Redouble":"Redoblar","No bid is available at that level.":"No hay ofertas disponibles en ese nivel.","Declarer":"Declarante","Dummy":"Ficticio","Opening leader":"Líder de apertura","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"El muñeco se revela después de la salida inicial.","Your hand":"Tu mano","Dummy hand":"Mano simulada","Hidden hand":"Mano escondida","Current trick":"Truco actual","Tricks won":"Trucos ganados","Duplicate-style score":"Puntuación de estilo duplicado","North–South total":"Total Norte-Sur","East–West total":"Total Este-Oeste","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Elija una configuración de mano y comience la subasta.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Subasta completa. El líder inicial juega primero.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Cuatro pases: se reparte el tablero. Reparte la siguiente mano cuando estés listo.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Contrato realizado: trucos {tricks}, puntos {score} para {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"El contrato cayó: trucos de {tricks}, {score} apunta a {side}.","Hand result":"Resultado manual","Deal next hand":"Oferta próxima","New hand":"Nueva mano","Export score sheet":"Hoja de puntuación de exportación","Choose a legal call.":"Elija una llamada legal.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Sigue el traje LED cuando puedas.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Los jugadores de computadora usan reglas locales de nivel principiante. No salen datos de este dispositivo.","Rules reference":"Referencia de reglas","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Federación Mundial de Bridge · Leyes de Puente Duplicado 2017, Leyes 73 y 89 actualizadas 2024"},"fr":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Jeu d'entraînement au pont contractuel","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Jouez à Contract Bridge en ligne contre des joueurs informatiques locaux","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Entraînez-vous à une partie de bridge contractuel en double contre trois joueurs informatiques locaux de niveau débutant. Enchérissez, emboîtez le pas, contrôlez le mannequin en tant que déclarant et voyez un score clair. Pas de multijoueur en ligne.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Jouez une main complète de bridge contractuel contre trois joueurs informatiques locaux. La langue de l'interface ne sélectionne jamais de convention d'appel d'offres ou de règles spécifiques à un pays.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Les cartes, les enchères et les scores restent dans ce navigateur. Le jeu n'utilise pas de compte, de téléchargement ou d'adversaire en ligne.","One hand from deal to score":"Une main, de la donne au score","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"L'enchère se termine par 4♠ doublés. Le camp déclarant doit effectuer dix levées ; l’entame d’ouverture vient du joueur à la gauche du déclarant. Après cette avance, le mort est montré et le déclarant choisit les cartes des deux mains.","A beginner practice version":"Une version pratique pour débutants","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Il s'agit d'une main d'entraînement à table unique avec pont dupliqué. Il applique l'ordre d'enchère légal, la passe, le double, le redouble, le jeu de suivi, la comparaison d'atout, le contrôle factice par le déclarant et un score de style duplicata pour la main. Les lecteurs informatiques intégrés utilisent un petit accord de démarrage naturel : 1SA affiche un équilibre de 15 à 17 points de carte élevée ; les ouvertures des combinaisons commencent à 12 points ; les réponses et les appels supplémentaires sont délibérément basiques. Ces adversaires sont des robots d’entraînement, pas des logiciels de bridge experts. Les décisions de tournoi, les alertes, les conventions de partenariat et les comparaisons de points de match ne sont pas disponibles dans cette version.","Questions":"Questions","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"S'agit-il d'un pont en caoutchouc ou d'un pont en double ?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Il marque chaque main séparément en utilisant une notation de contrat de style dupliqué. Il ne reporte pas les partitions comme le fait le pont en caoutchouc, et il ne compare pas votre résultat avec d'autres tableaux.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Quel système d'enchères les joueurs informatiques utilisent-ils ?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Un accord de démarrage naturel pour débutant est présenté sur la page. C'est la même chose quelle que soit la langue d'interface que vous choisissez ; ce n'est pas un système de bridge national ou une carte de convention de tournoi complète.","Can I play online with other people?":"Puis-je jouer en ligne avec d'autres personnes ?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Non. Une personne joue au Sud contre trois joueurs informatiques locaux. Il n’y a pas de matchmaking, de compte ou de jeu sur serveur.","How does the game score a hand?":"Comment le jeu marque-t-il une main ?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Il affiche le contrat, la vulnérabilité, les tricks requis et un score de style dupliqué basé sur le niveau de contrat, la tension, le double/redouble, les overtricks ou undertricks et les bonus de jeu ou de slam.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"L'ordinateur joue-t-il comme un partenaire de bridge puissant ?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Non. Les robots suivent les appels et les jeux légaux mais utilisent des heuristiques simples pour débutants. Leurs décisions ne sont pas un modèle d’enchères expertes ou de jeu de cartes.","Scope and limitations":"Portée et limites","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Il s'agit d'une table d'entraînement, pas d'un service de bridge en ligne, d'un directeur de tournoi ou d'un solveur expert. L’accord d’enchère de démarrage est intentionnellement petit et documenté. Le score manuel de style dupliqué est affiché ; les points de match, les IMP, les scores en caoutchouc, les alertes, les réclamations, les rectifications de révocation et les décisions du directeur ne sont pas mis en œuvre.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Une main d'entraînement complète de style duplicata. Vous êtes toujours assis au sud ; Nord-Sud et Est-Ouest sont partenaires.","Starter bidding agreement":"Accord d'appel d'offres de démarrage","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Accord de débutant naturel : 1SA = équilibré 15 à 17 points de carte élevée ; une ouverture de costume commence à 12 points. Les réponses et les appels excessifs sont de simples heuristiques pratiques, et non des conseils d'experts ou un système national.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Vulnérabilité pour cette main","Neither side vulnerable":"Aucun côté vulnérable","North–South vulnerable":"Vulnérable Nord-Sud","East–West vulnerable":"Vulnérable Est-Ouest","Both sides vulnerable":"Les deux côtés sont vulnérables","Dealer":"Concessionnaire","North":"Nord","East":"Est","South · you":"Sud · vous","West":"Ouest","North–South":"Nord-Sud","East–West":"Est-Ouest","Hand":"Main","Auction":"Enchères","Contract":"Contrat","To act":"Pour agir","Your turn":"À votre tour","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} réfléchit…","Level":"Niveau","Strain":"Souche","Clubs":"Clubs","Diamonds":"Diamants","Hearts":"Cœurs","Spades":"Pique","No trump":"Pas d'atout","Bid":"Enchère","Pass":"Passez","Double":"Double","Redouble":"Redoubler","No bid is available at that level.":"Aucune offre n'est disponible à ce niveau.","Declarer":"Déclarateur","Dummy":"Factice","Opening leader":"Animateur d'ouverture","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy est révélé après l'ouverture.","Your hand":"Votre main","Dummy hand":"Main factice","Hidden hand":"Main cachée","Current trick":"Astuce actuelle","Tricks won":"Tricks gagnés","Duplicate-style score":"Partition de style dupliqué","North–South total":"Total Nord-Sud","East–West total":"Total Est-Ouest","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Choisissez un réglage de main et commencez l'enchère.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Enchères terminées. Le leader d'ouverture joue en premier.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Quatre passes : le tableau est évanoui. Distribuez la main suivante lorsque vous êtes prêt.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Contrat conclu : astuces {tricks}, points {score} pour {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Le contrat a échoué : astuces {tricks}, {score} pointe vers {side}.","Hand result":"Résultat manuel","Deal next hand":"Deal prochaine main","New hand":"Nouvelle main","Export score sheet":"Exporter la feuille de score","Choose a legal call.":"Choisissez un appel légal.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Suivez la combinaison LED lorsque vous le pouvez.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Les joueurs sur ordinateur utilisent des règles locales de niveau débutant. Aucune donnée ne quitte cet appareil.","Rules reference":"Référence aux règles","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Fédération mondiale de bridge · Lois sur le pont en double 2017, lois 73 et 89 mises à jour en 2024"},"pt":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Jogo prático de ponte contratual","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Jogue Contract Bridge on-line contra jogadores de computador locais","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Pratique uma mão de bridge de contrato duplicado contra três jogadores de computador local de nível iniciante. Dê lances, siga o exemplo, controle o manequim como declarante e veja uma pontuação clara. Sem multijogador online.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Jogue uma mão completa de bridge contratual contra três jogadores de computador locais. A linguagem da interface nunca seleciona uma convenção de licitação ou regras específicas do país.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Cartões, lances e pontuações ficam neste navegador. O jogo não utiliza conta, upload ou oponente online.","One hand from deal to score":"Uma mão da negociação até a pontuação","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"O leilão termina em 4♠ dobrado. O lado declarante deve realizar dez vazas; a vantagem inicial vem do jogador à esquerda do carteador. Após essa jogada, o morto é mostrado e o carteador escolhe as cartas de ambas as mãos.","A beginner practice version":"Uma versão prática para iniciantes","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Esta é uma mão prática de ponte duplicada de tabela única. Aplica ordem de lance legal, passe, duplo, redobrado, jogo de acompanhamento, comparação de trunfo, controle fictício pelo carteador e uma pontuação de estilo duplicado para a mão. Os jogadores de computador integrados usam um pequeno acordo inicial natural: 1NT mostra 15–17 pontos de cartas altas equilibrados; as aberturas dos naipes começam em 12 pontos; respostas e overcalls são deliberadamente básicos. Esses oponentes são bots práticos, não softwares de ponte especializados. Regras de torneios, alertas, convenções de parceria e comparações de matchpoints estão fora desta versão.","Questions":"Perguntas","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Esta é uma ponte de borracha ou uma ponte duplicada?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Ele pontua cada mão separadamente usando pontuação de contrato de estilo duplicado. Ele não transfere pontuações parciais como faz a ponte de borracha e não compara seu resultado com outras tabelas.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Qual sistema de licitação os jogadores de computador usam?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Um acordo inicial natural para iniciantes é mostrado na página. É o mesmo, seja qual for o idioma de interface que você escolher; não é um sistema de bridge nacional ou um cartão completo de convenção de torneio.","Can I play online with other people?":"Posso jogar online com outras pessoas?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Não. Uma pessoa joga no Sul contra três jogadores de computador locais. Não há matchmaking, conta ou jogo de servidor.","How does the game score a hand?":"Como o jogo marca uma mão?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Mostra o contrato, a vulnerabilidade, as manobras necessárias e uma pontuação de estilo duplicado com base no nível do contrato, tensão, duplo/redobro, overtricks ou undertricks e bônus de jogo ou slam.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"O computador joga como um parceiro de bridge forte?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Não. Os bots seguem chamadas e jogadas legais, mas usam heurísticas simples para iniciantes. Suas decisões não são um modelo de licitação especializada ou de jogo de cartas.","Scope and limitations":"Escopo e limitações","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Esta é uma mesa de prática, não um serviço de bridge online, diretor de torneio ou solucionador especialista. O contrato de licitação inicial é intencionalmente pequeno e documentado. A pontuação da mão em estilo duplicado é mostrada; matchpoints, IMPs, pontuação de borracha, alertas, reivindicações, revogação de retificações e decisões do diretor não são implementados.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Uma mão prática completa em estilo duplicado. Você sempre se senta no sul; Norte-Sul e Leste-Oeste são parceiros.","Starter bidding agreement":"Contrato de licitação inicial","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Acordo de iniciante natural: 1NT = 15–17 pontos de cartas altas equilibrados; a abertura do naipe começa em 12 pontos. As respostas e as chamadas gerais são heurísticas práticas simples, e não conselhos de especialistas ou um sistema nacional.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Vulnerabilidade para esta mão","Neither side vulnerable":"Nenhum lado vulnerável","North–South vulnerable":"Venulável Norte-Sul","East–West vulnerable":"Venulável Leste-Oeste","Both sides vulnerable":"Ambos os lados vulneráveis","Dealer":"Revendedor","North":"Norte","East":"Leste","South · you":"Sul · você","West":"Oeste","North–South":"Norte-Sul","East–West":"Leste–Oeste","Hand":"Mão","Auction":"Leilão","Contract":"Contrato","To act":"Agir","Your turn":"Sua vez","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} está pensando…","Level":"Nível","Strain":"Deformação","Clubs":"Clubes","Diamonds":"Diamantes","Hearts":"Corações","Spades":"Espadas","No trump":"Sem trunfo","Bid":"Lance","Pass":"Passe","Double":"Duplo","Redouble":"Redobrar","No bid is available at that level.":"Nenhuma oferta está disponível nesse nível.","Declarer":"Declarador","Dummy":"Manequim","Opening leader":"Líder de abertura","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy é revelado após o lead de abertura.","Your hand":"Sua mão","Dummy hand":"Mão falsa","Hidden hand":"Mão oculta","Current trick":"Truque atual","Tricks won":"Truques ganhos","Duplicate-style score":"Pontuação de estilo duplicado","North–South total":"Total Norte-Sul","East–West total":"Total Leste-Oeste","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Escolha uma configuração de mão e comece o leilão.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Leilão concluído. O líder de abertura joga primeiro.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Quatro passagens: a prancha é distribuída. Dê a próxima mão quando estiver pronto.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Contrato feito: manobras {tricks}, pontos {score} para {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Contrato caiu: truques de {tricks}, {score} aponta para {side}.","Hand result":"Resultado da mão","Deal next hand":"Negócio na próxima mão","New hand":"Mão nova","Export score sheet":"Exportar planilha de pontuação","Choose a legal call.":"Escolha uma chamada legal.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Siga o traje LED quando puder.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Os jogadores de computador usam regras locais de nível iniciante. Nenhum dado sai deste dispositivo.","Rules reference":"Referência de regras","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Federação Mundial de Pontes · Leis de Ponte Duplicada de 2017, Leis 73 e 89 atualizadas em 2024"},"de":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Contract Bridge Übungsspiel","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Spielen Sie Contract Bridge online gegen lokale Computerspieler","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Üben Sie eine Hand von Duplicate Contract Bridge gegen drei lokale Computerspieler auf Anfängerniveau. Bieten Sie, folgen Sie der Farbe, kontrollieren Sie den Dummy als Alleinspieler und sehen Sie ein klares Ergebnis. Kein Online-Multiplayer.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Spielen Sie eine komplette Contract-Bridge-Hand gegen drei lokale Computerspieler. Die Sprache der Benutzeroberfläche bestimmt niemals eine Gebotskonvention oder länderspezifische Regeln.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Karten, Gebote und Punkte bleiben in diesem Browser. Das Spiel benötigt kein Konto, keinen Upload oder Online-Gegner.","One hand from deal to score":"Eine Hand vom Deal bis zum Ergebnis","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Die Auktion endet mit 4♠ verdoppelt. Die ansagende Seite muss zehn Stiche machen; Die Eröffnungsausspielung kommt vom Spieler links vom Alleinspieler. Nach dieser Ausspielung wird der Dummy gezeigt und der Alleinspieler wählt Karten aus beiden Händen.","A beginner practice version":"Eine Übungsversion für Anfänger","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Dies ist eine Einzeltisch-Duplikat-Bridge-Übungshand. Es werden die gesetzliche Gebotsreihenfolge, Pass, Verdoppelung, Verdoppelung, Folgespiel, Trumpfvergleich, Dummy-Kontrolle durch den Alleinspieler und eine doppelte Punktzahl für die Hand angewendet. Die integrierten Computerspieler verwenden eine kleine natürliche Startervereinbarung: 1NT weist ausgeglichene 15–17 High-Card-Punkte auf; Anzugöffnungen beginnen bei 12 Punkten; Antworten und Überrufe sind bewusst einfach gehalten. Bei diesen Gegnern handelt es sich um Übungs-Bots, nicht um professionelle Bridge-Software. Turnierregeln, Warnungen, Partnerschaftskonventionen und Matchpoint-Vergleiche liegen nicht in dieser Version.","Questions":"Fragen","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Ist das eine Gummibrücke oder eine doppelte Brücke?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Es wertet jede Hand separat, indem es eine Vertragsbewertung im Duplikat-Stil verwendet. Partituren werden nicht übertragen, wie dies bei Rubber Bridge der Fall ist, und Ihr Ergebnis wird nicht mit anderen Tabellen verglichen.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Welches Gebotssystem verwenden die Computerspieler?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Auf der Seite wird ein natürlicher Anfängervertrag für Anfänger angezeigt. Es ist die gleiche Sprache, egal welche Sprache Sie für die Benutzeroberfläche wählen. Es handelt sich nicht um ein nationales Bridge-System oder eine vollständige Turnier-Convention-Karte.","Can I play online with other people?":"Kann ich online mit anderen Leuten spielen?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Nr. Eine Person spielt im Süden gegen drei lokale Computerspieler. Es gibt kein Matchmaking, kein Account- oder Serverspiel.","How does the game score a hand?":"Wie erzielt das Spiel eine Hand?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Es zeigt den Vertrag, die Schwachstelle, die erforderlichen Tricks und eine doppelte Punktzahl basierend auf Vertragsstufe, Belastung, Double/Redouble, Overtricks oder Undertricks und Spiel- oder Slam-Boni.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Spielt der Computer wie ein starker Bridge-Partner?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Nr. Die Bots befolgen legale Anrufe und Spielzüge, verwenden jedoch einfache Heuristiken für Anfänger. Ihre Entscheidungen sind kein Musterbeispiel für Expertengebot oder Kartenspiel.","Scope and limitations":"Umfang und Einschränkungen","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Dies ist ein Übungstisch, kein Online-Bridge-Service, Turnierleiter oder Expertenlöser. Die Startergebotsvereinbarung ist bewusst klein gehalten und dokumentiert. Es wird eine Handpartitur im Duplikatstil angezeigt. Matchbälle, IMPs, Gummiwertungen, Warnungen, Ansprüche, Widerrufkorrekturen und Direktorenentscheidungen werden nicht umgesetzt.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Eine komplette Übungshand im Duplikat-Stil. Du sitzt immer im Süden; Nord-Süd und Ost-West sind Partner.","Starter bidding agreement":"Starter-Gebotsvereinbarung","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Vereinbarung für natürliche Anfänger: 1NT = ausgewogene 15–17 High-Card-Punkte; Eine Anzugseröffnung beginnt bei 12 Punkten. Antworten und Überanrufe sind einfache Übungsheuristiken, keine Expertenratschläge oder ein nationales System.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Sicherheitslücke für diese Hand","Neither side vulnerable":"Keine Seite angreifbar","North–South vulnerable":"Nord-Süd anfällig","East–West vulnerable":"Ost-West-gefährdet","Both sides vulnerable":"Beide Seiten angreifbar","Dealer":"Händler","North":"Norden","East":"Osten","South · you":"Süd · du","West":"West","North–South":"Nord–Süd","East–West":"Ost–West","Hand":"Hand","Auction":"Auktion","Contract":"Vertrag","To act":"Um zu handeln","Your turn":"Du bist dran","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} denkt…","Level":"Ebene","Strain":"Stamm","Clubs":"Keulen","Diamonds":"Diamanten","Hearts":"Herzen","Spades":"Spaten","No trump":"Kein Trumpf","Bid":"Gebot","Pass":"Bestanden","Double":"Doppelt","Redouble":"Verdoppeln","No bid is available at that level.":"Auf dieser Ebene ist kein Gebot verfügbar.","Declarer":"Anmelder","Dummy":"Dummy","Opening leader":"Eröffnungsführer","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy wird nach der Eröffnungsführung enthüllt.","Your hand":"Deine Hand","Dummy hand":"Dummy-Hand","Hidden hand":"Versteckte Hand","Current trick":"Aktueller Trick","Tricks won":"Tricks gewonnen","Duplicate-style score":"Partitur im Duplikatstil","North–South total":"Nord-Süd-Summe","East–West total":"Ost-West-Summe","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Wählen Sie eine Zeigereinstellung und starten Sie die Auktion.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Auktion abgeschlossen. Der Eröffnungsführer spielt zuerst.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Vier Durchgänge: Das Board wird ohnmächtig. Geben Sie die nächste Hand aus, wenn Sie bereit sind.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Auftrag abgeschlossen: {tricks}-Tricks, {score}-Punkte für {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Vertrag ist ausgefallen: {tricks} trickst, {score} zeigt auf {side}.","Hand result":"Handergebnis","Deal next hand":"Nächste Hand austeilen","New hand":"Neue Hand","Export score sheet":"Ergebnisblatt exportieren","Choose a legal call.":"Wählen Sie einen legalen Anruf.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Folgen Sie dem LED-Anzug, wenn Sie können.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Computerspieler verwenden lokale Regeln für Anfänger. Es verlassen keine Daten dieses Gerät.","Rules reference":"Regelreferenz","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"World Bridge Federation · Gesetze zur doppelten Brücke 2017, Gesetze 73 und 89 aktualisiert 2024"},"ja":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"コントラクトブリッジ練習ゲーム","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Contract Bridge をオンラインでローカル コンピュータ プレーヤーと対戦する","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"初心者レベルのローカル コンピューター プレーヤー 3 人を相手に重複契約ブリッジのハンドを練習します。入札し、それに倣い、デクレアラーとしてダミーをコントロールし、明確なスコアを確認します。オンラインマルチプレイヤーはありません。","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"3 人のローカル コンピューター プレーヤーとコントラクト ブリッジの 1 つの完全なハンドをプレイします。インターフェイス言語によって入札規則や国固有のルールが選択されることはありません。","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"カード、入札、スコアはこのブラウザーに残ります。ゲームはアカウント、アップロード、オンライン対戦相手を使用しません。","One hand from deal to score":"ディールからスコアまでワンハンド","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"オークションは 4♠ 2 倍で終了します。宣言する側は 10 回のトリックを取る必要があります。オープニングリードはデクレアラーの左側のプレーヤーから得られます。そのリードの後、ダミーが表示され、宣言者が両手からカードを選択します。","A beginner practice version":"初心者練習版","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"これはシングルテーブルの複製ブリッジ練習用ハンドです。法的な入札順序、パス、ダブル、リダブル、フォロースーツ プレイ、トランプの比較、デクレアラーによるダミー コントロール、およびハンドの重複スタイル スコアが適用されます。内蔵のコンピューター プレーヤーは、小さな自然なスターター合意を使用します。1NT はバランスのとれた 15 ～ 17 のハイカード ポイントを示します。スーツの開口部は 12 ポイントから始まります。応答とオーバーコールは意図的に基本的なものになっています。これらの敵は練習用のボットであり、熟練したブリッジ ソフトウェアではありません。トーナメントの裁定、アラート、パートナーシップ規約、マッチポイントの比較はこのバージョンの対象外です。","Questions":"質問","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"これはゴム製の橋ですか、それとも二重の橋ですか?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"重複スタイルのコントラクト スコアリングを使用して、各ハンドを個別にスコアリングします。ラバーブリッジのようにパートスコアを転送することはなく、結果を他のテーブルと比較することもありません。","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"コンピュータ プレーヤーはどのような入札システムを使用していますか?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"初心者向けのナチュラルスターター契約がページに表示されます。どのインターフェース言語を選択しても同じです。これは、全国的なブリッジ システムや完全なトーナメント コンベンション カードではありません。","Can I play online with other people?":"他の人とオンラインでプレイできますか?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"いいえ。 1 人が南側で 3 人のローカル コンピュータ プレーヤーと対戦します。マッチメイキング、アカウント、サーバー ゲームはありません。","How does the game score a hand?":"ゲームではハンドがどのようにスコアリングされますか?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"契約、脆弱性、必要なトリック、および契約レベル、ストレイン、ダブル/リダブル、オーバートリックまたはアンダートリック、およびゲームまたはスラムボーナスに基づく複製スタイルのスコアを表示します。","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"コンピュータは強力なブリッジパートナーのように機能しますか?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"いいえ。ボットは合法的なコールとプレイに従いますが、単純な初心者ヒューリスティックを使用します。彼らの決定は、専門家の入札やカードプレイのモデルではありません。","Scope and limitations":"範囲と制限事項","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"これは練習台であり、オンライン ブリッジ サービス、トーナメント ディレクター、エキスパート ソルバーではありません。スターター入札契約書は意図的に小さく、文書化されています。重複スタイルのハンドスコアが表示されます。マッチポイント、IMP、ラバースコアリング、アラート、クレーム、取り消し修正、ディレクター裁定は実装されていません。","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"完全な複製スタイルの練習用ハンド 1 つ。あなたはいつも南に座ります。北と南と東と西はパートナーです。","Starter bidding agreement":"スターター入札契約","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"ナチュラル初心者規約: 1NT = バランスの取れた 15 ～ 17 のハイカード ポイント。スーツのオープニングは 12 ポイントから始まります。対応とオーバーコールは単純な実践ヒューリスティックであり、専門家のアドバイスや国家システムではありません。","Vulnerability for this hand":"この手の脆弱性","Neither side vulnerable":"どちらの側も脆弱ではない","North–South vulnerable":"南北間の脆弱性","East–West vulnerable":"東西の脆弱性","Both sides vulnerable":"両側が脆弱","Dealer":"ディーラー","North":"北","East":"東","South · you":"南・あなた","West":"西","North–South":"南北","East–West":"東西","Hand":"手","Auction":"オークション","Contract":"契約","To act":"行動すること","Your turn":"あなたの番です","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} は考えています…","Level":"レベル","Strain":"ひずみ","Clubs":"クラブ","Diamonds":"ダイヤモンド","Hearts":"ハート","Spades":"スペード","No trump":"切り札はない","Bid":"入札","Pass":"パス","Double":"ダブル","Redouble":"リダブル","No bid is available at that level.":"そのレベルでは入札ができません。","Declarer":"宣言者","Dummy":"ダミー","Opening leader":"オープニングリーダー","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"オープニングリードの後、ダミーが明らかになります。","Your hand":"あなたの手","Dummy hand":"ダミーハンド","Hidden hand":"隠し手","Current trick":"現在のトリック","Tricks won":"トリック獲得","Duplicate-style score":"重複スタイルのスコア","North–South total":"南北合計","East–West total":"東西合計","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"ハンド設定を選択してオークションを開始してください。","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"オークションが完了しました。オープニングリーダーが最初にプレイします。","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"4 パス: ボードはパスアウトされます。準備ができたら次のハンドを処理します。","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"締結された契約: {tricks} トリック、{side} の {score} ポイント。","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"契約がダウンしました: {tricks} のトリック、{score} は {side} を指します。","Hand result":"ハンド結果","Deal next hand":"次のハンドで取引する","New hand":"新しい手","Export score sheet":"スコアシートのエクスポート","Choose a legal call.":"法的な通話を選択してください。","Follow the led suit when you can.":"可能な限り、LEDスーツを追ってください。","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"コンピュータ プレーヤーは初心者レベルのローカル ルールを使用します。このデバイスからデータが送信されることはありません。","Rules reference":"ルールリファレンス","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"世界橋連盟 · 重複橋に関する法律 2017、法律 73 および 89 が 2024 年に更新"},"ko":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"계약 브리지 연습 게임","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"로컬 컴퓨터 플레이어를 상대로 온라인 계약 브리지 플레이","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"세 명의 초급 로컬 컴퓨터 플레이어를 상대로 중복 계약 브리지를 연습하세요. 입찰하고, 따라가고, 더미를 선언자로 제어하고 명확한 점수를 확인하세요. 온라인 멀티플레이어가 없습니다.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"세 명의 로컬 컴퓨터 플레이어를 상대로 계약 브리지의 완전한 핸드를 플레이하세요. 인터페이스 언어는 입찰 규칙이나 국가별 규칙을 선택하지 않습니다.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"카드, 입찰 및 점수는 이 브라우저에 유지됩니다. 이 게임은 계정, 업로드 또는 온라인 상대를 사용하지 않습니다.","One hand from deal to score":"딜에서 득점까지 한 손으로","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"경매는 4♣ 두 배로 종료됩니다. 선언하는 쪽은 10가지 트릭을 수행해야 합니다. 오프닝 리드는 플레이어로부터 선언자의 왼쪽으로 옵니다. 그 이후에는 더미가 표시되고 선언자는 양손에서 카드를 선택합니다.","A beginner practice version":"초보자 연습 버전","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"이것은 단일 테이블 중복 브리지 연습 손입니다. 합법적인 입찰 순서, 패스, 더블, 더블, 후속 플레이, 트럼프 비교, 선언자에 의한 더미 제어 및 핸드에 대한 중복 스타일 점수를 적용합니다. 내장된 컴퓨터 플레이어는 소규모의 자연스러운 스타터 계약을 사용합니다. 1NT는 균형 잡힌 15-17 하이 카드 포인트를 보여줍니다. 슈트 오프닝은 12포인트부터 시작됩니다. 응답과 오버콜은 의도적으로 기본입니다. 이러한 상대는 전문 브리지 소프트웨어가 아닌 연습용 로봇입니다. 토너먼트 판정, 경고, 파트너십 규칙 및 매치포인트 비교는 이 버전 외부에 있습니다.","Questions":"질문","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"이 고무다리인가요 아니면 중복다리인가요?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"복제 스타일 계약 점수를 사용하여 각 핸드에 개별적으로 점수를 매깁니다. 러버 브릿지처럼 부분 점수를 전달하지 않으며 결과를 다른 테이블과 비교하지 않습니다.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"컴퓨터 플레이어는 어떤 입찰 시스템을 사용합니까?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"초보자의 자연스러운 스타터 계약이 페이지에 표시됩니다. 어떤 인터페이스 언어를 선택하든 동일합니다. 이는 국가 브리지 시스템이나 완전한 토너먼트 컨벤션 카드가 아닙니다.","Can I play online with other people?":"다른 사람들과 온라인으로 플레이할 수 있나요?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"아니요. 한 사람이 세 명의 로컬 컴퓨터 플레이어를 상대로 South를 플레이합니다. 매치메이킹, 계정 또는 서버 게임이 없습니다.","How does the game score a hand?":"게임의 점수는 어떻게 매겨지나요?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"계약 레벨, 스트레인, 더블/리더블, 오버트릭 또는 언더트릭, 게임 또는 슬램 보너스를 기반으로 계약, 취약성, 필요한 트릭 및 중복 스타일 점수를 표시합니다.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"컴퓨터가 강력한 브리지 파트너처럼 작동합니까?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"아니요. 봇은 합법적인 호출과 플레이를 따르지만 간단한 초보자 경험적 방법을 사용합니다. 그들의 결정은 전문가의 입찰이나 카드 놀이의 모델이 아닙니다.","Scope and limitations":"범위 및 제한 사항","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"이것은 연습 테이블이지 온라인 브릿지 서비스, 토너먼트 디렉터 또는 전문 해결사가 아닙니다. 스타터 입찰 계약은 의도적으로 소규모이며 문서화됩니다. 중복 스타일의 핸드 스코어가 표시됩니다. 매치포인트, IMP, 러버 채점, 경고, 청구, 정정 취소 및 이사 판결은 구현되지 않습니다.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"완전한 복제 스타일 연습 손 1개. 당신은 항상 남쪽에 앉아 있습니다. 남북, 동서가 파트너입니다.","Starter bidding agreement":"스타터 입찰 계약","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"천연 초보자 동의: 1NT = 균형 잡힌 15-17 하이 카드 포인트; 슈트 오프닝은 12포인트부터 시작됩니다. 응답과 오버콜은 전문가의 조언이나 국가 시스템이 아닌 단순한 실천 경험적 방법입니다.","Vulnerability for this hand":"이 손의 취약점","Neither side vulnerable":"어느 쪽도 취약하지 않음","North–South vulnerable":"북-남 취약","East–West vulnerable":"동서 취약","Both sides vulnerable":"양쪽 모두 취약함","Dealer":"딜러","North":"북쪽","East":"동쪽","South · you":"남쪽 · 당신","West":"서쪽","North–South":"북-남","East–West":"동서","Hand":"손","Auction":"경매","Contract":"계약","To act":"행동하다","Your turn":"당신 차례입니다","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat}는 생각 중입니다…","Level":"레벨","Strain":"스트레인","Clubs":"클럽","Diamonds":"다이아몬드","Hearts":"하트","Spades":"스페이드","No trump":"트럼프는 안돼","Bid":"입찰","Pass":"패스","Double":"더블","Redouble":"리더블","No bid is available at that level.":"해당 수준에서는 입찰이 불가능합니다.","Declarer":"선언자","Dummy":"더미","Opening leader":"오프닝 리더","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"오프닝 리드 이후 더미가 공개됩니다.","Your hand":"당신의 손","Dummy hand":"더미 핸드","Hidden hand":"숨겨진 손","Current trick":"현재 트릭","Tricks won":"트릭 승리","Duplicate-style score":"복제 스타일 점수","North–South total":"북-남 합계","East–West total":"동서 합계","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"손 설정을 선택하고 경매를 시작하세요.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"경매가 완료되었습니다. 오프닝 리더가 먼저 플레이합니다.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"4번의 패스: 보드가 나갔습니다. 준비가 되면 다음 핸드를 딜하세요.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"계약 체결: {tricks} 트릭, {side}에 대한 {score} 포인트.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"계약이 중단되었습니다. {tricks} 트릭, {score}는 {side}를 가리킵니다.","Hand result":"손 결과","Deal next hand":"다음 거래","New hand":"새로운 손","Export score sheet":"점수 시트 내보내기","Choose a legal call.":"법적 통화를 선택하세요.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"가능하다면 LED 슈트를 따라가세요.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"컴퓨터 플레이어는 초급 수준의 로컬 규칙을 사용합니다. 이 기기에서 데이터가 유출되지 않습니다.","Rules reference":"규칙 참조","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"세계교량연맹 · 중복 교량 법칙 2017, 법률 73 및 89 업데이트 2024"},"id":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Game Latihan Jembatan Kontrak","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Mainkan Contract Bridge Online Melawan Pemain Komputer Lokal","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Latih jembatan kontrak duplikat melawan tiga pemain komputer lokal tingkat pemula. Tawaran, ikuti, kendalikan boneka sebagai deklarer dan lihat skor yang jelas. Tidak ada multipemain daring.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Mainkan satu tangan jembatan kontrak melawan tiga pemain komputer lokal. Bahasa antarmuka tidak pernah memilih konvensi penawaran atau aturan khusus negara.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Kartu, tawaran, dan skor tetap ada di browser ini. Permainan tidak menggunakan akun, upload atau lawan online.","One hand from deal to score":"Satu tangan dari kesepakatan hingga mencetak gol","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Lelang berakhir pada 4♠ dua kali lipat. Pihak yang menyatakan harus mengambil sepuluh trik; petunjuk pembuka berasal dari pemain di sebelah kiri deklarer. Setelah lead itu, dummy ditampilkan dan deklarer memilih kartu dari kedua tangan.","A beginner practice version":"Versi latihan pemula","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Ini adalah tangan latihan jembatan duplikat meja tunggal. Ini menerapkan perintah penawaran yang sah, operan, penggandaan, penggandaan ulang, permainan lanjutan, perbandingan truf, kontrol tiruan oleh deklarer dan skor gaya duplikat untuk tangan. Pemutar komputer internal menggunakan perjanjian awal kecil yang alami: 1NT menunjukkan 15–17 poin kartu tinggi yang seimbang; pembukaan setelan dimulai dari 12 poin; tanggapan dan panggilan berlebihan sengaja dibuat mendasar. Lawan-lawan ini adalah bot latihan, bukan perangkat lunak jembatan ahli. Keputusan turnamen, peringatan, konvensi kemitraan, dan perbandingan titik pertandingan berada di luar versi ini.","Questions":"Pertanyaan","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Apakah ini jembatan karet atau jembatan duplikat?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Ini menilai masing-masing tangan secara terpisah menggunakan penilaian kontrak gaya duplikat. Tabel ini tidak membawa skor bagian ke depan seperti halnya jembatan karet, dan tidak membandingkan hasil Anda dengan tabel lainnya.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Sistem penawaran apa yang digunakan pemain komputer?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Perjanjian pemula alami ditampilkan di halaman. Bahasa antarmuka apa pun yang Anda pilih sama saja; ini bukan sistem jembatan nasional atau kartu konvensi turnamen yang lengkap.","Can I play online with other people?":"Bisakah saya bermain online dengan orang lain?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Tidak. Satu orang bermain Selatan melawan tiga pemain komputer lokal. Tidak ada perjodohan, akun atau server permainan.","How does the game score a hand?":"Bagaimana skor permainannya?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Ini menunjukkan kontrak, kerentanan, trik yang diperlukan dan skor gaya duplikat berdasarkan level kontrak, ketegangan, double/redouble, overtrick atau undertrick, dan bonus game atau slam.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Apakah komputer bermain seperti mitra bridge yang kuat?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Tidak. Bot mengikuti panggilan dan permainan legal tetapi menggunakan heuristik pemula yang sederhana. Keputusan mereka bukanlah model penawaran ahli atau permainan kartu.","Scope and limitations":"Cakupan dan batasan","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Ini adalah meja latihan, bukan layanan jembatan online, direktur turnamen, atau pemecah ahli. Perjanjian penawaran awal sengaja dibuat kecil dan terdokumentasi. Skor tangan gaya duplikat ditampilkan; matchpoint, IMP, rubber scoring, alert, klaim, rektifikasi pencabutan dan keputusan direktur tidak dilaksanakan.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Satu tangan latihan gaya duplikat lengkap. Anda selalu duduk di Selatan; Utara–Selatan dan Timur–Barat merupakan mitra.","Starter bidding agreement":"Perjanjian penawaran awal","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Perjanjian pemula alami: 1NT = seimbang 15–17 poin kartu tinggi; pembukaan setelan dimulai pada 12 poin. Respons dan panggilan berlebih merupakan heuristik praktik sederhana, bukan saran ahli atau sistem nasional.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Kerentanan untuk tangan ini","Neither side vulnerable":"Tidak ada pihak yang rentan","North–South vulnerable":"Rentan Utara–Selatan","East–West vulnerable":"Rentan Timur-Barat","Both sides vulnerable":"Kedua belah pihak rentan","Dealer":"Dealer","North":"Utara","East":"Timur","South · you":"Selatan · Anda","West":"Barat","North–South":"Utara–Selatan","East–West":"Timur–Barat","Hand":"Tangan","Auction":"Lelang","Contract":"Kontrak","To act":"Untuk bertindak","Your turn":"Giliran Anda","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} sedang berpikir…","Level":"Tingkat","Strain":"Ketegangan","Clubs":"Klub","Diamonds":"Berlian","Hearts":"Hati","Spades":"Sekop","No trump":"Tidak ada truf","Bid":"Tawaran","Pass":"Lulus","Double":"Ganda","Redouble":"Gandakan","No bid is available at that level.":"Tidak ada tawaran yang tersedia pada level tersebut.","Declarer":"Deklarasi","Dummy":"Bodoh","Opening leader":"Pemimpin pembuka","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy terungkap setelah lead pembuka.","Your hand":"Tanganmu","Dummy hand":"Tangan tiruan","Hidden hand":"Tangan tersembunyi","Current trick":"Trik terkini","Tricks won":"Trik menang","Duplicate-style score":"Skor gaya duplikat","North–South total":"Total Utara–Selatan","East–West total":"Total Timur–Barat","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Pilih pengaturan tangan dan mulai pelelangan.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Lelang selesai. Pemimpin pembuka bermain lebih dulu.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Empat lintasan: papan dibagikan. Tangani tangan berikutnya jika sudah siap.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Kontrak dibuat: Trik {tricks}, poin {score} untuk {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Kontrak turun: Trik {tricks}, {score} menunjuk ke {side}.","Hand result":"Hasil tangan","Deal next hand":"Transaksi selanjutnya","New hand":"tangan baru","Export score sheet":"Ekspor lembar skor","Choose a legal call.":"Pilih panggilan resmi.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Ikuti setelan led bila Anda bisa.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Pemain komputer menggunakan aturan lokal tingkat pemula. Tidak ada data yang keluar dari perangkat ini.","Rules reference":"Referensi aturan","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Federasi Jembatan Dunia · Hukum Jembatan Duplikat 2017, Hukum 73 dan 89 diperbarui 2024"},"hi":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"कॉन्ट्रैक्ट ब्रिज प्रैक्टिस गेम","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"स्थानीय कंप्यूटर खिलाड़ियों के विरुद्ध कॉन्ट्रैक्ट ब्रिज ऑनलाइन खेलें","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"तीन शुरुआती स्तर के स्थानीय कंप्यूटर खिलाड़ियों के खिलाफ डुप्लिकेट कॉन्ट्रैक्ट ब्रिज का अभ्यास करें। बोली लगाएं, अनुसरण करें, घोषणाकर्ता के रूप में डमी को नियंत्रित करें और स्पष्ट स्कोर देखें। कोई ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेयर नहीं.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"तीन स्थानीय कंप्यूटर खिलाड़ियों के विरुद्ध कॉन्ट्रैक्ट ब्रिज का एक पूरा हाथ खेलें। इंटरफ़ेस भाषा कभी भी बोली-प्रक्रिया परंपरा या देश-विशिष्ट नियमों का चयन नहीं करती है।","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"कार्ड, बोलियाँ और स्कोर इस ब्राउज़र में रहते हैं। गेम किसी खाते, अपलोड या ऑनलाइन प्रतिद्वंद्वी का उपयोग नहीं करता है।","One hand from deal to score":"डील से स्कोर तक एक हाथ","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"नीलामी 4♠ दोगुनी में समाप्त होती है। घोषणा करने वाले पक्ष को दस तरकीबें अपनानी होंगी; शुरुआती बढ़त खिलाड़ी से घोषणाकर्ता के बाईं ओर आती है। उस लीड के बाद, डमी दिखाया जाता है और घोषणाकर्ता दोनों हाथों से कार्ड चुनता है।","A beginner practice version":"एक शुरुआती अभ्यास संस्करण","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"यह सिंगल-टेबल डुप्लिकेट-ब्रिज प्रैक्टिस हैंड है। यह कानूनी बोली आदेश, पास, डबल, रिडबल, फॉलो-सूट प्ले, ट्रम्प तुलना, घोषणाकर्ता द्वारा डमी नियंत्रण और हाथ के लिए डुप्लिकेट-स्टाइल स्कोर लागू करता है। अंतर्निर्मित कंप्यूटर प्लेयर एक छोटे प्राकृतिक स्टार्टर समझौते का उपयोग करते हैं: 1NT संतुलित 15-17 हाई-कार्ड अंक दिखाता है; सूट का उद्घाटन 12 बिंदुओं से शुरू होता है; प्रतिक्रियाएँ और ओवरकॉल जानबूझकर बुनियादी हैं। ये प्रतिद्वंद्वी अभ्यास बॉट हैं, विशेषज्ञ ब्रिज सॉफ़्टवेयर नहीं। टूर्नामेंट के फैसले, अलर्ट, साझेदारी परंपराएं और मैचपॉइंट तुलनाएं इस संस्करण के बाहर हैं।","Questions":"प्रश्न","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"क्या यह रबर पुल है या डुप्लीकेट पुल?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"यह डुप्लिकेट-शैली अनुबंध स्कोरिंग का उपयोग करके प्रत्येक हाथ को अलग से स्कोर करता है। यह रबर ब्रिज की तरह पार्ट-स्कोर को आगे नहीं ले जाता है, और यह आपके परिणाम की तुलना अन्य तालिकाओं से नहीं करता है।","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"कंप्यूटर खिलाड़ी किस बोली प्रणाली का उपयोग करते हैं?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"एक शुरुआती प्राकृतिक स्टार्टर समझौता पृष्ठ पर दिखाया गया है। आप जो भी इंटरफ़ेस भाषा चुनें, यह वही है; यह कोई राष्ट्रीय ब्रिज प्रणाली या संपूर्ण टूर्नामेंट कन्वेंशन कार्ड नहीं है।","Can I play online with other people?":"क्या मैं अन्य लोगों के साथ ऑनलाइन खेल सकता हूँ?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"नहीं। एक व्यक्ति तीन स्थानीय कंप्यूटर खिलाड़ियों के विरुद्ध साउथ खेलता है। कोई मंगनी, खाता या सर्वर गेम नहीं है।","How does the game score a hand?":"गेम में हैंड स्कोर कैसे होता है?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"यह अनुबंध, भेद्यता, आवश्यक चालें और अनुबंध स्तर, स्ट्रेन, डबल/रीडबल, ओवरट्रिक्स या अंडरट्रिक्स और गेम या स्लैम बोनस के आधार पर डुप्लिकेट-शैली स्कोर दिखाता है।","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"क्या कंप्यूटर एक मजबूत ब्रिज पार्टनर की तरह काम करता है?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"नहीं। बॉट कानूनी कॉल और नाटकों का पालन करते हैं लेकिन सरल शुरुआती अनुमानों का उपयोग करते हैं। उनके निर्णय विशेषज्ञ बोली या ताश के खेल का नमूना नहीं हैं।","Scope and limitations":"कार्यक्षेत्र और सीमाएँ","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"यह एक अभ्यास तालिका है, कोई ऑनलाइन ब्रिज सेवा, टूर्नामेंट निदेशक या विशेषज्ञ सॉल्वर नहीं। स्टार्टर बोली समझौता जानबूझकर छोटा और प्रलेखित है। डुप्लिकेट-शैली वाला हैंड स्कोर दिखाया गया है; मैचप्वाइंट, आईएमपी, रबर स्कोरिंग, अलर्ट, दावे, निरस्तीकरण सुधार और निदेशक निर्णय लागू नहीं किए जाते हैं।","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"एक पूर्ण डुप्लिकेट-शैली अभ्यास हाथ। आप सदैव दक्षिण की ओर बैठते हैं; उत्तर-दक्षिण और पूर्व-पश्चिम भागीदार हैं।","Starter bidding agreement":"स्टार्टर बोली समझौता","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"प्राकृतिक शुरुआती समझौता: 1NT = संतुलित 15-17 हाई-कार्ड अंक; एक सूट खोलना 12 बिंदुओं पर शुरू होता है। प्रतिक्रियाएँ और ओवरकॉल सरल अभ्यास अनुमान हैं, विशेषज्ञ सलाह या राष्ट्रीय प्रणाली नहीं।","Vulnerability for this hand":"इस हाथ के लिए भेद्यता","Neither side vulnerable":"कोई भी पक्ष असुरक्षित नहीं","North–South vulnerable":"उत्तर-दक्षिण असुरक्षित","East–West vulnerable":"पूर्व-पश्चिम असुरक्षित","Both sides vulnerable":"दोनों पक्ष असुरक्षित","Dealer":"डीलर","North":"उत्तर","East":"पूर्व","South · you":"दक्षिण·आप","West":"पश्चिम","North–South":"उत्तर-दक्षिण","East–West":"पूर्व-पश्चिम","Hand":"हाथ","Auction":"नीलामी","Contract":"अनुबंध","To act":"कार्य करने के लिए","Your turn":"आपकी बारी","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} सोच रहा है...","Level":"स्तर","Strain":"स्ट्रेन","Clubs":"क्लब","Diamonds":"हीरे","Hearts":"दिल","Spades":"हुकुम","No trump":"कोई ट्रम्प नहीं","Bid":"बोली","Pass":"पास","Double":"डबल","Redouble":"दोगुना","No bid is available at that level.":"उस स्तर पर कोई बोली उपलब्ध नहीं है।","Declarer":"घोषणाकर्ता","Dummy":"डमी","Opening leader":"ओपनिंग लीडर","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"शुरुआती बढ़त के बाद डमी का खुलासा हुआ।","Your hand":"आपका हाथ","Dummy hand":"डमी हाथ","Hidden hand":"छिपा हुआ हाथ","Current trick":"वर्तमान चाल","Tricks won":"ट्रिक्स जीत गए","Duplicate-style score":"डुप्लिकेट-शैली स्कोर","North–South total":"उत्तर-दक्षिण कुल","East–West total":"पूर्व-पश्चिम कुल","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"हैंड सेटिंग चुनें और नीलामी शुरू करें।","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"नीलामी पूरी। शुरुआती नेता पहले खेलता है।","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"चार पास: बोर्ड पास आउट हो गया है। तैयार होने पर अगला सौदा करें।","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"अनुबंध बनाया गया: {tricks} ट्रिक्स, {side} के लिए {score} अंक।","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"अनुबंध ख़त्म हो गया: {tricks} युक्तियाँ, {score} {side} की ओर इशारा करता है।","Hand result":"हाथ परिणाम","Deal next hand":"अगले हाथ डील","New hand":"नया हाथ","Export score sheet":"निर्यात स्कोर शीट","Choose a legal call.":"एक कानूनी कॉल चुनें।","Follow the led suit when you can.":"जब संभव हो तो एलईडी सूट का पालन करें।","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"कंप्यूटर प्लेयर शुरुआती स्तर के स्थानीय नियमों का उपयोग करते हैं। इस डिवाइस से कोई डेटा नहीं छूटता.","Rules reference":"नियम संदर्भ","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"वर्ल्ड ब्रिज फेडरेशन · डुप्लीकेट ब्रिज के कानून 2017, कानून 73 और 89 अद्यतन 2024"},"ar":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"لعبة ممارسة جسر العقد","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"العب Contract Bridge عبر الإنترنت ضد لاعبي الكمبيوتر المحليين","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"تدرب على يد جسر العقد المكرر ضد ثلاثة لاعبين محليين على الكمبيوتر على مستوى المبتدئين. قم بالمزايدة، واتبع نفس الشيء، وتحكم في الدمية كمعلن وشاهد نتيجة واضحة. لا يوجد لاعبين متعددين عبر الإنترنت.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"العب يد واحدة كاملة من جسر العقد ضد ثلاثة لاعبين محليين على الكمبيوتر. لا تحدد لغة الواجهة مطلقًا اتفاقية تقديم العطاءات أو القواعد الخاصة بكل بلد.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"تبقى البطاقات وعروض الأسعار والنتائج في هذا المتصفح. لا تستخدم اللعبة حسابًا أو تحميلًا أو خصمًا عبر الإنترنت.","One hand from deal to score":"يد واحدة من الصفقة للتسجيل","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"ينتهي المزاد بـ 4♠ مضاعفة. يجب على الجانب المُعلن أن يأخذ عشر حيل؛ تأتي المقدمة الافتتاحية من اللاعب الموجود على يسار المعلن. بعد ذلك، تظهر الدمية ويختار المُعلن البطاقات من كلتا يديه.","A beginner practice version":"إصدار تدريبي للمبتدئين","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"هذه يد تدريب على الجسر المكرر بجدول واحد. إنه يطبق أمر المزايدة القانوني، والتمرير، والمضاعفة، والمضاعفة، واللعب المتابع، والمقارنة بين الأوراق الرابحة، والتحكم الوهمي بواسطة المعلن، والنتيجة المكررة لليد. تستخدم مشغلات الكمبيوتر المدمجة اتفاقية بداية طبيعية صغيرة: يُظهر 1NT 15-17 نقطة عالية البطاقة متوازنة؛ تبدأ فتحات البدلة عند 12 نقطة؛ الاستجابات والمكالمات الزائدة أساسية بشكل متعمد. هؤلاء المعارضون هم روبوتات تدريب، وليسوا برامج جسر متخصصة. أحكام البطولة والتنبيهات واتفاقيات الشراكة ومقارنات نقاط المباراة خارج هذا الإصدار.","Questions":"الأسئلة","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"هل هذا الجسر المطاطي أم جسر مكرر؟","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"يسجل كل توزيع ورق بشكل منفصل باستخدام أسلوب تسجيل العقد المكرر. فهو لا ينقل درجات الأجزاء إلى الأمام كما يفعل الجسر المطاطي، ولا يقارن نتائجك بالجداول الأخرى.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"ما هو نظام المزايدة الذي يستخدمه لاعبو الكمبيوتر؟","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"يتم عرض اتفاقية البدء الطبيعية للمبتدئين على الصفحة. إنها نفس لغة الواجهة التي تختارها؛ إنه ليس نظام جسر وطني أو بطاقة مؤتمر بطولة كاملة.","Can I play online with other people?":"هل يمكنني اللعب عبر الإنترنت مع أشخاص آخرين؟","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"لا. يلعب شخص واحد الجنوب ضد ثلاثة لاعبين محليين على الكمبيوتر. لا توجد لعبة التوفيق أو الحساب أو الخادم.","How does the game score a hand?":"كيف تسجل اللعبة توزيع ورق؟","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"يُظهر العقد، والضعف، والحيل المطلوبة، والنتيجة ذات النمط المكرر بناءً على مستوى العقد، والضغط، والمضاعفة/المضاعفة، والحيل الفوقية أو الخدعة السفلية، ومكافآت اللعبة أو البطولات الأربع الكبرى.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"هل يلعب الكمبيوتر كشريك جسر قوي؟","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"لا. تتبع الروبوتات المكالمات والمسرحيات القانونية ولكنها تستخدم استدلالات بسيطة للمبتدئين. إن قراراتهم ليست نموذجًا لعطاءات الخبراء أو لعب الورق.","Scope and limitations":"النطاق والقيود","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"هذا جدول تدريب، وليس خدمة جسر عبر الإنترنت أو مدير دورة أو خبير حل. إن اتفاقية المزايدة المبدئية صغيرة وموثقة عن عمد. تظهر نتيجة اليد بنمط مكرر؛ لا يتم تنفيذ نقاط المباراة، وIMPs، والتسجيل المطاطي، والتنبيهات، والمطالبات، وإلغاء التصحيحات وأحكام المدير.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"يد تدريب كاملة بنمط مكرر. أنت دائما تجلس في الجنوب. الشمال والجنوب والشرق والغرب شركاء.","Starter bidding agreement":"اتفاقية المزايدة المبدئية","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"اتفاقية المبتدئين الطبيعية: 1NT = 15-17 نقطة عالية البطاقة متوازنة؛ يبدأ افتتاح الدعوى عند 12 نقطة. إن الاستجابات والمكالمات الزائدة هي ممارسات استدلالية بسيطة، وليست مشورة خبراء أو نظامًا وطنيًا.","Vulnerability for this hand":"ثغرة أمنية لهذه اليد","Neither side vulnerable":"لا يوجد أي جانب عرضة للخطر","North–South vulnerable":"معرض للخطر بين الشمال والجنوب","East–West vulnerable":"معرض للخطر بين الشرق والغرب","Both sides vulnerable":"كلا الجانبين عرضة للخطر","Dealer":"التاجر","North":"الشمال","East":"الشرق","South · you":"الجنوب · أنت","West":"الغرب","North–South":"الشمال-الجنوب","East–West":"الشرق والغرب","Hand":"اليد","Auction":"مزاد","Contract":"العقد","To act":"للتصرف","Your turn":"دورك","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} يفكر...","Level":"المستوى","Strain":"سلالة","Clubs":"النوادي","Diamonds":"الماس","Hearts":"قلوب","Spades":"البستوني","No trump":"لا ورقة رابحة","Bid":"المزايدة","Pass":"تمرير","Double":"مزدوج","Redouble":"مضاعف","No bid is available at that level.":"لا يوجد عرض متاح عند هذا المستوى.","Declarer":"المعلن","Dummy":"دمية","Opening leader":"زعيم الافتتاح","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"يتم الكشف عن الدمية بعد فتح الرصاص.","Your hand":"يدك","Dummy hand":"يد وهمية","Hidden hand":"اليد المخفية","Current trick":"الخدعة الحالية","Tricks won":"الفوز بالحيل","Duplicate-style score":"نتيجة النمط المكرر","North–South total":"مجموع الشمال والجنوب","East–West total":"إجمالي الشرق والغرب","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"اختر إعداد اليد وابدأ المزاد.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"اكتمل المزاد. يلعب القائد الافتتاحي أولاً.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"أربع تمريرات: تم تمرير اللوحة. تعامل مع توزيع الورق التالي عندما تكون جاهزًا.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"العقد المبرم: حيل {tricks}، نقاط {score} لـ {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"سقط العقد: حيل {tricks}، يشير {score} إلى {side}.","Hand result":"نتيجة اليد","Deal next hand":"الصفقة التالية","New hand":"يد جديدة","Export score sheet":"تصدير ورقة النتيجة","Choose a legal call.":"اختر مكالمة قانونية.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"اتبع بدلة LED عندما تستطيع.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"يستخدم مشغلو الكمبيوتر القواعد المحلية على مستوى المبتدئين. لا توجد بيانات تترك هذا الجهاز.","Rules reference":"مرجع القواعد","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"الاتحاد العالمي للجسور · قوانين الجسور المكررة لعام 2017، تم تحديث القانونين 73 و89 عام 2024"},"zh":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"合约桥牌练习游戏","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"与本地电脑玩家在线玩合约桥牌","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"与三位初级本地电脑玩家练习一手重复合约桥牌。叫牌、跟牌、作为庄家控制假人并看到清晰的比分。没有在线多人游戏。","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"与三名本地电脑玩家玩一手完整的合约桥牌。界面语言从不选择投标惯例或特定于国家/地区的规则。","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"牌、叫价和分数保留在此浏览器中。游戏不使用帐户、上传或在线对手。","One hand from deal to score":"从发牌到得分的一手牌","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"拍卖以4♠双倍结束。宣告方必须采取十招；开局领先者来自庄家左侧的玩家。领先之后，明手出示，庄家从双手中选择牌。","A beginner practice version":"初学者练习版","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"这是单桌复桥练习手牌。它适用于合法的叫牌顺序、传牌、加倍、加倍、跟牌、王牌比较、庄家假人控制以及该手牌的重复式得分。内置电脑玩家使用小自然起始协议：1NT显示平衡的15-17高牌点；花色开盘时间为 12 点；回应和叫喊故意是基本的。这些对手是练习机器人，而不是专家桥接软件。锦标赛裁决、警报、合作伙伴约定和赛点比较均不属于此版本。","Questions":"问题","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"这是橡胶桥还是复制桥？","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"它使用重复式合同评分对每手牌进行单独评分。它不会像橡皮桥那样将部分分数向前推进，也不会将您的结果与其他表格进行比较。","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"电脑玩家使用什么叫牌系统？","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"页面上显示了初学者自然入门协议。无论您选择哪种界面语言都是相同的；它不是国家桥牌系统或完整的锦标赛大会卡。","Can I play online with other people?":"我可以和其他人一起在线玩吗？","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"号一个人与三名本地电脑玩家对战南方。没有配对、帐户或服务器游戏。","How does the game score a hand?":"游戏如何得分一手？","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"它显示合同、漏洞、所需的技巧以及基于合同级别、紧张、加倍/加倍、过度技巧或不足技巧以及游戏或大满贯奖金的重复式分数。","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"电脑玩得像一个强大的桥牌搭档吗？","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"编号这些机器人遵循法律要求并进行游戏，但使用简单的初学者启发法。他们的决定不是专家竞价或纸牌游戏的模式。","Scope and limitations":"范围和限制","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"这是一个练习台，不是在线桥牌服务、锦标赛总监或专家解算器。起始投标协议故意很小并记录在案。显示重复式手牌分数；赛点、IMP、橡皮计分、警报、索赔、撤销整改和总监裁决均未执行。","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"一套完整的复式练习手。你总是坐在南边；南北和东西方是合作伙伴。","Starter bidding agreement":"启动投标协议","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"自然新手协议：1NT=平衡15-17高卡点；一套花色从 12 点开始开始。回应和叫喊是简单的实践启发法，而不是专家建议或国家制度。","Vulnerability for this hand":"这手牌的漏洞","Neither side vulnerable":"双方都脆弱","North–South vulnerable":"南北易受影响","East–West vulnerable":"东西方脆弱","Both sides vulnerable":"双方都脆弱","Dealer":"经销商","North":"北","East":"东","South · you":"南·你","West":"西","North–South":"南北","East–West":"东-西","Hand":"手","Auction":"拍卖","Contract":"合约","To act":"行动","Your turn":"轮到你了","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} 正在思考……","Level":"水平仪","Strain":"应变","Clubs":"球杆","Diamonds":"钻石","Hearts":"红心","Spades":"黑桃","No trump":"无王牌","Bid":"出价","Pass":"通过","Double":"双","Redouble":"加倍","No bid is available at that level.":"该级别没有可用的出价。","Declarer":"声明者","Dummy":"假人","Opening leader":"开场领袖","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"假人在开场领先后揭晓。","Your hand":"你的手","Dummy hand":"假手","Hidden hand":"隐藏之手","Current trick":"当前伎俩","Tricks won":"获胜技巧","Duplicate-style score":"复制式乐谱","North–South total":"南北总","East–West total":"东-西总计","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"选择手型设置并开始拍卖。","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"拍卖完成。开局领先者先行。","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"四次通过：板子通过。准备好后发下一手牌。","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"合约制作：{tricks}花样，{score}积分为{side}。","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"合约下：{tricks}花样，{score}指向{side}。","Hand result":"手牌结果","Deal next hand":"下一手牌","New hand":"新手","Export score sheet":"导出评分表","Choose a legal call.":"选择合法的呼叫。","Follow the led suit when you can.":"尽可能跟随领导的套装。","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"电脑玩家使用初级本地规则。没有数据离开该设备。","Rules reference":"规则参考","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"世界桥梁联合会·重复桥梁法 2017 年，第 73 条和第 89 条于 2024 年更新"},"bn":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"কন্ট্রাক্ট ব্রিজ প্র্যাকটিস গেম","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"স্থানীয় কম্পিউটার প্লেয়ারদের বিরুদ্ধে অনলাইনে চুক্তির সেতু খেলুন","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"তিনজন শিক্ষানবিস-স্তরের স্থানীয় কম্পিউটার প্লেয়ারের বিরুদ্ধে ডুপ্লিকেট চুক্তি সেতুর অনুশীলন করুন। বিড করুন, মামলা অনুসরণ করুন, ঘোষণাকারী হিসাবে ডামি নিয়ন্ত্রণ করুন এবং একটি পরিষ্কার স্কোর দেখুন। কোনো অনলাইন মাল্টিপ্লেয়ার নেই।","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"তিনটি স্থানীয় কম্পিউটার প্লেয়ারের বিরুদ্ধে চুক্তি সেতুর একটি সম্পূর্ণ হাত খেলুন। ইন্টারফেস ভাষা কখনই একটি বিডিং কনভেনশন বা দেশ-নির্দিষ্ট নিয়ম নির্বাচন করে না।","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"কার্ড, বিড এবং স্কোর এই ব্রাউজারেই থাকে। গেমটি একটি অ্যাকাউন্ট, আপলোড বা অনলাইন প্রতিপক্ষ ব্যবহার করে না।","One hand from deal to score":"ডিল থেকে স্কোর করতে এক হাত","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"4♠ দ্বিগুণে নিলাম শেষ হয়৷ ঘোষণাকারী পক্ষকে দশটি কৌশল নিতে হবে; ওপেনিং লিড প্লেয়ার থেকে ডিক্লেয়ারের বাম দিকে আসে। সেই সীসার পরে, ডামি দেখানো হয় এবং ঘোষণাকারী উভয় হাত থেকে কার্ড বেছে নেয়।","A beginner practice version":"একটি শিক্ষানবিস অনুশীলন সংস্করণ","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"এটি একটি একক-টেবিল ডুপ্লিকেট-ব্রিজ অনুশীলনের হাত। এটি আইনি বিড অর্ডার, পাস, ডাবল, রিডাবল, ফলো-স্যুট প্লে, ট্রাম্প তুলনা, ঘোষণাকারীর দ্বারা ডামি নিয়ন্ত্রণ এবং হাতের জন্য একটি ডুপ্লিকেট-স্টাইল স্কোর প্রযোজ্য। অন্তর্নির্মিত কম্পিউটার প্লেয়াররা একটি ছোট প্রাকৃতিক স্টার্টার চুক্তি ব্যবহার করে: 1NT একটি সুষম 15-17 হাই-কার্ড পয়েন্ট দেখায়; স্যুট খোলার শুরু 12 পয়েন্টে; প্রতিক্রিয়া এবং overcalls ইচ্ছাকৃতভাবে মৌলিক. এই বিরোধীরা অনুশীলন বট, বিশেষজ্ঞ ব্রিজ সফ্টওয়্যার নয়। টুর্নামেন্টের নিয়ম, সতর্কতা, অংশীদারিত্বের নিয়মাবলী এবং ম্যাচপয়েন্ট তুলনা এই সংস্করণের বাইরে।","Questions":"প্রশ্ন","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"এটি কি রাবার ব্রিজ নাকি ডুপ্লিকেট ব্রিজ?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"এটি ডুপ্লিকেট-স্টাইল চুক্তি স্কোরিং ব্যবহার করে প্রতিটি হাত আলাদাভাবে স্কোর করে। এটি রাবার ব্রিজের মতো পার্ট-স্কোরকে এগিয়ে নিয়ে যায় না এবং এটি অন্যান্য টেবিলের সাথে আপনার ফলাফলের তুলনা করে না।","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"কম্পিউটার প্লেয়াররা কোন বিডিং সিস্টেম ব্যবহার করে?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"একটি প্রাথমিক প্রাকৃতিক স্টার্টার চুক্তি পৃষ্ঠায় দেখানো হয়েছে৷ আপনি যে কোন ইন্টারফেস ভাষা চয়ন করুন এটি একই; এটি একটি জাতীয় সেতু সিস্টেম বা একটি সম্পূর্ণ টুর্নামেন্ট কনভেনশন কার্ড নয়।","Can I play online with other people?":"আমি কি অন্য লোকেদের সাথে অনলাইনে খেলতে পারি?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"না। একজন লোক তিনজন স্থানীয় কম্পিউটার প্লেয়ারের বিরুদ্ধে দক্ষিণে খেলে। কোন ম্যাচমেকিং, অ্যাকাউন্ট বা সার্ভার গেম নেই।","How does the game score a hand?":"গেমটি কিভাবে একটি হাত স্কোর করে?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"এটি চুক্তি, দুর্বলতা, প্রয়োজনীয় কৌশল এবং চুক্তির স্তর, স্ট্রেন, ডাবল/ডাবল, ওভারট্রিক বা আন্ডারট্রিক্স এবং গেম বা স্ল্যাম বোনাসের উপর ভিত্তি করে একটি ডুপ্লিকেট-স্টাইল স্কোর দেখায়।","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"কম্পিউটার কি একটি শক্তিশালী ব্রিজ পার্টনারের মতো খেলে?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"না। বটগুলি আইনি কল এবং নাটকগুলি অনুসরণ করে তবে সাধারণ শিক্ষানবিস হিউরিস্টিক ব্যবহার করে। তাদের সিদ্ধান্ত বিশেষজ্ঞ বিডিং বা কার্ড খেলার মডেল নয়।","Scope and limitations":"পরিধি এবং সীমাবদ্ধতা","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"এটি একটি অনুশীলন টেবিল, একটি অনলাইন সেতু পরিষেবা, টুর্নামেন্ট পরিচালক বা বিশেষজ্ঞ সমাধানকারী নয়৷ স্টার্টার বিডিং চুক্তিটি ইচ্ছাকৃতভাবে ছোট এবং নথিভুক্ত। ডুপ্লিকেট-স্টাইলের হাতের স্কোর দেখানো হয়েছে; ম্যাচপয়েন্ট, আইএমপি, রাবার স্কোরিং, সতর্কতা, দাবি, প্রত্যাহার সংশোধন এবং পরিচালকের রায় কার্যকর করা হয় না।","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"একটি সম্পূর্ণ ডুপ্লিকেট-স্টাইল অনুশীলনের হাত। তুমি সর্বদা দক্ষিণে বসো; উত্তর-দক্ষিণ এবং পূর্ব-পশ্চিম অংশীদার।","Starter bidding agreement":"স্টার্টার বিডিং চুক্তি","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"প্রাকৃতিক শিক্ষানবিস চুক্তি: 1NT = ভারসাম্যপূর্ণ 15-17 হাই-কার্ড পয়েন্ট; একটি স্যুট খোলার শুরু হয় 12 পয়েন্টে। প্রতিক্রিয়া এবং ওভারকলগুলি হল সাধারণ অনুশীলন হিউরিস্টিক, বিশেষজ্ঞের পরামর্শ বা জাতীয় ব্যবস্থা নয়।","Vulnerability for this hand":"এই হাতের জন্য দুর্বলতা","Neither side vulnerable":"কোন পক্ষই দুর্বল নয়","North–South vulnerable":"উত্তর-দক্ষিণ অরক্ষিত","East–West vulnerable":"পূর্ব-পশ্চিম ঝুঁকিপূর্ণ","Both sides vulnerable":"উভয় পক্ষই দুর্বল","Dealer":"বিক্রেতা","North":"উত্তর","East":"পূর্ব","South · you":"দক্ষিণ · আপনি","West":"পশ্চিম","North–South":"উত্তর-দক্ষিণ","East–West":"পূর্ব-পশ্চিম","Hand":"হাত","Auction":"নিলাম","Contract":"চুক্তি","To act":"অভিনয় করতে","Your turn":"আপনার পালা","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} ভাবছে…","Level":"লেভেল","Strain":"স্ট্রেন","Clubs":"ক্লাব","Diamonds":"হীরা","Hearts":"হার্টস","Spades":"স্পেডস","No trump":"নো ট্রাম্প","Bid":"বিড","Pass":"পাস","Double":"ডাবল","Redouble":"দুবার","No bid is available at that level.":"এই স্তরে কোন বিড উপলব্ধ নেই।","Declarer":"ঘোষনাকারী","Dummy":"ডামি","Opening leader":"উদ্বোধনী নেতা","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"উদ্বোধনী লিডের পরে ডামি প্রকাশ করা হয়।","Your hand":"আপনার হাত","Dummy hand":"ডামি হাত","Hidden hand":"লুকানো হাত","Current trick":"বর্তমান কৌশল","Tricks won":"কৌশল জিতেছে","Duplicate-style score":"ডুপ্লিকেট-স্টাইল স্কোর","North–South total":"উত্তর-দক্ষিণ মোট","East–West total":"পূর্ব-পশ্চিম মোট","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"একটি হাতের সেটিং বেছে নিন এবং নিলাম শুরু করুন।","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"নিলাম সম্পূর্ণ। উদ্বোধনী নেতা প্রথমে খেলেন।","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"চারটি পাস: বোর্ড পাস করা হয়েছে। প্রস্তুত হলে পরবর্তী হাত ডিল.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"চুক্তি করা হয়েছে: {tricks} কৌশল, {side} এর জন্য {score} পয়েন্ট।","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"চুক্তি কমে গেছে: {tricks} কৌশল, {score} পয়েন্ট {side}।","Hand result":"হাতের ফলাফল","Deal next hand":"পরবর্তীতে ডিল করুন","New hand":"নতুন হাত","Export score sheet":"স্কোর শীট রপ্তানি করুন","Choose a legal call.":"একটি আইনি কল চয়ন করুন৷","Follow the led suit when you can.":"আপনি যখন পারেন তখন নেতৃত্বাধীন স্যুটটি অনুসরণ করুন।","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"কম্পিউটার প্লেয়াররা শিক্ষানবিস-স্তরের স্থানীয় নিয়ম ব্যবহার করে। এই ডিভাইস থেকে কোনো ডেটা নেই।","Rules reference":"নিয়ম রেফারেন্স","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"ওয়ার্ল্ড ব্রিজ ফেডারেশন · ডুপ্লিকেট ব্রিজের আইন 2017, আইন 73 এবং 89 আপডেট করা হয়েছে 2024"},"ru":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Тренировочная игра по контрактному мосту","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Играйте в Contract Bridge онлайн против игроков с локального компьютера","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Потренируйтесь в розыгрыше дублирующего контракта с тремя местными компьютерными игроками начального уровня. Делайте ставки, следуйте их примеру, управляйте манекеном в качестве разыгрывающего и получайте чистый результат. Никакого онлайн-мультиплеера.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Сыграйте одну полную раздачу в контрактный бридж против трех местных компьютерных игроков. Язык интерфейса никогда не выбирает соглашение о торгах или правила, специфичные для конкретной страны.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Карточки, ставки и результаты остаются в этом браузере. В игре не используется учетная запись, загрузка или онлайн-противник.","One hand from deal to score":"Одна рука от раздачи до гола","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Аукцион закончится через 4♠ удвоения. Заявляющая сторона должна взять десять взяток; первый ход исходит от игрока слева от разыгрывающего. После этого хода показывается манекен, и разыгрывающий выбирает карты из обеих рук.","A beginner practice version":"Версия для начинающих","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Это тренировочная раздача с дублирующим мостом за одним столом. Он применяет законный порядок ставок, пас, дабл, редубл, игру по следующей масти, сравнение козырей, контроль фиктивного игрока со стороны разыгрывающего и дублирующий счет за руку. Встроенные компьютерные игроки используют небольшое естественное стартовое соглашение: 1NT показывает сбалансированные 15–17 очков старших карт; отверстия костюма начинаются с 12 очков; ответы и дополнительные призывы намеренно носят базовый характер. Эти оппоненты — тренировочные боты, а не экспертное программное обеспечение для мостов. Правила турниров, оповещения, соглашения о партнерстве и сравнения очков выходят за рамки этой версии.","Questions":"Вопросы","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Это резиновый мост или двойной мост?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Она оценивает каждую руку отдельно, используя дублирующийся контракт. Он не переносит частичные баллы вперед, как это делает резиновый мост, и не сравнивает ваш результат с другими таблицами.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Какую систему ставок используют компьютерные игроки?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"На странице показано стартовое соглашение для начинающих. Какой бы язык интерфейса вы ни выбрали, он один и тот же; это не национальная бридж-система или полноценная турнирная карта.","Can I play online with other people?":"Могу ли я играть онлайн с другими людьми?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Нет. Один человек играет на Юге против трех местных компьютерных игроков. Здесь нет подбора игроков, аккаунта или серверной игры.","How does the game score a hand?":"Как в игре засчитывается рука?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Он показывает контракт, уязвимость, необходимые трюки и дублирующийся счет, основанный на уровне контракта, напряжении, двойном/редабле, дополнительных или недостаточных трюках, а также бонусах игры или удара.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Компьютер играет роль сильного партнера по бриджу?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Нет. Боты следят за законными вызовами и играми, но используют простую эвристику для начинающих. Их решения не являются образцом экспертных торгов или карточной игры.","Scope and limitations":"Область применения и ограничения","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Это тренировочный стол, а не онлайн-сервис бриджей, директор турниров или экспертный решатель. Соглашение о стартовых торгах намеренно маленькое и документально оформлено. Показан счет раздачи в дублирующем стиле; матчпойнты, IMP, резиновые подсчеты очков, предупреждения, претензии, исправления по отзывам и решения директоров не выполняются.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Одна полная копия тренировочной руки. Ты всегда сидишь на юге; Север-Юг и Восток-Запад – партнеры.","Starter bidding agreement":"Договор о стартовых торгах","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Естественное соглашение новичка: 1NT = сбалансировано 15–17 очков старших карт; открытие костюма начинается с 12 очков. Ответы и дополнительные звонки — это простая практическая эвристика, а не экспертные рекомендации или национальная система.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Уязвимость этой руки","Neither side vulnerable":"Ни одна из сторон не уязвима","North–South vulnerable":"Север-Юг уязвим","East–West vulnerable":"Восток-Запад уязвим","Both sides vulnerable":"Обе стороны уязвимы","Dealer":"Дилер","North":"Север","East":"Восток","South · you":"Юг · ты","West":"Запад","North–South":"Север – Юг","East–West":"Восток-Запад","Hand":"Рука","Auction":"Аукцион","Contract":"Контракт","To act":"Действовать","Your turn":"Твоя очередь","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} думает…","Level":"Уровень","Strain":"Штамм","Clubs":"Клубы","Diamonds":"Бриллианты","Hearts":"Сердца","Spades":"Пики","No trump":"Нет козыря","Bid":"Ставка","Pass":"Пройти","Double":"Двойной","Redouble":"Двойной","No bid is available at that level.":"На этом уровне ставок нет.","Declarer":"Объявитель","Dummy":"Манекен","Opening leader":"Открывающий лидер","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Манекен показан после вступительного слова.","Your hand":"Ваша рука","Dummy hand":"Макет руки","Hidden hand":"Скрытая рука","Current trick":"Текущий трюк","Tricks won":"Трюки выиграны","Duplicate-style score":"Двойная партитура","North–South total":"Север – Юг, всего","East–West total":"Восток-Запад, всего","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Выберите настройку руки и начните аукцион.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Аукцион завершен. Первым играет первый лидер.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Четыре прохода: доска отключена. Раздайте следующую руку, когда будете готовы.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Контракт заключен: трюки {tricks}, очки {score} за {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Контракт разорван: трюки {tricks}, {score} указывает на {side}.","Hand result":"Результат раздачи","Deal next hand":"Сделка в следующей раздаче","New hand":"Новая рука","Export score sheet":"Экспорт оценочного листа","Choose a legal call.":"Выберите законный вызов.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Следуйте за костюмом светодиода, когда сможете.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Компьютерные игроки используют местные правила начального уровня. Никакие данные не покидают это устройство.","Rules reference":"Справочник правил","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Всемирная федерация бриджа · Законы о дублированных мостах 2017 г., Законы 73 и 89 обновлены в 2024 г."},"ur":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"کنٹریکٹ برج پریکٹس گیم","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"مقامی کمپیوٹر پلیئرز کے خلاف کنٹریکٹ برج آن لائن کھیلیں\nیو بی جی002 ایکس بولی لگائیں، سوٹ کی پیروی کریں، ڈمی کو بطور ڈیکلر کنٹرول کریں اور واضح سکور دیکھیں۔ کوئی آن لائن ملٹی پلیئر نہیں۔","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"تین ابتدائی سطح کے مقامی کمپیوٹر پلیئرز کے خلاف ڈپلیکیٹ کنٹریکٹ برج کی مشق کریں۔ بولی لگائیں، سوٹ کی پیروی کریں، ڈمی کو بطور ڈیکلر کنٹرول کریں اور واضح سکور دیکھیں۔ کوئی آن لائن ملٹی پلیئر نہیں۔","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"تین مقامی کمپیوٹر پلیئرز کے خلاف کنٹریکٹ برج کا ایک مکمل ہاتھ کھیلیں۔ انٹرفیس کی زبان کبھی بھی بولی لگانے کے کنونشن یا ملک کے مخصوص اصولوں کا انتخاب نہیں کرتی ہے۔","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"کارڈز، بولیاں اور اسکور اس براؤزر میں رہتے ہیں۔ گیم اکاؤنٹ، اپ لوڈ یا آن لائن مخالف استعمال نہیں کرتا ہے۔","One hand from deal to score":"ڈیل سے اسکور تک ایک ہاتھ","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"نیلامی 4♠ دوگنی میں ختم ہوتی ہے۔ اعلان کرنے والے فریق کو دس چالیں چلنی چاہئیں۔ ابتدائی برتری کھلاڑی سے اعلان کنندہ کے بائیں طرف آتی ہے۔ اس لیڈ کے بعد، ڈمی دکھایا جاتا ہے اور اعلان کنندہ دونوں ہاتھوں سے کارڈ کا انتخاب کرتا ہے۔","A beginner practice version":"ایک ابتدائی پریکٹس ورژن","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"یہ سنگل ٹیبل ڈپلیکیٹ برج پریکٹس ہینڈ ہے۔ اس میں قانونی بولی آرڈر، پاس، ڈبل، ریڈبل، فالو سوٹ پلے، ٹرمپ کا موازنہ، ڈیکلر کے ذریعے ڈمی کنٹرول اور ہاتھ کے لیے ڈپلیکیٹ طرز کا سکور لاگو ہوتا ہے۔ بلٹ ان کمپیوٹر پلیئرز ایک چھوٹا سا قدرتی اسٹارٹر معاہدہ استعمال کرتے ہیں: 1NT ایک متوازن 15-17 ہائی کارڈ پوائنٹس دکھاتا ہے۔ سوٹ کا آغاز 12 پوائنٹس سے ہوتا ہے۔ جوابات اور اوور کالز جان بوجھ کر بنیادی ہیں۔ یہ مخالفین پریکٹس بوٹس ہیں، ماہر برج سافٹ ویئر نہیں۔ ٹورنامنٹ کے احکام، انتباہات، شراکت داری کنونشنز اور میچ پوائنٹ کے موازنہ اس ورژن سے باہر ہیں۔","Questions":"سوالات","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"کیا یہ ربڑ کا پل ہے یا ڈپلیکیٹ پل؟","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"یہ ربڑ برج کی طرح پارٹ اسکور کو آگے نہیں لے جاتا ہے، اور یہ آپ کے نتائج کا دوسرے ٹیبلز سے موازنہ نہیں کرتا ہے۔","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"کمپیوٹر پلیئرز بولی لگانے کا کون سا نظام استعمال کرتے ہیں؟","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"صفحہ پر ایک ابتدائی قدرتی سٹارٹر معاہدہ دکھایا گیا ہے۔ یہ وہی ہے جو آپ انٹرفیس زبان کا انتخاب کرتے ہیں؛ یہ قومی پل کا نظام یا مکمل ٹورنامنٹ کنونشن کارڈ نہیں ہے۔","Can I play online with other people?":"کیا میں دوسرے لوگوں کے ساتھ آن لائن کھیل سکتا ہوں؟","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"No ایک شخص جنوبی کو تین مقامی کمپیوٹر کھلاڑیوں کے خلاف کھیلتا ہے۔ کوئی میچ میکنگ، اکاؤنٹ یا سرور گیم نہیں ہے۔","How does the game score a hand?":"گیم کس طرح اسکور کرتا ہے؟","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"یہ معاہدہ، کمزوری، درکار چالیں اور کنٹریکٹ لیول، سٹرین، ڈبل/ڈبل، اوور ٹرکس یا انڈر ٹرکس، اور گیم یا سلیم بونس پر مبنی ڈپلیکیٹ طرز کا سکور دکھاتا ہے۔","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"کیا کمپیوٹر ایک مضبوط پل پارٹنر کی طرح چلتا ہے؟","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"No بوٹس قانونی کالوں اور ڈراموں کی پیروی کرتے ہیں لیکن سادہ ابتدائی معلومات کا استعمال کرتے ہیں۔ ان کے فیصلے ماہرانہ بولی یا تاش کے کھیل کا نمونہ نہیں ہیں۔","Scope and limitations":"دائرہ کار اور حدود","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"یہ ایک پریکٹس ٹیبل ہے، آن لائن برج سروس، ٹورنامنٹ ڈائریکٹر یا ماہر حل کرنے والا نہیں۔ سٹارٹر بولی کا معاہدہ جان بوجھ کر چھوٹا اور دستاویزی ہے۔ ڈپلیکیٹ طرز کا ہینڈ سکور دکھایا گیا ہے۔ میچ پوائنٹس، آئی ایم پیز، ربڑ سکورنگ، الرٹس، دعوے، ریکوک رییکٹیفیکیشنز اور ڈائریکٹر رولز لاگو نہیں ہوتے ہیں۔","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"ایک مکمل ڈپلیکیٹ طرز پریکٹس ہینڈ۔ آپ ہمیشہ جنوب میں بیٹھتے ہیں۔ شمال-جنوب اور مشرق-مغرب شراکت دار ہیں۔","Starter bidding agreement":"اسٹارٹر بولی کا معاہدہ","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"قدرتی ابتدائی معاہدہ: 1NT = متوازن 15–17 ہائی کارڈ پوائنٹس؛ ایک سوٹ کا آغاز 12 پوائنٹس سے ہوتا ہے۔ جوابات اور اوور کالز سادہ پریکٹس ہیورسٹکس ہیں، ماہرانہ مشورہ یا قومی نظام نہیں۔","Vulnerability for this hand":"اس ہاتھ کے لیے خطرہ","Neither side vulnerable":"کوئی طرف بھی کمزور نہیں۔","North–South vulnerable":"شمالی-جنوب کمزور","East–West vulnerable":"مشرق-مغرب کمزور","Both sides vulnerable":"دونوں اطراف کمزور","Dealer":"ڈیلر","North":"شمالی","East":"مشرق","South · you":"جنوب · آپ","West":"مغرب","North–South":"شمالی-جنوب","East–West":"مشرق-مغرب","Hand":"ہاتھ","Auction":"نیلامی","Contract":"معاہدہ","To act":"کارروائی کرنا","Your turn":"آپ کی باری ہے۔","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} سوچ رہا ہے…","Level":"سطح","Strain":"تناؤ","Clubs":"کلب","Diamonds":"ہیرے","Hearts":"دل","Spades":"Spades","No trump":"کوئی ٹرمپ نہیں۔","Bid":"بولی","Pass":"پاس","Double":"ڈبل","Redouble":"دوبارہ","No bid is available at that level.":"اس سطح پر کوئی بولی دستیاب نہیں ہے۔","Declarer":"اعلان کنندہ","Dummy":"ڈمی","Opening leader":"اوپننگ لیڈر","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy کا انکشاف ابتدائی برتری کے بعد ہوا ہے۔","Your hand":"آپ کا ہاتھ","Dummy hand":"ڈمی ہاتھ","Hidden hand":"چھپا ہوا ہاتھ","Current trick":"موجودہ چال","Tricks won":"ٹرکس جیت گئے۔","Duplicate-style score":"ڈپلیکیٹ طرز کا سکور","North–South total":"شمالی-جنوب کل","East–West total":"مشرق-مغربی کل","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"ہینڈ سیٹنگ کا انتخاب کریں اور نیلامی شروع کریں۔","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"نیلامی مکمل۔ اوپننگ لیڈر پہلے کھیلتا ہے۔","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"چار پاس: بورڈ پاس آؤٹ ہو گیا۔ تیار ہونے پر اگلا ہاتھ ڈیل کریں۔","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"کنٹریکٹ کیا گیا: {tricks} ٹرکس، {side} کے لیے {score} پوائنٹس۔","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"معاہدہ ختم ہو گیا: {tricks} ٹرکس، {score} پوائنٹس {side} پر۔","Hand result":"ہاتھ کا نتیجہ","Deal next hand":"اگلے ہاتھ سے ڈیل کریں۔","New hand":"نیا ہاتھ","Export score sheet":"اسکور شیٹ برآمد کریں۔","Choose a legal call.":"ایک قانونی کال کا انتخاب کریں۔","Follow the led suit when you can.":"جب ہو سکے تو قیادت والے سوٹ کی پیروی کریں۔","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"کمپیوٹر کھلاڑی ابتدائی سطح کے مقامی اصول استعمال کرتے ہیں۔ کوئی ڈیٹا اس ڈیوائس کو نہیں چھوڑتا ہے۔","Rules reference":"قواعد کا حوالہ","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"ورلڈ برج فیڈریشن · ڈپلیکیٹ برج کے قوانین 2017، قوانین 73 اور 89 کو 2024 میں اپ ڈیٹ کیا گیا"},"tr":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Sözleşme Köprüsü Alıştırma Oyunu","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Yerel Bilgisayar Oyuncularına Karşı Contract Bridge'i Çevrimiçi Oynayın","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Başlangıç seviyesindeki üç yerel bilgisayar oyuncusuna karşı kontratlı köprü yapma alıştırması yapın. Teklif verin, davayı takip edin, deklaran olarak kuklayı kontrol edin ve net bir skor görün. Çevrimiçi çok oyunculu yok.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Üç yerel bilgisayar oyuncusuna karşı tam bir el sözleşmeli briç oynayın. Arayüz dili asla bir teklif verme kuralını veya ülkeye özgü kuralları seçmez.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Kartlar, teklifler ve skorlar bu tarayıcıda kalır. Oyun bir hesap, yükleme veya çevrimiçi rakip kullanmaz.","One hand from deal to score":"Bölüşmeden skora tek el","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Açık artırma 4♠'de iki katına çıktı. Bildiren taraf on el almalıdır; Açılış vuruşu deklaranın solundaki oyuncudan gelir. Bu çıkıştan sonra yer gösterilir ve deklaran her iki elinden de kartları seçer.","A beginner practice version":"Başlangıç seviyesindeki alıştırma versiyonu","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Bu, tek masalı, kopya köprülü bir alıştırma elidir. Yasal deklarasyon sırası, pas, ikiye katlama, tekrar ikiye katlama, takım takip oyunu, koz karşılaştırması, deklaran tarafından kukla kontrolü ve el için yinelenen stilde skor uygulanır. Yerleşik bilgisayar oynatıcıları küçük bir doğal başlangıç anlaşması kullanır: 1SA dengeli 15-17 yüksek kart puanını gösterir; takım elbise açılışları 12 noktadan başlar; yanıtlar ve üst üste konuşmalar kasıtlı olarak basittir. Bu rakipler uzman köprü yazılımı değil, pratik robotlardır. Turnuva kararları, uyarılar, ortaklık kuralları ve eşleşme noktası karşılaştırmaları bu sürümün dışındadır.","Questions":"Sorular","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Bu lastik köprü mü yoksa kopya köprü mü?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"İkili stil kontrat puanlamasını kullanarak her eli ayrı ayrı puanlar. Rubber Bridge gibi parça puanlarını ileri taşımaz ve sonucunuzu diğer tablolarla karşılaştırmaz.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Bilgisayar oyuncuları hangi teklif verme sistemini kullanıyor?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Sayfada yeni başlayanlar için doğal başlangıç anlaşması gösterilmektedir. Hangi arayüz dilini seçerseniz seçin aynıdır; ulusal bir briç sistemi veya tam bir turnuva kongre kartı değildir.","Can I play online with other people?":"Diğer insanlarla çevrimiçi oynayabilir miyim?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Hayır. Bir kişi Güney'de üç yerel bilgisayar oyuncusuna karşı oynuyor. Eşleştirme, hesap veya sunucu oyunu yoktur.","How does the game score a hand?":"Oyun nasıl el puanı alır?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Sözleşmeyi, güvenlik açığını, gereken hileleri ve sözleşme düzeyine, gerilime, double/redoble'a, overtricks veya undertrick'lere ve oyun veya slam bonuslarına dayalı yinelenen stil skorunu gösterir.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Bilgisayar güçlü bir briç ortağı gibi oynuyor mu?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Hayır. Botlar yasal çağrıları ve oyunları takip eder ancak başlangıç düzeyindeki basit buluşsal yöntemleri kullanır. Kararları bir uzman açık artırması veya kart oyunu modeli değildir.","Scope and limitations":"Kapsam ve sınırlamalar","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Bu bir alıştırma masasıdır; çevrimiçi bir briç hizmeti, turnuva yöneticisi veya uzman çözümleyici değildir. Başlangıç ihale sözleşmesi kasıtlı olarak küçüktür ve belgelenmiştir. Yinelenen stildeki el puanı gösterilir; eşleşme noktaları, IMP'ler, kauçuk puanlama, uyarılar, iddialar, iptal düzeltmeleri ve direktör kararları uygulanmaz.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Tam bir kopya tarzı alıştırma eli. Her zaman güneyde oturuyorsun; Kuzey-Güney ve Doğu-Batı ortaktır.","Starter bidding agreement":"Başlangıç ihale sözleşmesi","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Doğal başlangıç anlaşması: 1SA = dengeli 15–17 yüksek kart puanı; bir renk açılışı 12 puandan başlar. Yanıtlar ve ara aramalar, uzman tavsiyesi veya ulusal bir sistem değil, basit pratik buluşsal yöntemlerdir.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Bu el için güvenlik açığı","Neither side vulnerable":"Her iki taraf da savunmasız","North–South vulnerable":"Kuzey-Güney savunmasız","East–West vulnerable":"Doğu-Batı savunmasız","Both sides vulnerable":"Her iki taraf da savunmasız","Dealer":"Bayi","North":"Kuzey","East":"Doğu","South · you":"Güney · sen","West":"Batı","North–South":"Kuzey-Güney","East–West":"Doğu-Batı","Hand":"El","Auction":"Açık artırma","Contract":"Sözleşme","To act":"Harekete geçmek","Your turn":"Sıra sizde","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} şunu düşünüyor…","Level":"Seviye","Strain":"Gerilim","Clubs":"Kulüpler","Diamonds":"Elmaslar","Hearts":"Kalpler","Spades":"Maça","No trump":"Koz yok","Bid":"Teklif","Pass":"Geçti","Double":"Çiftli","Redouble":"İkili","No bid is available at that level.":"Bu seviyede teklif yok.","Declarer":"Beyancı","Dummy":"Kukla","Opening leader":"Açılış lideri","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy açılıştan sonra ortaya çıkıyor.","Your hand":"Eliniz","Dummy hand":"Kukla el","Hidden hand":"Gizli el","Current trick":"Güncel numara","Tricks won":"Kazanılan hileler","Duplicate-style score":"Yinelenen stil skoru","North–South total":"Kuzey-Güney toplamı","East–West total":"Doğu-Batı toplamı","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Bir el ayarı seçin ve açık artırmaya başlayın.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Açık artırma tamamlandı. Açılış lideri önce oynar.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Dört geçiş: tahta dağıtılır. Hazır olduğunuzda bir sonraki eli dağıtın.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Sözleşme yapıldı: {tricks} hileleri, {side} için {score} puanları.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Sözleşme bozuldu: {tricks} hileleri, {score}, {side}'i işaret ediyor.","Hand result":"El sonucu","Deal next hand":"Sonraki anlaşma","New hand":"Yeni el","Export score sheet":"Dışa aktarma puan tablosu","Choose a legal call.":"Yasal bir arama seçin.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Mümkün olduğunda led takımı takip edin.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Bilgisayar oyuncuları başlangıç seviyesi yerel kuralları kullanır. Bu cihazdan hiçbir veri çıkmıyor.","Rules reference":"Kural referansı","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Dünya Briç Federasyonu · Yinelenen Köprü Kanunları 2017, Kanun 73 ve 89, 2024'te güncellendi"},"vi":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Game Luyện Cầu Hợp Đồng","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Chơi Cầu Hợp Đồng Trực Tuyến Với Người Chơi Máy Tính Địa Phương","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Thực hành chơi bài cầu hợp đồng trùng lặp với ba người chơi máy tính cục bộ cấp độ mới bắt đầu. Đặt giá thầu, làm theo, kiểm soát hình nộm với tư cách là người khai báo và xem điểm rõ ràng. Không có nhiều người chơi trực tuyến.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Chơi một ván bài hợp đồng hoàn chỉnh với ba người chơi máy tính địa phương. Ngôn ngữ giao diện không bao giờ chọn quy ước đặt giá thầu hoặc quy tắc dành riêng cho quốc gia.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Thẻ, giá thầu và điểm số vẫn ở trong trình duyệt này. Trò chơi không sử dụng tài khoản, tải lên hoặc đối thủ trực tuyến.","One hand from deal to score":"Một tay từ chia bài đến ghi bàn","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Cuộc đấu giá kết thúc sau 4♠ nhân đôi. Bên khai phải dùng mười thủ đoạn; phần mở đầu đến từ người chơi ở bên trái của người khai báo. Sau lần dẫn đầu đó, hình nộm được hiển thị và người khai báo chọn bài từ cả hai tay.","A beginner practice version":"Phiên bản thực hành cho người mới bắt đầu","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Đây là bài tập đánh cầu trùng lặp trên một bàn đơn. Nó áp dụng thứ tự giá thầu hợp pháp, vượt qua, nhân đôi, nhân đôi, chơi theo sau, so sánh quân át chủ bài, kiểm soát giả bởi người khai báo và điểm kiểu trùng lặp cho ván bài. Người chơi máy tính tích hợp sử dụng thỏa thuận khởi đầu nhỏ tự nhiên: 1NT hiển thị điểm thẻ cao cân bằng 15–17; phần mở đầu của bộ đồ bắt đầu ở 12 điểm; phản hồi và gọi quá mức là cơ bản có chủ ý. Những đối thủ này là những robot thực hành, không phải phần mềm cầu nối chuyên nghiệp. Các phán quyết, cảnh báo, quy ước hợp tác và so sánh điểm trận đấu đều nằm ngoài phiên bản này.","Questions":"Câu hỏi","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Đây là cầu cao su hay cầu trùng?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Nó tính điểm riêng cho từng ván bài bằng cách sử dụng cách tính điểm theo hợp đồng trùng lặp. Nó không chuyển điểm từng phần về phía trước như cầu cao su và nó không so sánh kết quả của bạn với các bảng khác.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Người chơi máy tính sử dụng hệ thống đấu giá nào?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Thỏa thuận dành cho người mới bắt đầu tự nhiên dành cho người mới bắt đầu được hiển thị trên trang. Bất kỳ ngôn ngữ giao diện nào bạn chọn đều giống nhau; nó không phải là một hệ thống cầu nối quốc gia hay một thẻ hội nghị giải đấu hoàn chỉnh.","Can I play online with other people?":"Tôi có thể chơi trực tuyến với người khác không?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Không. Một người chơi miền Nam với ba người chơi máy tính địa phương. Không có trò chơi mai mối, tài khoản hoặc máy chủ.","How does the game score a hand?":"Trò chơi ghi điểm như thế nào?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Nó hiển thị hợp đồng, lỗ hổng, thủ thuật cần thiết và điểm kiểu trùng lặp dựa trên cấp độ hợp đồng, mức căng thẳng, gấp đôi/tăng gấp đôi, vượt qua hoặc vượt qua và tiền thưởng trò chơi hoặc trận đấu.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Máy tính chơi có giống như một đối tác cầu nối mạnh mẽ không?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Không. Các bot tuân theo các cuộc gọi và lượt chơi hợp pháp nhưng sử dụng các phương pháp phỏng đoán đơn giản dành cho người mới bắt đầu. Những quyết định của họ không phải là một kiểu đấu thầu hay chơi bài chuyên nghiệp.","Scope and limitations":"Phạm vi và giới hạn","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Đây là một bàn luyện tập, không phải là dịch vụ cầu nối trực tuyến, giám đốc giải đấu hay chuyên gia giải quyết. Thỏa thuận đấu thầu ban đầu có chủ ý nhỏ và được ghi chép lại. Điểm bài kiểu trùng lặp được hiển thị; điểm đối sánh, IMP, tính điểm cao su, cảnh báo, khiếu nại, cải chính thu hồi và phán quyết của giám đốc không được thực hiện.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Một tay luyện tập kiểu nhân đôi hoàn chỉnh. Bạn luôn ngồi hướng Nam; Bắc-Nam và Đông-Tây là đối tác.","Starter bidding agreement":"Thỏa thuận đấu thầu ban đầu","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Thỏa thuận tự nhiên cho người mới bắt đầu: 1NT = cân bằng 15–17 điểm thẻ cao; phần mở đầu của bộ đồ bắt đầu ở 12 điểm. Các câu trả lời và lời cảnh báo quá mức là những phương pháp phỏng đoán thực hành đơn giản, không phải lời khuyên của chuyên gia hay hệ thống quốc gia.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Tính dễ bị tổn thương của ván bài này","Neither side vulnerable":"Không bên nào dễ bị tổn thương","North–South vulnerable":"Bắc–Nam dễ bị tổn thương","East–West vulnerable":"Đông-Tây dễ bị tổn thương","Both sides vulnerable":"Cả hai bên đều dễ bị tổn thương","Dealer":"Đại lý","North":"Miền Bắc","East":"Đông","South · you":"Miền Nam · bạn","West":"Tây","North–South":"Bắc–Nam","East–West":"Đông–Tây","Hand":"Tay","Auction":"Đấu giá","Contract":"Hợp đồng","To act":"Để hành động","Your turn":"Đến lượt bạn\nUGB042X|UBV042V0X đang suy nghĩ…","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} đang suy nghĩ…","Level":"Cấp độ","Strain":"Căng thẳng","Clubs":"Câu lạc bộ","Diamonds":"Kim cương","Hearts":"Trái tim","Spades":"Pích","No trump":"Không có át chủ bài","Bid":"Giá thầu","Pass":"Đạt","Double":"Đôi","Redouble":"Nhân đôi","No bid is available at that level.":"Không có giá thầu nào ở cấp độ đó.","Declarer":"Người khai báo","Dummy":"Hình nộm","Opening leader":"Người dẫn dắt khai mạc","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy lộ diện sau phần mở đầu.","Your hand":"Bàn tay của bạn","Dummy hand":"Bàn tay giả","Hidden hand":"Bàn tay ẩn giấu","Current trick":"Thủ thuật hiện tại","Tricks won":"Thủ thuật đã thắng","Duplicate-style score":"Điểm kiểu trùng lặp","North–South total":"Tổng Bắc–Nam","East–West total":"Tổng Đông–Tây","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Chọn cách sắp xếp bài và bắt đầu cuộc đấu giá.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Đấu giá hoàn tất. Người lãnh đạo mở đầu chơi trước.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Bốn lượt: bảng được thông qua. Chia bài tiếp theo khi đã sẵn sàng.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Hợp đồng thực hiện: Thủ thuật {tricks}, {score} điểm cho {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Hợp đồng bị hủy: {tricks} thủ đoạn, {score} trỏ tới {side}.","Hand result":"Kết quả ván bài","Deal next hand":"Thỏa thuận tiếp theo","New hand":"Bàn tay mới","Export score sheet":"Xuất bảng điểm","Choose a legal call.":"Chọn cuộc gọi hợp pháp.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Đi theo bộ đồ dẫn đầu khi bạn có thể.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Người chơi máy tính sử dụng các quy tắc cục bộ ở cấp độ mới bắt đầu. Không có dữ liệu rời khỏi thiết bị này.","Rules reference":"Tham khảo quy tắc","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Liên đoàn cầu thế giới · Luật cầu trùng lặp 2017, Luật 73 và 89 cập nhật 2024"},"it":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Gioco di pratica del bridge a contratto","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Gioca a Contract Bridge online contro giocatori del computer locale","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Esercitati in una mano di bridge a contratto duplicato contro tre giocatori di computer locali di livello principiante. Dichiara, segui l'esempio, controlla il morto come dichiarante e vedi un punteggio chiaro. Nessun multiplayer online.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Gioca una mano completa di bridge a contratto contro tre giocatori del computer locale. La lingua dell'interfaccia non seleziona mai una convenzione di offerta o regole specifiche del paese.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Carte, dichiarazioni e punteggi rimangono in questo browser. Il gioco non utilizza un account, un caricamento o un avversario online.","One hand from deal to score":"Una mano dalla distribuzione al punteggio","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"La licitazione termina con 4♠ contro. La parte dichiarante deve effettuare dieci prese; l’attacco iniziale viene dal giocatore alla sinistra del dichiarante. Dopo questo attacco, viene mostrato il morto e il dichiarante sceglie le carte da entrambe le mani.","A beginner practice version":"Una versione pratica per principianti","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Questa è una mano pratica per bridge duplicato a tavola singola. Si applica l'ordine di dichiarazione legale, il passaggio, il contro, il surcontro, il gioco del seme, il confronto di briscole, il controllo del morto da parte del dichiarante e un punteggio in stile duplicato per la mano. I giocatori computerizzati utilizzano un piccolo accordo iniziale naturale: 1SA mostra un equilibrio di 15–17 punti di carta alta; le aperture dei semi iniziano da 12 punti; le risposte e gli interventi sono volutamente basilari. Questi avversari sono robot pratici, non software di bridge esperti. Le regole dei tornei, gli avvisi, le convenzioni di partnership e i confronti dei matchpoint non sono presenti in questa versione.","Questions":"Domande","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Questo è un ponte in gomma o un ponte duplicato?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Valuta ciascuna mano separatamente utilizzando il punteggio del contratto in stile duplicato. Non riporta avanti i punteggi parziali come fa il Rubber Bridge e non confronta il risultato con altre tabelle.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Quale sistema di offerta utilizzano i giocatori computerizzati?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Un contratto per principianti naturali è mostrato nella pagina. È lo stesso qualunque sia la lingua dell'interfaccia scelta; non è un sistema di bridge nazionale o una convenzione di torneo completa.","Can I play online with other people?":"Posso giocare online con altre persone?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"N. Una persona gioca a Sud contro tre giocatori del computer locale. Non esiste matchmaking, account o gioco sul server.","How does the game score a hand?":"In che modo il gioco segna una mano?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Mostra il contratto, la vulnerabilità, le prese richieste e un punteggio in stile duplicato basato su livello di contratto, tensione, contro/surcontro, prese superiori o inferiori e bonus game o slam.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Il computer gioca come un forte partner di bridge?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"N. I robot seguono chiamate e giocate legali ma utilizzano semplici euristiche per principianti. Le loro decisioni non sono un modello di dichiarazione o di gioco di carte da parte di esperti.","Scope and limitations":"Ambito e limitazioni","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Questo è un tavolo di pratica, non un servizio di bridge online, un direttore di torneo o un risolutore esperto. L'accordo di gara iniziale è intenzionalmente piccolo e documentato. Viene mostrato il punteggio della mano in stile duplicato; matchpoint, IMP, punteggio gomma, avvisi, reclami, rettifiche di revoca e decisioni del direttore non vengono implementati.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Una mano completa per esercitarsi in stile duplicato. Ti siedi sempre a sud; Nord-Sud ed Est-Ovest sono partner.","Starter bidding agreement":"Contratto di offerta iniziale","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Accordo naturale del principiante: 1SA = bilanciato 15–17 punti carta alta; l'apertura di un seme inizia da 12 punti. Le risposte e gli interventi sono semplici euristiche pratiche, non consigli di esperti o un sistema nazionale.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Vulnerabilità per questa mano","Neither side vulnerable":"Nessun lato vulnerabile","North–South vulnerable":"Vulnerabile nord-sud","East–West vulnerable":"Vulnerabile est-ovest","Both sides vulnerable":"Entrambi i lati vulnerabili","Dealer":"Rivenditore","North":"Nord","East":"Est","South · you":"Sud · tu","West":"Ovest","North–South":"Nord–Sud","East–West":"Est–Ovest","Hand":"Mano","Auction":"Asta","Contract":"Contratto","To act":"Per agire","Your turn":"È il tuo turno","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} sta pensando...","Level":"Livello","Strain":"Ceppo","Clubs":"Club","Diamonds":"Diamanti","Hearts":"Cuori","Spades":"Picche","No trump":"Nessuna briscola","Bid":"Offerta","Pass":"Passa","Double":"Doppio","Redouble":"Raddoppio","No bid is available at that level.":"Nessuna offerta disponibile a quel livello.","Declarer":"Dichiarante","Dummy":"Ciuccio","Opening leader":"Leader di apertura","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Il manichino viene rivelato dopo l'attacco iniziale.","Your hand":"La tua mano","Dummy hand":"Mano finta","Hidden hand":"Mano nascosta","Current trick":"Trucco attuale","Tricks won":"Prese vinte","Duplicate-style score":"Partitura in stile duplicato","North–South total":"Totale Nord–Sud","East–West total":"Totale est-ovest","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Scegli un'impostazione della mano e inizia l'asta.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Asta completata. Il leader iniziale gioca per primo.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Quattro passaggi: il tabellone viene svenuto. Distribuisci la mano successiva quando sei pronto.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Contratto stipulato: prese {tricks}, punti {score} per {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Contratto scaduto: trucchi {tricks}, {score} punta a {side}.","Hand result":"Risultato della mano","Deal next hand":"Distribuisci la mano successiva","New hand":"Nuova mano","Export score sheet":"Esporta foglio di valutazione","Choose a legal call.":"Scegli una chiamata legale.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Segui la tuta a led quando puoi.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"I giocatori computerizzati utilizzano regole locali di livello principiante. Nessun dato lascia questo dispositivo.","Rules reference":"Riferimento alle regole","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"World Bridge Federation · Leggi del Bridge Duplicato 2017, Leggi 73 e 89 aggiornate al 2024"},"zh_tw":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"合約橋牌練習遊戲","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"與本地電腦玩家線上玩合約橋牌","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"與三位初級本地電腦玩家練習一手重複合約橋牌。叫牌、跟牌、作為莊家控制假人並看到清晰的比分。沒有線上多人遊戲。","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"與三位本地電腦玩家玩一手完整的合約橋牌。界面語言從不選擇投標慣例或特定於國家/地區的規則。","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"牌、叫價和分數保留在此瀏覽器中。遊戲不使用帳戶、上傳或線上對手。","One hand from deal to score":"從發牌到得分的一手牌","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"拍賣以4♠雙倍結束。宣告方必須採取十招；開局領先者來自莊家左側的玩家。領先後，明手出示，莊家從雙手中選擇牌。","A beginner practice version":"初學者練習版","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"這是單桌複橋練習手牌。它適用於合法的叫牌順序、傳牌、加倍、加倍、跟牌、王牌比較、莊家假人控制以及該手牌的重複式得分。內建電腦玩家使用小自然起始協議：1NT顯示平衡的15-17高牌點；花色開盤時間為 12 點；回應和叫喊故意是基本的。這些對手是練習機器人，而不是專家橋接軟體。錦標賽裁決、警報、合作夥伴約定和賽點比較均不屬於此版本。","Questions":"問題","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"這是橡膠橋還是複製橋？","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"它使用重複式合約評分對每手牌進行單獨評分。它不會像橡皮橋那樣將部分分數向前推進，也不會將您的結果與其他表格進行比較。","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"電腦玩家使用什麼叫牌系統？","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"頁面上顯示了初學者自然入門協定。無論您選擇哪種介面語言都是相同的；它不是國家橋牌系統或完整的錦標賽大會卡。","Can I play online with other people?":"我可以和其他人一起在線上玩嗎？","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"號碼一個人與三名本地電腦玩家對戰南方。沒有配對、帳戶或伺服器遊戲。","How does the game score a hand?":"遊戲如何得分一手？","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"它顯示合約、漏洞、所需的技巧以及基於合約等級、緊張、加倍/加倍、過度技巧或不足技巧以及遊戲或大滿貫獎金的重複式分數。","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"電腦玩得像強大的橋牌搭檔嗎？","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"編號這些機器人遵循法律要求並進行遊戲，但使用簡單的初學者啟發法。他們的決定不是專家競價或紙牌遊戲的模式。","Scope and limitations":"範圍和限制","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"這是一個練習台，不是線上橋牌服務、錦標賽總監或專家解算器。起始投標協議故意很小並記錄在案。顯示重複式手牌分數；賽點、IMP、橡皮面計分、警報、索賠、撤銷整改和總監裁決均未執行。","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"一套完整的複式練習手。你總是坐在南邊；南北和東西方是合作夥伴。","Starter bidding agreement":"啟動投標協議","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"自然新手協議：1NT=平衡15-17高卡點；一套花色從 12 點開始開始。回應和叫喊是簡單的實踐啟發法，而不是專家建議或國家製度。","Vulnerability for this hand":"這手牌的漏洞","Neither side vulnerable":"雙方都脆弱","North–South vulnerable":"南北易受影響","East–West vulnerable":"東西方脆弱","Both sides vulnerable":"雙方都脆弱","Dealer":"經銷商","North":"北","East":"東","South · you":"南·你","West":"西","North–South":"南北","East–West":"東-西","Hand":"手","Auction":"拍賣","Contract":"合約","To act":"行動","Your turn":"輪到你了","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} 正在思考…","Level":"水平儀","Strain":"應變","Clubs":"球桿","Diamonds":"鑽石","Hearts":"紅心","Spades":"黑桃","No trump":"無王牌","Bid":"出價","Pass":"透過","Double":"雙","Redouble":"加倍","No bid is available at that level.":"該等級沒有可用的出價。","Declarer":"聲明者","Dummy":"假人","Opening leader":"開場領袖","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"假人在開場領先後揭曉。","Your hand":"你的手","Dummy hand":"假手","Hidden hand":"隱藏之手","Current trick":"目前伎倆","Tricks won":"獲勝技巧","Duplicate-style score":"複製式樂譜","North–South total":"南北總","East–West total":"東-西總計","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"選擇手型設定並開始拍賣。","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"拍賣完成。開局領先者先行。","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"四次通過：板子通過。準備好後發下一手牌。","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"合約製作：{tricks}花樣，{score}積分為{side}。","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"合約下：{tricks}花樣，{score}指向{side}。","Hand result":"手牌結果","Deal next hand":"下一手牌","New hand":"新手","Export score sheet":"匯出評分錶","Choose a legal call.":"選擇合法的通話。","Follow the led suit when you can.":"盡可能跟隨領導的套裝。","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"電腦玩家使用初級本地規則。沒有資料離開該設備。","Rules reference":"規則參考","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"世界橋樑聯合會·重複橋樑法 2017 年，第 73 條和第 89 條於 2024 年更新"},"bg":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Практична игра Contract Bridge","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Играйте Contract Bridge онлайн срещу локални компютърни играчи","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Упражнете ръка на дублиран договорен мост срещу трима начинаещи локални компютърни играчи. Наддайте, последвайте примера, контролирайте манекена като декларатор и вижте ясен резултат. Без онлайн мултиплейър.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Изиграйте една пълна ръка на договорен бридж срещу трима местни компютърни играчи. Езикът на интерфейса никога не избира конвенция за наддаване или специфични за държавата правила.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Картите, офертите и резултатите остават в този браузър. Играта не използва акаунт, качване или онлайн опонент.","One hand from deal to score":"Една ръка от раздаване до гол","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Търгът приключва в 4♠ удвоени. Деклариращата страна трябва да вземе десет трика; началната преднина идва от играча отляво на деклариращия. След това се показва манекен и деклараторът избира карти от двете ръце.","A beginner practice version":"Практическа версия за начинаещи","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Това е тренировъчна ръка за дублиране на мост на една маса. Той прилага законен ред на наддаване, пас, удвояване, удвояване, игра със следващ цвят, сравнение на козове, фиктивен контрол от декларатора и резултат в дублиран стил за ръката. Вградените компютърни плейъри използват малко естествено начално споразумение: 1NT показва балансирани 15–17 точки с висока карта; отварянето на костюма започва от 12 точки; отговорите и овърколите са умишлено основни. Тези опоненти са тренировъчни ботове, а не експертен мостов софтуер. Турнирните решения, сигналите, конвенциите за партньорство и сравненията на мач точки са извън тази версия.","Questions":"Въпроси","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Това гумен мост ли е или дубликат на мост?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Отбелязва всяка ръка поотделно, като използва точкуване в дублиран стил на договор. Той не пренася частични резултати напред, както прави гуменият мост, и не сравнява вашия резултат с други маси.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Каква система за наддаване използват компютърните играчи?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Споразумение за начинаещ естествен началник е показано на страницата. Това е същото, независимо от езика на интерфейса, който изберете; това не е национална бридж система или пълна турнирна конвенционална карта.","Can I play online with other people?":"Мога ли да играя онлайн с други хора?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Бр. Един човек играе Юг срещу трима местни компютърни играчи. Няма сватовство, акаунт или сървърна игра.","How does the game score a hand?":"Как играта отбелязва ръка?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Показва договора, уязвимостта, необходимите трикове и резултат в дублиран стил въз основа на нивото на договора, напрежение, удвояване/удвояване, овъртрикове или недостатъци и бонуси за игра или удар.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Компютърът играе ли като силен бридж партньор?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Бр. Ботовете следват правни обаждания и игри, но използват проста евристика за начинаещи. Техните решения не са модел на експертно наддаване или игра на карти.","Scope and limitations":"Обхват и ограничения","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Това е тренировъчна маса, а не онлайн услуга за бридж, турнирен директор или експертен решавач. Споразумението за начално наддаване е умишлено малко и документирано. Показан е резултат от ръка в дублиран стил; точки за съвпадение, IMP, точкуване, предупреждения, искове, корекции на отмяна и решения на директора не се прилагат.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Една пълна тренировъчна ръка в стил дубликат. Винаги седите на юг; Север-Юг и Изток-Запад са партньори.","Starter bidding agreement":"Споразумение за начално наддаване","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Споразумение за естествен начинаещ: 1NT = балансирани 15–17 точки с висока карта; отварянето на боя започва от 12 точки. Отговорите и овъркалите са обикновена евристика на практиката, а не експертен съвет или национална система.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Уязвимост за тази ръка","Neither side vulnerable":"Нито една страна не е уязвима","North–South vulnerable":"Север–Юг уязвим","East–West vulnerable":"Изток-Запад уязвим","Both sides vulnerable":"И двете страни са уязвими","Dealer":"Търговец","North":"Север","East":"Изток","South · you":"Юг · ти","West":"Запад","North–South":"Север–Юг","East–West":"Изток–Запад","Hand":"Ръка","Auction":"Търг","Contract":"Договор","To act":"Да действаме","Your turn":"Ваш ред","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} мисли...","Level":"Ниво","Strain":"Щам","Clubs":"Буха","Diamonds":"Диаманти","Hearts":"Сърца","Spades":"Пика","No trump":"Без коз","Bid":"Оферта","Pass":"Пропуск","Double":"Двойна","Redouble":"Удвояване","No bid is available at that level.":"Няма налична оферта на това ниво.","Declarer":"Декларатор","Dummy":"Манекен","Opening leader":"Лидер на откриването","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Манекенът се разкрива след началната преднина.","Your hand":"Вашата ръка","Dummy hand":"Ръка-манекен","Hidden hand":"Скрита ръка","Current trick":"Текущ трик","Tricks won":"Спечелени трикове","Duplicate-style score":"Дублиращ се резултат","North–South total":"Общо север–юг","East–West total":"Общо изток–запад","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Изберете настройка за ръка и започнете търга.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Търгът приключи. Откриващият лидер играе първи.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Четири преминавания: дъската е изгубена. Раздайте следващата ръка, когато сте готови.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Сключен договор: трикове {tricks}, точки {score} за {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Договорът падна: трикове {tricks}, {score} сочи към {side}.","Hand result":"Ръчен резултат","Deal next hand":"Сделка от следващата ръка","New hand":"Нова ръка","Export score sheet":"Експортиране на таблица с резултати","Choose a legal call.":"Изберете легално обаждане.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Следвайте водения костюм, когато можете.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Компютърните играчи използват местни правила за начинаещи. Никакви данни не напускат това устройство.","Rules reference":"Препратка към правилата","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Световна бридж федерация · Закони за дублирани бриджове 2017 г., закони 73 и 89, актуализирани 2024 г."},"ca":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Joc de pràctica de pont de contracte","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Juga Contract Bridge en línia contra jugadors d'ordinadors locals","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Practica una mà de pont de contracte duplicat contra tres jugadors d'ordinador locals de nivell principiant. Ofereix, segueix l'exemple, controla el maniquí com a declarant i veu una puntuació clara. No hi ha multijugador en línia.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Juga una mà completa de contract bridge contra tres jugadors d'ordinador locals. L'idioma de la interfície mai selecciona una convenció d'ofertes o regles específiques d'un país.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Les targetes, les ofertes i les puntuacions es mantenen en aquest navegador. El joc no utilitza cap compte, càrrega o oponent en línia.","One hand from deal to score":"Una mà de l'oferta a la puntuació","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"La subhasta acaba en 4♠ duplicat. El bàndol declarant ha de fer deu trucs; l'avantatge inicial prové del jugador a l'esquerra del declarant. Després d'aquest avantatge, es mostra el maniquí i el declarant tria cartes d'ambdues mans.","A beginner practice version":"Una versió pràctica per a principiants","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Aquesta és una mà de pràctica de pont duplicat d'una sola taula. S'aplica l'ordre d'oferta legal, la passada, el doble, el redoblament, el joc de seguiment, la comparació d'atout, el control fictici per part del declarant i una puntuació d'estil duplicada per a la mà. Els jugadors d'ordinador integrats utilitzen un petit acord d'inici natural: 1NT mostra un equilibrat de 15 a 17 punts de cartes altes; les obertures dels vestits comencen a 12 punts; les respostes i les exageracions són deliberadament bàsiques. Aquests oponents són robots de pràctica, no programari de pont expert. Les decisions del torneig, les alertes, les convencions d'associació i les comparacions de punts de partit estan fora d'aquesta versió.","Questions":"Preguntes","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Aquest pont de goma és un pont duplicat?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Apunta cada mà per separat mitjançant una puntuació de contracte d'estil duplicat. No avança les puntuacions parcials com ho fa el pont de goma, i no compara el vostre resultat amb altres taules.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Quin sistema de licitació fan servir els jugadors informàtics?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"A la pàgina es mostra un acord d'iniciació natural per a principiants. És el mateix, sigui quin sigui l'idioma de la interfície que trieu; no és un sistema de pont nacional ni una targeta de convenció de torneig completa.","Can I play online with other people?":"Puc jugar en línia amb altres persones?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Núm. Una persona juga al Sud contra tres jugadors d'ordinador locals. No hi ha matchmaking, compte o joc de servidor.","How does the game score a hand?":"Com marca el joc una mà?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Mostra el contracte, la vulnerabilitat, els trucs necessaris i una puntuació d'estil duplicada basada en el nivell de contracte, la tensió, el doble/redoble, els overtricks o undertricks i les bonificacions de joc o slam.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"L'ordinador juga com un fort company de pont?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Núm. Els robots segueixen trucades i jugades legals, però utilitzen heurístiques simples per a principiants. Les seves decisions no són un model d'oferta experta o joc de cartes.","Scope and limitations":"Àmbit i limitacions","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Aquesta és una taula de pràctiques, no un servei de pont en línia, director de torneig o solucionador expert. L'acord de licitació inicial és intencionadament petit i documentat. Es mostra la puntuació de mà d'estil duplicat; no s'apliquen punts de partit, IMP, puntuació de goma, alertes, reclamacions, rectificacions de revocació i resolucions del director.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Una mà de pràctica completa d'estil duplicat. Sempre seieu al Sud; Nord-Sud i Est-Oest són socis.","Starter bidding agreement":"Acord de licitació inicial","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Acord natural per a principiants: 1NT = equilibrat de 15 a 17 punts de targeta alta; una obertura de vestit comença a 12 punts. Les respostes i les trucades són simples heurístiques pràctiques, no consells d'experts o un sistema nacional.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Vulnerabilitat per aquesta mà","Neither side vulnerable":"Cap dels dos costats vulnerables","North–South vulnerable":"Nord-Sud vulnerable","East–West vulnerable":"Venler est-oest","Both sides vulnerable":"Tots dos costats vulnerables","Dealer":"Distribuïdor","North":"Nord","East":"Est","South · you":"Sud · tu","West":"Oest","North–South":"Nord-Sud","East–West":"Est–Oest","Hand":"Mà","Auction":"Suhasta","Contract":"Contracte","To act":"Actuar","Your turn":"Tu torn","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} està pensant...","Level":"Nivell","Strain":"Sopa","Clubs":"Clubs","Diamonds":"Diamants","Hearts":"Cors","Spades":"Piques","No trump":"Sense triomf","Bid":"Oferta","Pass":"Passa","Double":"Doble","Redouble":"Redoblar","No bid is available at that level.":"No hi ha cap oferta disponible en aquest nivell.","Declarer":"Declarant","Dummy":"Manec","Opening leader":"Líder d'obertura","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"El maniquí es revela després de l'inici.","Your hand":"La teva mà","Dummy hand":"Mà ficticia","Hidden hand":"Mà oculta","Current trick":"Truc actual","Tricks won":"Trucs guanyats","Duplicate-style score":"Partitura d'estil duplicat","North–South total":"Nord-Sud total","East–West total":"Est-Oest total","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Trieu una configuració de mà i comença la subhasta.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Subasta completada. El primer líder juga primer.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Quatre passades: el tauler s'esgota. Repartiu la següent mà quan estigui llest.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Contracte fet: trucs {tricks}, punts {score} per {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Contracte caigut: trucs {tricks}, {score} apunta a {side}.","Hand result":"Resultat a mà","Deal next hand":"Oferta propera","New hand":"Mà nova","Export score sheet":"Exporta el full de puntuació","Choose a legal call.":"Trieu una trucada legal.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Segueix el vestit de led quan puguis.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Els jugadors d'ordinador utilitzen regles locals de nivell principiant. No surten dades d'aquest dispositiu.","Rules reference":"Referència de regles","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Federació Mundial de Ponts · Lleis del pont duplicat 2017, Lleis 73 i 89 actualitzades el 2024"},"nl":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Contractbridge-oefenspel","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Speel Contract Bridge online tegen lokale computerspelers","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Oefen een hand van dubbele contractbridge tegen drie lokale computerspelers op beginnersniveau. Bied, volg de kleur, controleer de dummy als leider en zie een duidelijke score. Geen onlinemultiplayer.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Speel een volledige hand contractbridge tegen drie lokale computerspelers. De interfacetaal selecteert nooit een biedconventie of landspecifieke regels.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Kaarten, biedingen en scores blijven in deze browser. Het spel maakt geen gebruik van een account, upload of online tegenstander.","One hand from deal to score":"Eén hand van deal tot score","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"De bieding eindigt met 4♠ verdubbeld. De declarerende partij moet tien slagen maken; de openingsvoorsprong komt van de speler links van de leider. Na deze voorsprong wordt de dummy getoond en kiest de leider kaarten uit beide handen.","A beginner practice version":"Een oefenversie voor beginners","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Dit is een oefenhand met dubbele brug met één tafel. Het past de wettelijke biedvolgorde, passen, verdubbelen, herverdubbelen, vervolgspel, troefvergelijking, dummycontrole door de leider en een dubbele score voor de hand toe. De ingebouwde computerspelers gebruiken een kleine natuurlijke starterovereenkomst: 1SA toont een evenwichtige 15–17 hoge kaartpunten; kleuropeningen beginnen bij 12 punten; reacties en volgoproepen zijn opzettelijk basaal. Deze tegenstanders zijn oefenbots, geen deskundige bridgesoftware. Toernooiuitspraken, waarschuwingen, partnerschapsconventies en matchpuntvergelijkingen vallen buiten deze versie.","Questions":"Vragen","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Is dit een rubberen brug of een dubbele brug?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Het scoort elke hand afzonderlijk met dubbele contractscores. Het draagt de deelscores niet over, zoals de rubberen brug, en vergelijkt uw resultaat niet met andere tabellen.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Welk biedsysteem gebruiken de computerspelers?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Een natuurlijke startersovereenkomst voor beginners wordt op de pagina weergegeven. Welke interfacetaal u ook kiest, het is hetzelfde; het is geen nationaal bridgesysteem of een volledige toernooiconventiekaart.","Can I play online with other people?":"Kan ik online met andere mensen spelen?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Nee. Eén persoon speelt Zuid tegen drie lokale computerspelers. Er is geen matchmaking-, account- of serverspel.","How does the game score a hand?":"Hoe scoort het spel een hand?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Het toont het contract, de kwetsbaarheid, de vereiste trucs en een dubbele score op basis van contractniveau, spanning, double/redouble, overslagen of underslagen, en game- of slam-bonussen.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Speelt de computer als een sterke bridgepartner?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Nee. De bots volgen legale oproepen en spelen, maar gebruiken eenvoudige heuristieken voor beginners. Hun beslissingen zijn geen voorbeeld van deskundig bieden of kaartspel.","Scope and limitations":"Reikwijdte en beperkingen","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Dit is een oefentafel, geen online bridgeservice, toernooidirecteur of deskundige oplosser. De starterbiedingsovereenkomst is opzettelijk klein en gedocumenteerd. Handscore in dubbele stijl wordt getoond; matchpoints, IMP's, rubberscores, waarschuwingen, claims, rectificaties van intrekkingen en uitspraken van directeuren worden niet geïmplementeerd.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Eén complete oefenhand in dubbele stijl. Je zit altijd Zuid; Noord-Zuid en Oost-West zijn partners.","Starter bidding agreement":"Startbiedingsovereenkomst","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Natuurlijke beginnersovereenkomst: 1SA = evenwichtig 15–17 hoge kaartpunten; een kleuropening begint bij 12 punten. Reacties en volgoproepen zijn eenvoudige praktijkheuristieken en geen deskundig advies of een nationaal systeem.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Kwetsbaarheid voor deze hand","Neither side vulnerable":"Geen van beide kanten kwetsbaar","North–South vulnerable":"Noord-Zuid kwetsbaar","East–West vulnerable":"Oost-West kwetsbaar","Both sides vulnerable":"Beide kanten kwetsbaar","Dealer":"Dealer","North":"Noord","East":"Oost","South · you":"Zuid · jij","West":"West","North–South":"Noord-Zuid","East–West":"Oost – West","Hand":"Hand","Auction":"Veiling","Contract":"Contract","To act":"Acteren","Your turn":"Jouw beurt","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} denkt...","Level":"Niveau","Strain":"Verrek","Clubs":"Clubs","Diamonds":"Diamanten","Hearts":"Harten","Spades":"Schoppen","No trump":"Geen troef","Bid":"Bieden","Pass":"Geslaagd","Double":"Dubbel","Redouble":"Verdubbelen","No bid is available at that level.":"Er is geen bod beschikbaar op dat niveau.","Declarer":"Aangever","Dummy":"Dummy","Opening leader":"Openingsleider","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy wordt onthuld na de openingslead.","Your hand":"Je hand","Dummy hand":"Dummyhand","Hidden hand":"Verborgen hand","Current trick":"Huidige truc","Tricks won":"Trucs gewonnen","Duplicate-style score":"Partituur in dubbele stijl","North–South total":"Noord-Zuid totaal","East–West total":"Oost-West totaal","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Kies een wijzerinstelling en start de veiling.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Veiling voltooid. De openingsleider speelt als eerste.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Vier passen: het bord is flauwgevallen. Deel de volgende hand als je klaar bent.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Contract gemaakt: {tricks}-trucs, {score}-punten voor {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Contract ging omlaag: {tricks} trucjes, {score} wijst naar {side}.","Hand result":"Handresultaat","Deal next hand":"Deal volgende hand","New hand":"Nieuwe wijzer","Export score sheet":"Scoreblad exporteren","Choose a legal call.":"Kies een legaal gesprek.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Volg het led-pak wanneer je kunt.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Computerspelers gebruiken lokale regels op beginnersniveau. Er verlaten geen gegevens dit apparaat.","Rules reference":"Regelreferentie","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"World Bridge Federation · Wetten van Duplicate Bridge 2017, Wetten 73 en 89 bijgewerkt in 2024"},"el":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Παιχνίδι εξάσκησης Contract Bridge","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Παίξτε Contract Bridge Online Εναντίον τοπικών παικτών υπολογιστών","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Εξασκηθείτε σε ένα χέρι διπλό συμβόλαιο γέφυρας ενάντια σε τρεις τοπικούς παίκτες υπολογιστών σε επίπεδο αρχαρίου. Υποβάλετε προσφορά, ακολουθήστε το παράδειγμά σας, ελέγξτε το εικονίδιο ως δηλωτή και δείτε μια καθαρή βαθμολογία. Χωρίς online multiplayer.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Παίξτε ένα πλήρες hand of contract bridge ενάντια σε τρεις τοπικούς παίκτες υπολογιστών. Η γλώσσα διεπαφής δεν επιλέγει ποτέ μια σύμβαση υποβολής προσφορών ή κανόνες συγκεκριμένης χώρας.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Οι κάρτες, οι προσφορές και οι βαθμολογίες παραμένουν σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης. Το παιχνίδι δεν χρησιμοποιεί λογαριασμό, μεταφόρτωση ή διαδικτυακό αντίπαλο.","One hand from deal to score":"Ένα χέρι από συμφωνία σε σκορ","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Η δημοπρασία λήγει σε 4♠ διπλασιάστηκε. Η πλευρά που δηλώνει πρέπει να κάνει δέκα κόλπα. το αρχικό προβάδισμα προέρχεται από τον παίκτη στα αριστερά του δηλωτή. Μετά από αυτό το προβάδισμα, εμφανίζεται το εικονίδιο και ο δηλωτής επιλέγει κάρτες και από τα δύο χέρια.","A beginner practice version":"Μια έκδοση πρακτικής για αρχάριους","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Πρόκειται για μια εξάσκηση με διπλό τραπέζι ενός τραπεζιού. Εφαρμόζει εντολή νόμιμης προσφοράς, πάσο, διπλό, διπλασιασμό, παιχνίδι ακολουθίας, σύγκριση ατού, εικονικό έλεγχο από τον δηλωτή και σκορ διπλού τύπου για το χέρι. Οι ενσωματωμένες συσκευές αναπαραγωγής υπολογιστών χρησιμοποιούν μια μικρή φυσική συμφωνία εκκίνησης: Το 1NT δείχνει ισοσκελισμένους 15–17 πόντους υψηλής κάρτας. Τα ανοίγματα κοστουμιών ξεκινούν από 12 πόντους. οι απαντήσεις και οι συνολικές κλήσεις είναι σκόπιμα βασικές. Αυτοί οι αντίπαλοι είναι ρομπότ πρακτικής, όχι εξειδικευμένο λογισμικό bridge. Οι αποφάσεις τουρνουά, οι ειδοποιήσεις, οι συμβάσεις συνεργασίας και οι συγκρίσεις σημείων αγώνων δεν βρίσκονται σε αυτήν την έκδοση.","Questions":"Ερωτήσεις","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Είναι αυτή η ελαστική γέφυρα ή διπλή γέφυρα;","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Βαθμολογεί κάθε χέρι ξεχωριστά χρησιμοποιώντας βαθμολόγηση συμβολαίου διπλού τύπου. Δεν μεταφέρει τις μερικές βαθμολογίες προς τα εμπρός όπως κάνει το rubber bridge και δεν συγκρίνει το αποτέλεσμά σας με άλλους πίνακες.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Τι σύστημα υποβολής προσφορών χρησιμοποιούν οι συσκευές αναπαραγωγής υπολογιστών;","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Στη σελίδα εμφανίζεται μια συμφωνία φυσικής εκκίνησης για αρχάριους. Είναι το ίδιο όποια γλώσσα διεπαφής κι αν επιλέξετε. δεν είναι ένα εθνικό σύστημα γέφυρας ή μια πλήρης κάρτα σύμβασης τουρνουά.","Can I play online with other people?":"Μπορώ να παίξω online με άλλα άτομα;","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Αρ. Ένα άτομο παίζει South ενάντια σε τρεις τοπικούς παίκτες υπολογιστών. Δεν υπάρχει παιχνίδι matchmaking, λογαριασμού ή διακομιστή.","How does the game score a hand?":"Πώς σκοράρει το παιχνίδι ένα χέρι;","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Δείχνει το συμβόλαιο, την ευπάθεια, τα απαιτούμενα κόλπα και μια βαθμολογία διπλότυπου τύπου με βάση το επίπεδο συμβολαίου, το strain, το double/double, τα overtricks ή undertricks και τα μπόνους παιχνιδιού ή slam.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Ο υπολογιστής παίζει σαν ένας ισχυρός συνεργάτης γέφυρας;","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Αρ. Τα ρομπότ ακολουθούν νόμιμες κλήσεις και παιχνίδια, αλλά χρησιμοποιούν απλές ευρετικές αρχές για αρχάριους. Οι αποφάσεις τους δεν αποτελούν πρότυπο προσφοράς ειδικών ή παιχνιδιών με χαρτιά.","Scope and limitations":"Πεδίο εφαρμογής και περιορισμοί","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Αυτό είναι ένα τραπέζι εξάσκησης, όχι μια διαδικτυακή υπηρεσία γέφυρας, διευθυντής τουρνουά ή ειδικός επίλυσης. Η αρχική συμφωνία προσφοράς είναι σκόπιμα μικρή και τεκμηριωμένη. Εμφανίζεται η βαθμολογία χεριών σε διπλότυπο στυλ. Τα σημεία αντιστοίχισης, τα IMP, η βαθμολόγηση από καουτσούκ, οι ειδοποιήσεις, οι αξιώσεις, οι διορθώσεις ανάκλησης και οι αποφάσεις του διευθυντή δεν εφαρμόζονται.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Ένα πλήρες εξάσκηση σε διπλό στυλ. Κάθεσαι πάντα νότια. Βορράς-Νότος και Ανατολή-Δύση είναι εταίροι.","Starter bidding agreement":"Συμφωνία προσφοράς εκκίνησης","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Συμφωνία φυσικού αρχαρίου: 1NT = ισορροπημένος 15–17 πόντοι υψηλής κάρτας. ένα άνοιγμα κοστουμιού ξεκινά από 12 πόντους. Οι απαντήσεις και οι επισκέψεις είναι απλές πρακτικές ευρετικές, όχι συμβουλές ειδικών ή ένα εθνικό σύστημα.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Ευπάθεια για αυτό το χέρι","Neither side vulnerable":"Καμία πλευρά δεν είναι ευάλωτη","North–South vulnerable":"Βορράς-Νότος ευάλωτος","East–West vulnerable":"Ανατολή-Δύση ευάλωτη","Both sides vulnerable":"Και οι δύο πλευρές ευάλωτες","Dealer":"Έμπορος","North":"Βόρεια","East":"Ανατολή","South · you":"Νότος · εσύ","West":"Δυτ","North–South":"Βορράς–Νότος","East–West":"Ανατολή–Δύση","Hand":"Χέρι","Auction":"Δημοπρασία","Contract":"Σύμβαση","To act":"Να ενεργήσω","Your turn":"Σειρά σου\nΤο","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} σκέφτεται…","Level":"Επίπεδο","Strain":"Στρέλεχος","Clubs":"Σύλλογοι","Diamonds":"Διαμάντια","Hearts":"Καρδιές","Spades":"Μπαστούνια","No trump":"Χωρίς ατού","Bid":"Προσφορά","Pass":"Πάσο","Double":"Διπλό","Redouble":"Διπλασιασμός","No bid is available at that level.":"Δεν υπάρχει διαθέσιμη προσφορά σε αυτό το επίπεδο.","Declarer":"Δηλωτής","Dummy":"Ομοίωμα","Opening leader":"Opening leader\nΤο","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Το ανδρείκελο αποκαλύπτεται μετά το άνοιγμα.","Your hand":"Το χέρι σου","Dummy hand":"Παρομοιότυπο χέρι","Hidden hand":"Κρυμμένο χέρι","Current trick":"Τρέχον κόλπο","Tricks won":"Κερδισμένα κόλπα","Duplicate-style score":"Διπλότυπη παρτιτούρα","North–South total":"Σύνολο Βορρά–Νότου","East–West total":"Ανατολή-Δύση σύνολο","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Επιλέξτε μια ρύθμιση χεριού και ξεκινήστε τη δημοπρασία.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Η δημοπρασία ολοκληρώθηκε. Ο αρχηγός ανοίγματος παίζει πρώτος.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Τέσσερα περάσματα: ο πίνακας έχει περάσει έξω. Μοιράστε το επόμενο χέρι όταν είναι έτοιμο.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Σύμβαση υπογράφηκε: κόλπα {tricks}, πόντοι {score} για {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Το συμβόλαιο κατέρρευσε: {tricks} κόλπα, το {score} δείχνει σε {side}.","Hand result":"Αποτέλεσμα χεριού","Deal next hand":"Προσφορά στο επόμενο χέρι","New hand":"Νέο χέρι","Export score sheet":"Εξαγωγή φύλλου βαθμολογίας","Choose a legal call.":"Επιλέξτε μια νόμιμη κλήση.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Ακολουθήστε το κοστούμι led όταν μπορείτε.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Οι συσκευές αναπαραγωγής υπολογιστών χρησιμοποιούν τοπικούς κανόνες σε επίπεδο αρχαρίου. Δεν εξέρχονται δεδομένα από αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Rules reference":"Αναφορά κανόνων","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 ενημερώθηκαν το 2024"},"ms":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Permainan Amalan Jambatan Kontrak","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Main Kontrak Jambatan Dalam Talian Menentang Pemain Komputer Tempatan","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Berlatih tangan jambatan kontrak pendua terhadap tiga pemain komputer tempatan peringkat pemula. Bida, ikuti, kawal dummy sebagai pengisytihar dan lihat markah yang jelas. Tiada berbilang pemain dalam talian.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Mainkan satu tangan penuh jambatan kontrak menentang tiga pemain komputer tempatan. Bahasa antara muka tidak pernah memilih konvensyen pembidaan atau peraturan khusus negara.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Kad, bida dan markah kekal dalam penyemak imbas ini. Permainan ini tidak menggunakan akaun, muat naik atau lawan dalam talian.","One hand from deal to score":"Satu tangan daripada perjanjian untuk menjaringkan gol","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Lelongan berakhir dalam 4♠ dua kali ganda. Pihak yang mengisytiharkan mesti mengambil sepuluh helah; pendahuluan pembukaan datang dari pemain ke kiri pengisytihar. Selepas petunjuk itu, dummy ditunjukkan dan pengisytihar memilih kad dari kedua-dua tangan.","A beginner practice version":"Versi latihan pemula","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Ini ialah tangan latihan jambatan pendua meja tunggal. Ia menggunakan perintah bida yang sah, lulus, menggandakan, menggandakan, permainan susulan, perbandingan trump, kawalan tiruan oleh pengisytihar dan skor gaya pendua untuk tangan. Pemain komputer terbina dalam menggunakan perjanjian permulaan semula jadi yang kecil: 1NT menunjukkan 15–17 mata kad tinggi yang seimbang; pembukaan sut bermula pada 12 mata; respons dan overcall adalah sengaja asas. Lawan ini adalah bot latihan, bukan perisian jambatan pakar. Keputusan kejohanan, makluman, konvensyen perkongsian dan perbandingan mata perlawanan adalah di luar versi ini.","Questions":"Soalan","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Adakah ini jambatan getah atau jambatan pendua?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Ia menjaringkan setiap tangan secara berasingan menggunakan pemarkahan kontrak gaya pendua. Ia tidak membawa sebahagian-skor ke hadapan seperti jambatan getah, dan ia tidak membandingkan keputusan anda dengan jadual lain.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Sistem pembidaan apakah yang digunakan oleh pemain komputer?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Perjanjian pemula semula jadi pemula ditunjukkan pada halaman. Ia adalah sama mana-mana bahasa antara muka yang anda pilih; ia bukan sistem jambatan kebangsaan atau kad konvensyen kejohanan yang lengkap.","Can I play online with other people?":"Bolehkah saya bermain dalam talian dengan orang lain?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"No. Satu orang bermain Selatan menentang tiga pemain komputer tempatan. Tiada permainan mencari jodoh, akaun atau pelayan.","How does the game score a hand?":"Bagaimanakah permainan menjaringkan gol?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Ia menunjukkan kontrak, kelemahan, helah yang diperlukan dan skor gaya pendua berdasarkan tahap kontrak, ketegangan, dua kali ganda/ganda, overtrick atau undertrick dan bonus permainan atau slam.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Adakah komputer bermain seperti rakan bridge yang kuat?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"No. Bot mengikuti panggilan dan permainan undang-undang tetapi menggunakan heuristik pemula yang mudah. Keputusan mereka bukanlah model pembidaan pakar atau permainan kad.","Scope and limitations":"Skop dan had","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Ini ialah jadual latihan, bukan perkhidmatan jambatan dalam talian, pengarah kejohanan atau penyelesai pakar. Perjanjian pembidaan permulaan sengaja kecil dan didokumenkan. Skor tangan gaya pendua ditunjukkan; titik perlawanan, IMP, pemarkahan getah, makluman, tuntutan, membatalkan pembetulan dan keputusan pengarah tidak dilaksanakan.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Satu tangan latihan gaya pendua lengkap. Anda sentiasa duduk Selatan; Utara–Selatan dan Timur–Barat adalah rakan kongsi.","Starter bidding agreement":"Perjanjian pembidaan permulaan","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Perjanjian pemula semula jadi: 1NT = seimbang 15–17 mata kad tinggi; pembukaan sut bermula pada 12 mata. Respons dan panggilan semula adalah heuristik amalan mudah, bukan nasihat pakar atau sistem nasional.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Kerentanan untuk tangan ini","Neither side vulnerable":"Mana-mana pihak terdedah","North–South vulnerable":"Utara–Selatan terdedah","East–West vulnerable":"Timur–Barat terdedah","Both sides vulnerable":"Kedua-dua pihak terdedah","Dealer":"Penjual","North":"Utara","East":"Timur","South · you":"Selatan · anda","West":"Barat","North–South":"Utara–Selatan","East–West":"Timur–Barat","Hand":"Tangan","Auction":"Lelong","Contract":"Kontrak","To act":"Untuk bertindak","Your turn":"Giliran anda","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} sedang berfikir…","Level":"Tahap","Strain":"Tekanan","Clubs":"Kelab","Diamonds":"Berlian","Hearts":"Hati","Spades":"Penyodok","No trump":"Tiada truf","Bid":"Bida","Pass":"Lulus","Double":"Berganda","Redouble":"Berganda","No bid is available at that level.":"Tiada bida tersedia pada tahap itu.","Declarer":"Pengisytihar","Dummy":"Dummy","Opening leader":"Pemimpin pembukaan","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy didedahkan selepas pendahuluan pembukaan.","Your hand":"Tangan awak","Dummy hand":"Tangan tiruan","Hidden hand":"Tangan tersembunyi","Current trick":"Helah semasa","Tricks won":"Helah dimenangi","Duplicate-style score":"Skor gaya pendua","North–South total":"Jumlah Utara–Selatan","East–West total":"Jumlah Timur–Barat","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Pilih tetapan tangan dan mulakan lelongan.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Lelongan selesai. Ketua pembuka bermain terlebih dahulu.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Empat pas: papan pengsan. Uruskan tangan seterusnya apabila bersedia.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Kontrak dibuat: Helah {tricks}, mata {score} untuk {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Kontrak turun: Helah {tricks}, {score} menunjuk kepada {side}.","Hand result":"Hasil tangan","Deal next hand":"Berurusan seterusnya","New hand":"Tangan baharu","Export score sheet":"Lembaran skor eksport","Choose a legal call.":"Pilih panggilan yang sah.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Ikuti sut led apabila anda boleh.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Pemain komputer menggunakan peraturan tempatan peringkat pemula. Tiada data keluar dari peranti ini.","Rules reference":"Rujukan peraturan","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Persekutuan Jambatan Dunia · Undang-undang Jambatan Pendua 2017, Undang-undang 73 dan 89 dikemas kini 2024"},"pl":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Gra treningowa w brydżu kontraktowym","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Graj w brydża kontraktowego online przeciwko lokalnym graczom komputerowym","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Przećwicz rozdanie zduplikowanego brydża kontraktowego przeciwko trzem lokalnym graczom komputerowym na poziomie początkującym. Licytuj, podążaj za jego przykładem, kontroluj manekina jako rozgrywający i zobacz wyraźny wynik. Brak trybu wieloosobowego online.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Zagraj jedno pełne rozdanie w brydżu kontraktowym przeciwko trzem lokalnym graczom komputerowym. Język interfejsu nigdy nie wybiera konwencji ustalania stawek ani zasad obowiązujących w danym kraju.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Karty, oferty i wyniki pozostają w tej przeglądarce. Gra nie korzysta z konta, uploadu ani internetowego przeciwnika.","One hand from deal to score":"Jedno rozdanie od rozdania do gola","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Aukcja kończy się na 4♠ podwojonym. Strona deklarująca musi przyjąć dziesięć lew; pierwsze wyjście rozpoczyna gracz siedzący po lewej stronie rozgrywającego. Po tym wyjściu pokazywany jest manekin, a rozgrywający wybiera karty z obu rąk.","A beginner practice version":"Wersja do ćwiczeń dla początkujących","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"To jest rozdanie ćwiczeniowe przy jednym stole z duplikatem brydża. Dotyczy legalnej kolejności licytacji, podania, podbicia, rekontra, gry w kolorze, porównania atutów, kontroli fikcyjnej przez rozgrywającego oraz podwójnego wyniku dla rozdania. Wbudowane odtwarzacze komputerowe korzystają z małej naturalnej umowy startowej: 1BA pokazuje zrównoważone 15–17 punktów wysokich kart; otwarcia garniturów zaczynają się od 12 punktów; odpowiedzi i przesadne wezwania są celowo podstawowe. Ci przeciwnicy to boty ćwiczeniowe, a nie specjalistyczne oprogramowanie do mostów. Orzeczenia dotyczące turniejów, alerty, konwencje partnerstwa i porównania punktów meczowych nie są dostępne w tej wersji.","Questions":"Pytania","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Czy jest to mostek gumowy czy zduplikowany?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Ocenia każde rozdanie oddzielnie, stosując punktację kontraktową w stylu duplikatu. Nie przenosi wyników częściowych do przodu, jak robi to gumowy mostek, i nie porównuje twoich wyników z innymi tabelami.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Jakiego systemu licytacji używają gracze komputerowi?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Na stronie pokazana jest umowa dla początkujących. Jest taki sam, niezależnie od wybranego języka interfejsu; nie jest to krajowy system brydżowy ani kompletna karta na konwencję turniejową.","Can I play online with other people?":"Czy mogę grać online z innymi ludźmi?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Nie. Jedna osoba gra w South przeciwko trzem lokalnym graczom komputerowym. Nie ma dobierania graczy, gier kontowych ani serwerowych.","How does the game score a hand?":"W jaki sposób gra punktuje rozdanie?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Pokazuje kontrakt, podatność na ataki, wymagane lewy i zduplikowany wynik w oparciu o poziom kontraktu, obciążenie, double/rekontra, over-tricki lub under-tricki oraz premie za grę lub slam.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Czy komputer gra jak silny partner w brydżu?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Nie. Boty wykonują legalne wezwania i zabawy, ale stosują prostą heurystykę dla początkujących. Ich decyzje nie stanowią modelu eksperckiego licytacji ani gry w karty.","Scope and limitations":"Zakres i ograniczenia","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"To jest stół treningowy, a nie internetowy serwis brydżowy, dyrektor turnieju czy ekspert w rozwiązywaniu problemów. Umowa przetargowa na start jest celowo niewielka i udokumentowana. Wyświetlany jest wynik rozdania w stylu zduplikowanym; punkty meczowe, IMP, punktacja gumowa, alerty, roszczenia, odwołania sprostowań i orzeczenia dyrektorów nie są wdrażane.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Jedna kompletna ręka treningowa w stylu duplikatu. Zawsze siedzisz na południu; Północ-Południe i Wschód-Zachód są partnerami.","Starter bidding agreement":"Umowa przetargowa na start","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Naturalna zgoda początkującego: 1BA = zrównoważone 15–17 punktów z wysokich kart; otwarcie koloru zaczyna się od 12 punktów. Odpowiedzi i wezwania to prosta heurystyka praktyki, a nie porada ekspercka czy system krajowy.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Podatność na tę rękę","Neither side vulnerable":"Żadna ze stron nie jest zagrożona","North–South vulnerable":"Północ–południe bezbronne","East–West vulnerable":"Wschód–Zachód bezbronny","Both sides vulnerable":"Obie strony bezbronne","Dealer":"Sprzedawca","North":"Północ","East":"Wschód","South · you":"Południe · ty","West":"Zachód","North–South":"Północ–Południe","East–West":"Wschód – Zachód","Hand":"Ręka","Auction":"Aukcja","Contract":"Umowa","To act":"Aby działać","Your turn":"Twoja kolej","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} myśli…","Level":"Poziom","Strain":"Szczep","Clubs":"Kluby","Diamonds":"Diamenty","Hearts":"Serca","Spades":"Piki","No trump":"Brak atu","Bid":"Licytuj","Pass":"Przepustka","Double":"Podwójne","Redouble":"Rekontra","No bid is available at that level.":"Brak dostępnych ofert na tym poziomie.","Declarer":"Deklaracja","Dummy":"Manekin","Opening leader":"Lider otwarcia","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy zostaje ujawniony po rozpoczęciu.","Your hand":"Twoja ręka","Dummy hand":"Manekin dłoni","Hidden hand":"Ukryta ręka","Current trick":"Aktualna sztuczka","Tricks won":"Wygrane sztuczki","Duplicate-style score":"Zduplikowana partytura","North–South total":"Łącznie północ–południe","East–West total":"Wschód–Zachód łącznie","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Wybierz ustawienie ręki i rozpocznij aukcję.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Aukcja zakończona. Pierwszy gra lider otwierający.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Cztery przejścia: plansza zemdlała. Rozdaj następne rozdanie, gdy będziesz gotowy.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Zawarto umowę: sztuczki {tricks}, punkty {score} dla {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Kontrakt upadł: sztuczki {tricks}, {score} wskazuje na {side}.","Hand result":"Wynik rozdania","Deal next hand":"Rozdaj następne rozdanie","New hand":"Nowe rozdanie","Export score sheet":"Eksportuj arkusz wyników","Choose a legal call.":"Wybierz legalną rozmowę.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Podążaj za diodami, kiedy tylko możesz.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Gracze komputerowi korzystają z lokalnych zasad dla początkujących. Żadne dane nie opuszczają tego urządzenia.","Rules reference":"Odniesienie do zasad","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Światowa Federacja Brydżowa · Przepisy dotyczące duplikatu mostu 2017, przepisy 73 i 89 zaktualizowane w 2024 r."},"sv":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Träningsspel för kontraktsbrygga","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Spela Contract Bridge online mot lokala datorspelare","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Öva en hand av duplicerad kontraktsbrygga mot tre lokala datorspelare på nybörjarnivå. Bjud, följ efter, kontrollera dummy som deklarator och se en tydlig poäng. Ingen online multiplayer.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Spela en komplett hand av kontraktsbridge mot tre lokala datorspelare. Gränssnittsspråket väljer aldrig en budgivningskonvention eller landsspecifika regler.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Kort, bud och poäng stannar i den här webbläsaren. Spelet använder inte ett konto, uppladdning eller online-motståndare.","One hand from deal to score":"En hand från affär till poäng","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Auktionen slutar med 4♠ dubblad. Den deklarerande sidan måste ta tio stick; öppningsledningen kommer från spelaren till vänster om deklaranten. Efter den ledningen visas dummy och deklaranten väljer kort från båda händerna.","A beginner practice version":"En övningsversion för nybörjare","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Detta är en övningshand med dubbla bryggor för ett bord. Den tillämpar laglig budordning, passning, dubbel, fördubbling, efterföljande spel, trumfjämförelse, dummykontroll av deklareraren och en duplikatliknande poäng för handen. De inbyggda datorspelarna använder en liten naturlig startöverenskommelse: 1NT visar balanserade 15–17 höga kortpoäng; färgöppningar börjar vid 12 poäng; svar och överrop är medvetet grundläggande. Dessa motståndare är övningsrobotar, inte expertbryggprogram. Turneringsbeslut, varningar, partnerskapskonventioner och jämförelser av matchpunkter ligger utanför denna version.","Questions":"Frågor","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Är det här gummibryggan eller duplikatbryggan?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Den poängsätter varje hand separat med dubbletter av kontraktspoäng. Den bär inte delpoäng framåt som gummibryggan gör, och den jämför inte ditt resultat med andra tabeller.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Vilket budgivningssystem använder datorspelarna?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Ett naturligt startavtal för nybörjare visas på sidan. Det är samma vilket gränssnittsspråk du än väljer; det är inte ett nationellt bridgesystem eller ett komplett turneringskort.","Can I play online with other people?":"Kan jag spela online med andra?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Nr. En person spelar söderut mot tre lokala datorspelare. Det finns inget matchmaking-, konto- eller serverspel.","How does the game score a hand?":"Hur får spelet en hand?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Den visar kontraktet, sårbarheten, knep som krävs och en dubblettpoäng baserat på kontraktsnivå, belastning, dubbel-/fördubbling, övertrick eller undertrick, och spel- eller slam-bonusar.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Leker datorn som en stark bridgepartner?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Nr. Botarna följer lagliga samtal och spel men använder enkla nybörjarheuristiker. Deras beslut är inte en modell av expertbudgivning eller kortspel.","Scope and limitations":"Omfattning och begränsningar","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Detta är ett träningsbord, inte en online bridgetjänst, turneringsledare eller expertlösare. Startbudsavtalet är avsiktligt litet och dokumenterat. Duplicerad handpoäng visas; matchpoints, IMPs, gummipoäng, varningar, anspråk, återkalla rättelser och direktörsbeslut implementeras inte.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"En komplett övningshand i duplikatstil. Du sitter alltid söderut; Nord–syd och öst–väst är partners.","Starter bidding agreement":"Startbudsavtal","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Naturligt nybörjaravtal: 1NT = balanserad 15–17 högkortspoäng; en färgöppning börjar vid 12 poäng. Svar och överanrop är enkla praxisheuristiker, inte expertråd eller ett nationellt system.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Sårbarhet för denna hand","Neither side vulnerable":"Ingen sida sårbar","North–South vulnerable":"Nord–Syd sårbar","East–West vulnerable":"Öst–väst sårbar","Both sides vulnerable":"Båda sidor sårbara","Dealer":"Återförsäljare","North":"Norr","East":"Öst","South · you":"Söder · du","West":"Väst","North–South":"Nord–Syd","East–West":"Öst–väst","Hand":"Hand","Auction":"Auktion","Contract":"Kontrakt","To act":"Att agera","Your turn":"Din tur","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} tänker...","Level":"Nivå","Strain":"Töjning","Clubs":"Klubbar","Diamonds":"Diamanter","Hearts":"Hjärtan","Spades":"Spader","No trump":"Ingen trumf","Bid":"Bud","Pass":"Pass","Double":"Dubbel","Redouble":"Fördubbla","No bid is available at that level.":"Inget bud är tillgängligt på den nivån.","Declarer":"Deklarerare","Dummy":"Dummy","Opening leader":"Öppningsledare","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy avslöjas efter öppningsledningen.","Your hand":"Din hand","Dummy hand":"Dummy hand","Hidden hand":"Dold hand","Current trick":"Aktuellt trick","Tricks won":"Tricks vann","Duplicate-style score":"Duplicerade poäng","North–South total":"Nord–Syd totalt","East–West total":"Öst–väst totalt","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Välj en handinställning och påbörja auktionen.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Auktion klar. Öppningsledaren spelar först.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Fyra pass: tavlan delas ut. Dela ut nästa hand när du är klar.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Kontrakt gjort: {tricks}-tricks, {score}-poäng för {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Kontraktet gick ner: {tricks}-trick, {score} pekar på {side}.","Hand result":"Handresultat","Deal next hand":"Deal nästa hand","New hand":"Ny hand","Export score sheet":"Exportera resultatblad","Choose a legal call.":"Välj ett juridiskt samtal.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Följ leddräkten när du kan.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Datorspelare använder lokala regler på nybörjarnivå. Ingen data lämnar den här enheten.","Rules reference":"Referens","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, lagar 73 och 89 uppdaterade 2024"},"th":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"เกมฝึกซ้อมสะพานสัญญา","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"เล่น Contract Bridge ออนไลน์กับผู้เล่นคอมพิวเตอร์ในพื้นที่","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"ฝึกทำสะพานเชื่อมสัญญาซ้ำกับผู้เล่นคอมพิวเตอร์ในพื้นที่ระดับเริ่มต้นสามคน ประมูลติดตามควบคุมหุ่นเป็นผู้ปฏิญาณและดูคะแนนชัดเจน ไม่มีผู้เล่นหลายคนออนไลน์","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"เล่นสัญญาสะพานที่สมบูรณ์หนึ่งมือกับผู้เล่นคอมพิวเตอร์ในพื้นที่สามคน ภาษาอินเทอร์เฟซจะไม่เลือกแบบแผนการเสนอราคาหรือกฎเฉพาะประเทศ","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"การ์ด ราคาเสนอซื้อ และคะแนนยังคงอยู่ในเบราว์เซอร์นี้ เกมดังกล่าวไม่ได้ใช้บัญชี การอัพโหลด หรือฝ่ายตรงข้ามออนไลน์","One hand from deal to score":"มือเดียวจากข้อตกลงหนึ่งไปยังอีกคะแนน","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"ปิดประมูลที่ 4♣ เพิ่มเป็นสองเท่า ฝ่ายประกาศต้องใช้สิบกล ผู้นำเปิดมาจากผู้เล่นถึงด้านซ้ายของผู้ประกาศ หลังจากนั้นผู้นำนั้นจะแสดงหุ่นจำลองและผู้ประกาศเลือกไพ่จากทั้งสองมือ","A beginner practice version":"เวอร์ชันฝึกหัดสำหรับผู้เริ่มต้น","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"นี่คือมือฝึกหัดบริดจ์แบบตารางเดียว ใช้คำสั่งการประมูลตามกฎหมาย, ส่งบอล, สองเท่า, สองเท่า, การเล่นตามหลัง, การเปรียบเทียบทรัมป์, การควบคุมหุ่นโดยผู้ประกาศ และคะแนนรูปแบบซ้ำสำหรับมือ ผู้เล่นคอมพิวเตอร์ในตัวใช้ข้อตกลงเริ่มต้นเล็กน้อย: 1NT แสดงแต้มไพ่สูง 15–17 แต้มที่สมดุล การเปิดชุดเริ่มต้นที่ 12 คะแนน การตอบสนองและการโอเวอร์คอลถือเป็นพื้นฐานโดยเจตนา ฝ่ายตรงข้ามเหล่านี้เป็นบอทฝึกหัด ไม่ใช่ซอฟต์แวร์บริดจ์ผู้เชี่ยวชาญ การตัดสินการแข่งขัน การแจ้งเตือน แบบแผนความร่วมมือ และการเปรียบเทียบแมตช์พอยต์อยู่นอกเวอร์ชันนี้","Questions":"คำถาม","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"สะพานยางหรือสะพานซ้ำ?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"มันให้คะแนนแต่ละมือแยกกันโดยใช้การให้คะแนนสัญญาแบบซ้ำกัน มันไม่ได้นำคะแนนส่วนไปข้างหน้าเหมือนกับที่สะพานยางทำ และไม่ได้เปรียบเทียบผลลัพธ์ของคุณกับตารางอื่นๆ","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"ผู้เล่นคอมพิวเตอร์ใช้ระบบประมูลอะไร?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"ข้อตกลงเริ่มต้นโดยธรรมชาติสำหรับผู้เริ่มต้นจะแสดงอยู่ในหน้านี้ มันเหมือนกับภาษาอินเทอร์เฟซที่คุณเลือก ไม่ใช่ระบบบริดจ์ระดับชาติหรือบัตรการประชุมทัวร์นาเมนต์ที่สมบูรณ์","Can I play online with other people?":"ฉันสามารถเล่นออนไลน์กับคนอื่นได้หรือไม่?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"เลขที่ คนหนึ่งเล่นทางใต้กับผู้เล่นคอมพิวเตอร์ในพื้นที่สามคน ไม่มีการจับคู่ บัญชี หรือเกมเซิร์ฟเวอร์","How does the game score a hand?":"เกมจะให้คะแนนมือได้อย่างไร?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"แสดงสัญญา ช่องโหว่ เทคนิคที่จำเป็น และคะแนนรูปแบบที่ซ้ำกันโดยอิงตามระดับสัญญา ความเครียด ดับเบิ้ล/ดับเบิ้ล โอเวอร์ทริคหรืออันเดอร์ทริค และโบนัสเกมหรือสแลม","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"คอมพิวเตอร์เล่นเหมือนพันธมิตรบริดจ์ที่แข็งแกร่งหรือไม่?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"เลขที่ บอทติดตามการเรียกร้องทางกฎหมายและการเล่น แต่ใช้การวิเคราะห์พฤติกรรมเบื้องต้นแบบง่ายๆ การตัดสินใจของพวกเขาไม่ใช่รูปแบบการประมูลของผู้เชี่ยวชาญหรือการเล่นไพ่","Scope and limitations":"ขอบเขตและข้อจำกัด","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"นี่คือตารางฝึกซ้อม ไม่ใช่บริการบริดจ์ออนไลน์ ผู้อำนวยการการแข่งขัน หรือนักแก้ปัญหาที่เชี่ยวชาญ ข้อตกลงการประมูลเริ่มต้นมีขนาดเล็กและจัดทำเป็นเอกสารโดยเจตนา คะแนนมือแบบซ้ำจะแสดงขึ้น Matchpoints, IMPs, การให้คะแนนยาง, การแจ้งเตือน, การเรียกร้อง, การเพิกถอนการแก้ไข และคำตัดสินของผู้อำนวยการจะไม่ถูกนำมาใช้","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"มือฝึกหัดสไตล์ซ้ำซ้อนที่สมบูรณ์หนึ่งมือ คุณมักจะนั่งทางใต้ เหนือ-ใต้และตะวันออก-ตะวันตกเป็นพันธมิตรกัน","Starter bidding agreement":"ข้อตกลงการประมูลเริ่มต้น","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"ข้อตกลงสำหรับผู้เริ่มต้นโดยธรรมชาติ: 1NT = แต้มไพ่สูง 15–17 แต้มที่สมดุล; การเปิดชุดเริ่มต้นที่ 12 คะแนน การตอบสนองและการโอเวอร์คอลเป็นการวิเคราะห์พฤติกรรมที่เรียบง่าย ไม่ใช่คำแนะนำจากผู้เชี่ยวชาญหรือระบบระดับชาติ","Vulnerability for this hand":"จุดอ่อนสำหรับมือนี้","Neither side vulnerable":"ไม่มีช่องโหว่ทั้งสองฝ่าย","North–South vulnerable":"พื้นที่เสี่ยงจากเหนือ–ใต้","East–West vulnerable":"ตะวันออก–ตะวันตกเสี่ยง","Both sides vulnerable":"ทั้งสองฝ่ายมีช่องโหว่","Dealer":"ตัวแทนจำหน่าย","North":"เหนือ","East":"ตะวันออก","South · you":"ใต้ · คุณ","West":"ตะวันตก","North–South":"เหนือ-ใต้","East–West":"ตะวันออก–ตะวันตก","Hand":"มือ","Auction":"ประมูล","Contract":"สัญญา","To act":"ดำเนินการ","Your turn":"ตาคุณ","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} กำลังคิด...","Level":"ระดับ","Strain":"สายพันธุ์","Clubs":"ไม้กอล์ฟ","Diamonds":"เพชร","Hearts":"หัวใจ","Spades":"โพดำ","No trump":"ไม่มีทรัมป์","Bid":"เสนอราคา","Pass":"ผ่าน","Double":"ดับเบิ้ล","Redouble":"เพิ่มเป็นสองเท่า","No bid is available at that level.":"ไม่มีการเสนอราคาในระดับนั้น","Declarer":"ผู้ประกาศ","Dummy":"ดัมมี่","Opening leader":"ผู้นำการเปิด","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"หุ่นจำลองถูกเปิดเผยหลังจากตะกั่วเปิด","Your hand":"มือของคุณ","Dummy hand":"มือจำลอง","Hidden hand":"มือที่ซ่อนอยู่","Current trick":"เคล็ดลับปัจจุบัน","Tricks won":"เคล็ดลับชนะ","Duplicate-style score":"คะแนนรูปแบบซ้ำกัน","North–South total":"ยอดรวมเหนือ–ใต้","East–West total":"ผลรวมตะวันออก–ตะวันตก","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"เลือกการตั้งค่ามือและเริ่มการประมูล","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"ประมูลเสร็จเรียบร้อย. ผู้นำเปิดเล่นก่อน","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"สี่รอบ: บอร์ดถูกส่งออกไป จัดการมือถัดไปเมื่อพร้อม","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"ทำสัญญา: เทคนิค {tricks}, คะแนน {score} สำหรับ {side}","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"สัญญาลดลง: เทคนิค {tricks}, {score} ชี้ไปที่ {side}","Hand result":"ผลแฮนด์","Deal next hand":"ดีลมือถัดไป","New hand":"มือใหม่","Export score sheet":"เอกสารคะแนนการส่งออก","Choose a legal call.":"เลือกสายที่ถูกกฎหมาย","Follow the led suit when you can.":"ติดตามชุดนำเมื่อทำได้","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"ผู้เล่นคอมพิวเตอร์ใช้กฎท้องถิ่นระดับเริ่มต้น ไม่มีข้อมูลออกจากอุปกรณ์นี้","Rules reference":"การอ้างอิงกฎ","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"สหพันธ์สะพานโลก · กฎของสะพานซ้ำ 2017, กฎหมาย 73 และ 89 อัปเดตปี 2024"},"uk":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Практична гра Contract Bridge","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Грайте в Contract Bridge онлайн проти локальних комп’ютерних гравців","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Відпрацюйте дублюючий контрактний бридж проти трьох локальних комп’ютерних гравців початкового рівня. Робіть ставки, наслідуйте приклад, керуйте манекеном як декларатор і дивіться чіткий рахунок. Без багатокористувацької онлайн-ігри.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Зіграйте одну повну роздачу контрактного бриджу проти трьох локальних комп’ютерних гравців. Мова інтерфейсу ніколи не вибирає угоду про призначення ставок або правила для певної країни.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Картки, ставки та результати залишаються в цьому браузері. Гра не використовує обліковий запис, завантаження або онлайн-супротивника.","One hand from deal to score":"Одна рука від роздачі до голу","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Аукціон закінчується через 4♠ подвоєні. Сторона, яка заявляє, повинна взяти десять прийомів; початкова перевага йде від гравця зліва від оголошувача. Після цього показується манекен і декларатор вибирає карти з обох рук.","A beginner practice version":"Практична версія для початківців","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Це роздача дублюючих бриджів для одного столу. Він застосовує юридичний порядок ставок, пас, подвоєння, подвоєння, гру за схемою, порівняння козирів, фіктивний контроль за декларатором і дублюючий стиль оцінки для роздачі. Вбудовані комп’ютерні програвачі використовують невелику природну стартову угоду: 1NT показує збалансовані 15–17 очок старших карт; відкриття мастей починається з 12 очок; відповіді та оверколли навмисно базові. Ці опоненти — тренувальні боти, а не експертне програмне забезпечення для мостів. Правила турнірів, сповіщення, угоди про партнерство та порівняння матчів не входять у цю версію.","Questions":"Питання","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Це гумовий міст чи дублікат моста?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Оцінюється кожна роздача окремо, використовуючи дублікат контрактного стилю. Він не переносить часткові бали вперед, як гумовий міст, і не порівнює ваш результат з іншими таблицями.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Яку систему ставок використовують комп’ютерні гравці?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"На сторінці показано початкову угоду для початківців. Це однаково, яку б мову інтерфейсу ви не вибрали; це не національна система бриджу чи повна картка турніру.","Can I play online with other people?":"Чи можу я грати онлайн з іншими людьми?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"№ Одна особа грає на Південь проти трьох місцевих комп’ютерних гравців. Немає матчів, облікових записів чи серверних ігор.","How does the game score a hand?":"Як гра оцінює руку?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Він показує контракт, вразливість, необхідні трюки та дубльований бал на основі рівня контракту, напруги, подвоєння/подвоєння, овертриків або недостатніх трюків, а також бонуси за гру або удар.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Чи грає комп’ютер як сильний партнер по бриджу?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"№ Боти дотримуються законних викликів і ігор, але використовують просту евристику для початківців. Їхні рішення не є зразком експертних ставок чи карткової гри.","Scope and limitations":"Сфера застосування та обмеження","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Це таблиця для тренувань, а не онлайн-сервіс бриджу, директор турніру чи експертний розв’язувач. Договір початкових торгів навмисно невеликий і задокументований. Відображається дубльований рахунок руки; матчпойнти, IMP, підрахунок балів, попередження, претензії, відкликання виправлень і рішення директора не реалізуються.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Одна повна копія тренувальної руки. Ви завжди сидите на півдні; Північ-Південь і Схід-Захід є партнерами.","Starter bidding agreement":"Угода про початок торгів","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Звичайна угода для початківців: 1NT = збалансовані 15–17 очок старшої карти; відкриття масті починається з 12 очок. Відповіді та повторні виклики – це проста практична евристика, а не поради експертів чи національна система.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Уразливість для цієї руки","Neither side vulnerable":"Жодна сторона не вразлива","North–South vulnerable":"Уразливий з півночі на південь","East–West vulnerable":"Схід-Захід вразливий","Both sides vulnerable":"Обидві сторони вразливі","Dealer":"Дилер","North":"Півн","East":"Іст","South · you":"Південь · ти","West":"Зах","North–South":"Північ–Південь","East–West":"Схід–Захід","Hand":"Рука","Auction":"Аукціон","Contract":"Контракт","To act":"Діяти","Your turn":"Ваша черга","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} думає…","Level":"Рівень","Strain":"Штам","Clubs":"Булави","Diamonds":"Діаманти","Hearts":"Серця","Spades":"Піки","No trump":"Без козиря","Bid":"Пропозиція","Pass":"Пас","Double":"Подвійний","Redouble":"Подв","No bid is available at that level.":"На цьому рівні ставка недоступна.","Declarer":"Декларатор","Dummy":"Манекен","Opening leader":"Лідер відкриття","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Манекен відкривається після початкового ліда.","Your hand":"Твоя рука","Dummy hand":"Рука-манекен","Hidden hand":"Прихована рука","Current trick":"Поточний трюк","Tricks won":"Виграні трюки","Duplicate-style score":"Оцінка дублюючого стилю","North–South total":"Усього північ–південь","East–West total":"Всього схід–захід","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Виберіть налаштування руки та розпочніть аукціон.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Аукціон завершено. Першим грає ведучий, що відкриває гру.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Чотири проходи: дошка втрачена. Роздайте наступну роздачу, коли будете готові.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Укладено контракт: трюки {tricks}, бали {score} для {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Контракт погіршився: хитрощі {tricks}, {score} вказує на {side}.","Hand result":"Ручний результат","Deal next hand":"Угода наступного разу","New hand":"Нова рука","Export score sheet":"Експортувати бланк оцінок","Choose a legal call.":"Виберіть офіційний дзвінок.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Коли зможете, слідкуйте за костюмом.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Комп’ютерні гравці використовують місцеві правила початкового рівня. Дані не залишають цей пристрій.","Rules reference":"Посилання на правила","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Всесвітня федерація бриджів · Закони про дублювання мостів 2017, Закони 73 і 89 оновлені 2024"},"sw":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Mchezo wa Mazoezi ya Daraja la Mkataba","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Cheza Daraja la Mkataba Mtandaoni Dhidi ya Wachezaji wa Kompyuta za Karibu Nawe","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Jizoeze kutumia nakala ya daraja la mkataba dhidi ya wachezaji watatu wa kompyuta wa ndani wa kiwango cha wanaoanza. Zabuni, fuata nyayo, udhibiti dummy kama mtangazaji na uone alama wazi. Hakuna wachezaji wengi mtandaoni.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Cheza mkono mmoja kamili wa daraja la mkataba dhidi ya wachezaji watatu wa ndani wa kompyuta. Lugha ya kiolesura haiteuli kamwe mkataba wa zabuni au sheria mahususi za nchi.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Kadi, zabuni na alama hukaa kwenye kivinjari hiki. Mchezo hautumii akaunti, kupakia au mpinzani mtandaoni.","One hand from deal to score":"Mkono mmoja kutoka kwa mpango hadi alama","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Mnada unaisha baada ya 4♠ kuongezwa maradufu. Upande wa kutangaza lazima uchukue hila kumi; uongozi wa ufunguzi unatoka kwa mchezaji hadi kushoto kwa mtangazaji. Baada ya uongozi huo, dummy inaonyeshwa na mtangazaji huchagua kadi kutoka kwa mikono yote miwili.","A beginner practice version":"Toleo la mazoezi la wanaoanza","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Huu ni mkono wa mazoezi wa daraja la jedwali moja. Inatumika agizo la zabuni la kisheria, kupita, mara mbili, kurudiwa, kucheza kwa kufuata, kulinganisha turufu, udhibiti wa dummy na mtangazaji na alama ya mkono inayofanana. Wachezaji wa kompyuta waliojengwa hutumia makubaliano madogo ya mwanzo wa asili: 1NT inaonyesha uwiano wa pointi 15-17 za kadi ya juu; fursa za suti huanza kwa pointi 12; majibu na overcalls ni ya msingi kwa makusudi. Wapinzani hawa ni roboti za mazoezi, sio programu ya daraja la kitaalam. Hukumu za mashindano, arifa, mikataba ya ushirikiano na ulinganisho wa pointi ziko nje ya toleo hili.","Questions":"Maswali","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Je, hili ni daraja la mpira au marudio?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Huweka alama kwa kila mkono kivyake kwa kutumia alama za kandarasi za mtindo unaorudiwa. Haipeleki alama za sehemu mbele kama vile daraja la mpira inavyofanya, na hailinganishi matokeo yako na jedwali zingine.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Wachezaji wa kompyuta hutumia mfumo gani wa zabuni?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Makubaliano ya mwanzilishi asilia yanaonyeshwa kwenye ukurasa. Ni sawa na lugha ya kiolesura unayochagua; sio mfumo wa daraja la kitaifa au kadi kamili ya mkutano wa mashindano.","Can I play online with other people?":"Je, ninaweza kucheza mtandaoni na watu wengine?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Na. Mtu mmoja anacheza Kusini dhidi ya wachezaji watatu wa ndani wa kompyuta. Hakuna ulinganishaji, akaunti au mchezo wa seva.","How does the game score a hand?":"Je, mchezo unapata mkono kwa njia gani?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Inaonyesha mkataba, uwezekano wa kuathiriwa, mbinu zinazohitajika na alama ya mtindo unaorudiwa kulingana na kiwango cha mkataba, matatizo, maradufu/maradufu, mbinu za ziada au mbinu za chini, na bonasi za mchezo au slam.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Je, kompyuta inacheza kama mshirika mwenye nguvu wa daraja?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Na. Vijibu hufuata simu na michezo halali lakini tumia mbinu rahisi za kuanza. Maamuzi yao si mfano wa zabuni ya kitaalamu au kucheza kadi.","Scope and limitations":"Upeo na mapungufu","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Hili ni jedwali la mazoezi, si huduma ya daraja la mtandaoni, mkurugenzi wa mashindano au kisuluhishi cha utaalam. Mkataba wa zabuni ya mwanzilishi ni mdogo kimakusudi na umeandikwa. Alama ya mkono ya mtindo-rudufu huonyeshwa; alama za mechi, IMP, bao la mpira, arifa, madai, kubatilisha masahihisho na maamuzi ya mkurugenzi hayatekelezwi.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Mkono mmoja kamili wa mazoezi wa mtindo unaorudiwa. Wewe huketi Kusini kila wakati; Kaskazini-Kusini na Mashariki-Magharibi ni washirika.","Starter bidding agreement":"Mkataba wa zabuni wa Kuanzisha","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Mkataba wa mwanzilishi asilia: 1NT = pointi 15–17 za kadi ya juu zilizosawazishwa; ufunguzi wa suti huanza kwa pointi 12. Majibu na nyongeza ni mbinu rahisi za utabiri, si ushauri wa kitaalamu au mfumo wa kitaifa.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Madhara kwa mkono huu","Neither side vulnerable":"Hakuna upande ulio hatarini","North–South vulnerable":"Kaskazini-Kusini katika mazingira magumu","East–West vulnerable":"Mashariki-Magharibi katika mazingira magumu","Both sides vulnerable":"Pande zote mbili ziko hatarini","Dealer":"Mchuuzi","North":"Kaskazini","East":"Mashariki","South · you":"Kusini · wewe","West":"Magharibi","North–South":"Kaskazini-Kusini","East–West":"Mashariki-Magharibi","Hand":"Mkono","Auction":"Mnada","Contract":"Mkataba","To act":"Kutenda","Your turn":"Zamu yako","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} anafikiria…","Level":"Kiwango","Strain":"Mfano","Clubs":"Vilabu","Diamonds":"Almasi","Hearts":"Mioyo","Spades":"Spades","No trump":"Hakuna trump","Bid":"Zabuni","Pass":"Pasi","Double":"Mbili","Redouble":"Radufu","No bid is available at that level.":"Hakuna zabuni inayopatikana katika kiwango hicho.","Declarer":"Mtangazaji","Dummy":"Dummy","Opening leader":"Kiongozi wa ufunguzi","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy inafichuliwa baada ya uongozi wa ufunguzi.","Your hand":"Mkono wako","Dummy hand":"Mkono dummy","Hidden hand":"Mkono uliofichwa","Current trick":"Ujanja wa sasa","Tricks won":"Ujanja umeshinda","Duplicate-style score":"Alama ya mtindo rudufu","North–South total":"Kaskazini-Kusini jumla","East–West total":"Jumla ya Mashariki-Magharibi","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Chagua mpangilio wa mkono na uanze mnada.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Mnada umekamilika. Kiongozi wa ufunguzi anacheza kwanza.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Pasi nne: ubao umepitishwa. Shughulikia mkono unaofuata ukiwa tayari.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Mkataba umefanywa: Mbinu za {tricks}, pointi {score} za {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Mkataba ulipungua: mbinu za {tricks}, pointi {score} hadi {side}.","Hand result":"Tokeo la mkono","Deal next hand":"Shiriki mkono unaofuata","New hand":"Mkono mpya","Export score sheet":"Hamisha laha ya alama","Choose a legal call.":"Chagua simu ya kisheria.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Fuata suti inayoongoza unapoweza.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Wachezaji wa kompyuta hutumia sheria za ndani za kiwango cha wanaoanza. Hakuna data inayoondoka kwenye kifaa hiki.","Rules reference":"Marejeleo ya kanuni","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Shirikisho la Daraja Ulimwenguni · Sheria za Daraja Nakala 2017, Sheria za 73 na 89 zimesasishwa 2024"},"mr":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"काँट्रॅक्ट ब्रिज सराव गेम","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"स्थानिक कॉम्प्युटर प्लेयर्स विरुद्ध कॉन्ट्रॅक्ट ब्रिज ऑनलाइन खेळा","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"तीन नवशिक्या-स्तरीय स्थानिक संगणक खेळाडूंविरुद्ध डुप्लिकेट कॉन्ट्रॅक्ट ब्रिजचा सराव करा. बोली लावा, खटला फॉलो करा, डिक्लेअर म्हणून डमी नियंत्रित करा आणि स्पष्ट स्कोअर पहा. ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेअर नाही.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"तीन स्थानिक संगणक खेळाडूंविरुद्ध कॉन्ट्रॅक्ट ब्रिजचा एक संपूर्ण हात खेळा. इंटरफेस भाषा कधीही बिडिंग कन्व्हेन्शन किंवा देश-विशिष्ट नियम निवडत नाही.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"कार्ड, बिड आणि स्कोअर या ब्राउझरमध्ये राहतात. गेम खाते, अपलोड किंवा ऑनलाइन विरोधक वापरत नाही.","One hand from deal to score":"डीलपासून स्कोअरकडे एक हात","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"लिलाव दुप्पट 4♠ मध्ये संपेल. घोषित बाजूने दहा युक्त्या घेतल्या पाहिजेत; सुरुवातीची आघाडी खेळाडूकडून घोषित करणाऱ्याच्या डावीकडे येते. त्या आघाडीनंतर, डमी दाखवला जातो आणि घोषितकर्ता दोन्ही हातातून कार्ड निवडतो.","A beginner practice version":"एक नवशिक्या सराव आवृत्ती","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"हा एकल-टेबल डुप्लिकेट-ब्रिज सराव हात आहे. हे कायदेशीर बिड ऑर्डर, पास, दुहेरी, दुप्पट, फॉलो-सूट प्ले, ट्रम्प तुलना, घोषणाकर्त्याद्वारे डमी नियंत्रण आणि हातासाठी डुप्लिकेट-शैलीचा स्कोअर लागू करते. अंगभूत संगणक खेळाडू लहान नैसर्गिक स्टार्टर कराराचा वापर करतात: 1NT संतुलित 15-17 उच्च-कार्ड पॉइंट्स दाखवते; सूट उघडणे 12 गुणांनी सुरू होते; प्रतिसाद आणि ओव्हरकॉल मुद्दाम मूलभूत आहेत. हे विरोधक सराव बॉट्स आहेत, तज्ञ ब्रिज सॉफ्टवेअर नाहीत. टूर्नामेंट नियम, सूचना, भागीदारी नियमावली आणि मॅचपॉइंट तुलना या आवृत्तीच्या बाहेर आहेत.","Questions":"प्रश्न","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"हा रबर ब्रिज आहे की डुप्लिकेट ब्रिज?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"हे डुप्लिकेट-शैलीतील कॉन्ट्रॅक्ट स्कोअरिंग वापरून प्रत्येक हात स्वतंत्रपणे स्कोअर करते. हे रबर ब्रिजप्रमाणे भाग-स्कोअर पुढे नेत नाही आणि ते तुमच्या निकालाची इतर सारण्यांशी तुलना करत नाही.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"संगणक खेळाडू कोणती बोली प्रणाली वापरतात?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"एक नवशिक्या नैसर्गिक स्टार्टर करार पृष्ठावर दर्शविला आहे. तुम्ही जी इंटरफेस भाषा निवडाल तीच आहे; हे राष्ट्रीय पूल प्रणाली किंवा संपूर्ण स्पर्धेचे अधिवेशन कार्ड नाही.","Can I play online with other people?":"मी इतर लोकांसह ऑनलाइन खेळू शकतो का?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"नं. एक व्यक्ती तीन स्थानिक संगणक खेळाडूंविरुद्ध दक्षिण खेळतो. कोणतेही मॅचमेकिंग, खाते किंवा सर्व्हर गेम नाही.","How does the game score a hand?":"गेम हाताचा स्कोर कसा करतो?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"हे करार, भेद्यता, आवश्यक युक्त्या आणि करार स्तर, ताण, दुहेरी/दुहेरी, ओव्हरट्रिक्स किंवा अंडरट्रिक्स आणि गेम किंवा स्लॅम बोनसवर आधारित डुप्लिकेट-शैलीतील स्कोअर दर्शविते.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"कंप्युटर मजबूत ब्रिज पार्टनर सारखा खेळतो का?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"नं. बॉट्स कायदेशीर कॉल आणि नाटकांचे अनुसरण करतात परंतु साध्या नवशिक्या ह्युरिस्टिक्स वापरतात. त्यांचे निर्णय तज्ञ बोली किंवा पत्ते खेळण्याचे मॉडेल नाहीत.","Scope and limitations":"व्याप्ति आणि मर्यादा","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"हे एक सराव टेबल आहे, ऑनलाइन ब्रिज सर्व्हिस, टूर्नामेंट डायरेक्टर किंवा तज्ञ सॉल्व्हर नाही. स्टार्टर बिडिंग करार हेतुपुरस्सर छोटा आणि दस्तऐवजीकरण केलेला आहे. डुप्लिकेट-शैलीतील हात स्कोअर दर्शविला आहे; मॅचपॉइंट्स, आयएमपी, रबर स्कोअरिंग, ॲलर्ट, दावे, रिव्होक रेक्टिफिकेशन्स आणि डायरेक्टर रुलिंग्सची अंमलबजावणी होत नाही.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"एक संपूर्ण डुप्लिकेट-शैलीचा सराव हात. तुम्ही नेहमी दक्षिणेत बसता; उत्तर-दक्षिण आणि पूर्व-पश्चिम भागीदार आहेत.","Starter bidding agreement":"स्टार्टर बिडिंग करार","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"नैसर्गिक नवशिक्या करार: 1NT = संतुलित 15-17 उच्च-कार्ड पॉइंट्स; एक सूट उघडणे 12 गुणांनी सुरू होते. प्रतिसाद आणि ओव्हरकॉल हे साधे सराव हेरिस्टिक्स आहेत, तज्ञांचा सल्ला किंवा राष्ट्रीय प्रणाली नाही.","Vulnerability for this hand":"या हातासाठी असुरक्षा","Neither side vulnerable":"कोणतीही बाजू असुरक्षित नाही","North–South vulnerable":"उत्तर-दक्षिण असुरक्षित","East–West vulnerable":"पूर्व-पश्चिम असुरक्षित","Both sides vulnerable":"दोन्ही बाजू असुरक्षित","Dealer":"डीलर","North":"उत्तर","East":"पूर्व","South · you":"दक्षिण · तुम्ही","West":"वेस्ट","North–South":"उत्तर-दक्षिण","East–West":"पूर्व-पश्चिम","Hand":"हात","Auction":"लिलाव","Contract":"करार","To act":"कार्य करण्यासाठी","Your turn":"तुमची पाळी","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} विचार करत आहे…","Level":"स्तर","Strain":"स्ट्रेन","Clubs":"क्लब","Diamonds":"हिरे","Hearts":"हृदय","Spades":"Spades","No trump":"नो ट्रम्प","Bid":"बिड","Pass":"पास","Double":"दुहेरी","Redouble":"दुप्पट","No bid is available at that level.":"त्या स्तरावर कोणतीही बोली उपलब्ध नाही.","Declarer":"घोषक","Dummy":"डमी","Opening leader":"ओपनिंग लीडर","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"ओपनिंग लीडनंतर डमी उघड झाले आहे.","Your hand":"तुमचा हात","Dummy hand":"डमी हात","Hidden hand":"लपलेले हात","Current trick":"सध्याची युक्ती","Tricks won":"युक्त्या जिंकल्या","Duplicate-style score":"डुप्लिकेट-शैलीतील स्कोअर","North–South total":"उत्तर-दक्षिण एकूण","East–West total":"पूर्व-पश्चिम एकूण","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"हँड सेटिंग निवडा आणि लिलाव सुरू करा.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"लिलाव पूर्ण. सुरुवातीचा नेता प्रथम खेळतो.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"चार पास: बोर्ड पास झाला आहे. तयार झाल्यावर पुढचा व्यवहार करा.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"करार केला: {tricks} युक्त्या, {side} साठी {score} गुण.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"करार कमी झाला: {tricks} युक्त्या, {score} गुण {side}.","Hand result":"हात निकाल","Deal next hand":"पुढे डील करा","New hand":"नवीन हात","Export score sheet":"स्कोअर शीट निर्यात करा","Choose a legal call.":"एक कायदेशीर कॉल निवडा.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"जेव्हा शक्य असेल तेव्हा एलईडी सूटचे अनुसरण करा.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"संगणक खेळाडू नवशिक्या-स्तरीय स्थानिक नियम वापरतात. कोणताही डेटा या डिव्हाइसला सोडत नाही.","Rules reference":"नियम संदर्भ","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"वर्ल्ड ब्रिज फेडरेशन · डुप्लिकेट ब्रिजचे कायदे 2017, कायदे 73 आणि 89 2024 अद्यतनित"},"te":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"కాంట్రాక్ట్ బ్రిడ్జ్ ప్రాక్టీస్ గేమ్","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"స్థానిక కంప్యూటర్ ప్లేయర్లకు వ్యతిరేకంగా ఆన్లైన్లో కాంట్రాక్ట్ బ్రిడ్జ్ ప్లే చేయండి","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"ముగ్గురు బిగినర్స్-లెవల్ లోకల్ కంప్యూటర్ ప్లేయర్లకు వ్యతిరేకంగా డూప్లికేట్ కాంట్రాక్ట్ బ్రిడ్జిని ప్రాక్టీస్ చేయండి. వేలం వేయండి, అనుసరించండి, డమ్మీని డిక్లరర్గా నియంత్రించండి మరియు స్పష్టమైన స్కోర్ను చూడండి. ఆన్లైన్ మల్టీప్లేయర్ లేదు.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"ముగ్గురు లోకల్ కంప్యూటర్ ప్లేయర్లకు వ్యతిరేకంగా కాంట్రాక్ట్ బ్రిడ్జ్ యొక్క ఒక పూర్తి చేతిని ప్లే చేయండి. ఇంటర్ఫేస్ భాష ఎప్పుడూ బిడ్డింగ్ కన్వెన్షన్ను లేదా దేశ-నిర్దిష్ట నియమాలను ఎంచుకోదు.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"కార్డులు, బిడ్లు మరియు స్కోర్లు ఈ బ్రౌజర్లో ఉంటాయి. గేమ్ ఖాతా, అప్లోడ్ లేదా ఆన్లైన్ ప్రత్యర్థిని ఉపయోగించదు.","One hand from deal to score":"ఒప్పందం నుండి స్కోర్ వరకు ఒక చేయి","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"4♠లో వేలం ముగుస్తుంది రెట్టింపు. ప్రకటించే పక్షం తప్పనిసరిగా పది ఉపాయాలు తీసుకోవాలి; ఓపెనింగ్ లీడ్ ప్లేయర్ నుండి డిక్లరర్ ఎడమ వైపుకు వస్తుంది. ఆ దారి తర్వాత, డమ్మీ చూపబడుతుంది మరియు డిక్లరర్ రెండు చేతుల నుండి కార్డ్లను ఎంచుకుంటాడు.","A beginner practice version":"ఒక బిగినర్స్ ప్రాక్టీస్ వెర్షన్","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"ఇది సింగిల్-టేబుల్ డూప్లికేట్-బ్రిడ్జ్ ప్రాక్టీస్ హ్యాండ్. ఇది లీగల్ బిడ్ ఆర్డర్, పాస్, డబుల్, రెడబుల్, ఫాలో-సూట్ ప్లే, ట్రంప్ కంపారిజన్, డిక్లరర్ ద్వారా డమ్మీ కంట్రోల్ మరియు హ్యాండ్కి డూప్లికేట్-స్టైల్ స్కోర్ని వర్తిస్తుంది. అంతర్నిర్మిత కంప్యూటర్ ప్లేయర్లు చిన్న సహజ స్టార్టర్ ఒప్పందాన్ని ఉపయోగిస్తాయి: 1NT సమతుల్య 15–17 హై-కార్డ్ పాయింట్లను చూపుతుంది; సూట్ ఓపెనింగ్లు 12 పాయింట్ల వద్ద ప్రారంభమవుతాయి; ప్రతిస్పందనలు మరియు ఓవర్కాల్లు ఉద్దేశపూర్వకంగా ప్రాథమికమైనవి. ఈ ప్రత్యర్థులు ప్రాక్టీస్ బాట్లు, నిపుణులైన వంతెన సాఫ్ట్వేర్ కాదు. టోర్నమెంట్ తీర్పులు, హెచ్చరికలు, భాగస్వామ్య సమావేశాలు మరియు మ్యాచ్పాయింట్ పోలికలు ఈ సంస్కరణకు వెలుపల ఉన్నాయి.","Questions":"ప్రశ్నలు","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"ఇది రబ్బరు వంతెననా లేదా నకిలీ వంతెననా?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"ఇది డూప్లికేట్-స్టైల్ కాంట్రాక్ట్ స్కోరింగ్ని ఉపయోగించి ప్రతి చేతిని విడిగా స్కోర్ చేస్తుంది. ఇది రబ్బరు వంతెన వలె పార్ట్-స్కోర్లను ముందుకు తీసుకెళ్లదు మరియు ఇది మీ ఫలితాన్ని ఇతర పట్టికలతో పోల్చదు.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"కంప్యూటర్ ప్లేయర్లు ఏ బిడ్డింగ్ సిస్టమ్ని ఉపయోగిస్తున్నారు?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"ఒక బిగినర్స్ సహజ స్టార్టర్ ఒప్పందం పేజీలో చూపబడింది. మీరు ఎంచుకున్న ఇంటర్ఫేస్ భాష అదే; ఇది జాతీయ వంతెన వ్యవస్థ లేదా పూర్తి టోర్నమెంట్ కన్వెన్షన్ కార్డ్ కాదు.","Can I play online with other people?":"నేను ఇతర వ్యక్తులతో ఆన్లైన్లో ఆడవచ్చా?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"నం. ఒక వ్యక్తి మూడు స్థానిక కంప్యూటర్ ప్లేయర్లతో సౌత్ను ఆడతాడు. మ్యాచ్ మేకింగ్, ఖాతా లేదా సర్వర్ గేమ్ లేదు.","How does the game score a hand?":"గేమ్ ఎలా స్కోర్ చేస్తుంది?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"ఇది కాంట్రాక్ట్ స్థాయి, స్ట్రెయిన్, డబుల్/రెడుబుల్, ఓవర్ట్రిక్లు లేదా అండర్ట్రిక్లు మరియు గేమ్ లేదా స్లామ్ బోనస్ల ఆధారంగా కాంట్రాక్ట్, దుర్బలత్వం, అవసరమైన ట్రిక్స్ మరియు డూప్లికేట్-స్టైల్ స్కోర్ను చూపుతుంది.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"కంప్యూటర్ బలమైన వంతెన భాగస్వామి వలె ప్లే చేస్తుందా?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"నం. బాట్లు చట్టపరమైన కాల్లు మరియు నాటకాలను అనుసరిస్తాయి కానీ సాధారణ బిగినర్స్ హ్యూరిస్టిక్లను ఉపయోగిస్తాయి. వారి నిర్ణయాలు నిపుణుల బిడ్డింగ్ లేదా కార్డ్ ప్లే యొక్క నమూనా కాదు.","Scope and limitations":"పరిధి మరియు పరిమితులు","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"ఇది ప్రాక్టీస్ టేబుల్, ఆన్లైన్ బ్రిడ్జ్ సర్వీస్, టోర్నమెంట్ డైరెక్టర్ లేదా ఎక్స్పర్ట్ సోల్వర్ కాదు. స్టార్టర్ బిడ్డింగ్ ఒప్పందం ఉద్దేశపూర్వకంగా చిన్నది మరియు డాక్యుమెంట్ చేయబడింది. నకిలీ-శైలి హ్యాండ్ స్కోర్ చూపబడింది; మ్యాచ్పాయింట్లు, IMPలు, రబ్బర్ స్కోరింగ్, అలర్ట్లు, క్లెయిమ్లు, రివోక్ రెక్టిఫికేషన్లు మరియు డైరెక్టర్ రూలింగ్లు అమలు చేయబడవు.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"ఒక పూర్తి డూప్లికేట్-స్టైల్ ప్రాక్టీస్ హ్యాండ్. మీరు ఎల్లప్పుడూ దక్షిణంగా కూర్చుంటారు; ఉత్తర-దక్షిణ మరియు తూర్పు-పశ్చిమ భాగస్వాములు.","Starter bidding agreement":"స్టార్టర్ బిడ్డింగ్ ఒప్పందం","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"సహజ ప్రారంభ ఒప్పందం: 1NT = సమతుల్య 15–17 హై-కార్డ్ పాయింట్లు; సూట్ ఓపెనింగ్ 12 పాయింట్ల వద్ద ప్రారంభమవుతుంది. ప్రతిస్పందనలు మరియు ఓవర్కాల్లు సాధారణ అభ్యాస హ్యూరిస్టిక్స్, నిపుణుల సలహా లేదా జాతీయ వ్యవస్థ కాదు.","Vulnerability for this hand":"ఈ చేతికి హాని","Neither side vulnerable":"ఎటువంటి వైపు కూడా హాని లేదు","North–South vulnerable":"ఉత్తర-దక్షిణ హాని","East–West vulnerable":"తూర్పు-పశ్చిమ హాని","Both sides vulnerable":"రెండు వైపులా హాని ఉంది","Dealer":"డీలర్","North":"ఉత్తరం","East":"తూర్పు","South · you":"దక్షిణం · మీరు","West":"పశ్చిమ","North–South":"ఉత్తర-దక్షిణ","East–West":"తూర్పు-పశ్చిమ","Hand":"చేతి","Auction":"వేలం","Contract":"ఒప్పందం","To act":"నటన చేయడానికి","Your turn":"మీ వంతు","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} ఆలోచిస్తోంది…","Level":"స్థాయి","Strain":"స్ట్రెయిన్","Clubs":"క్లబ్లు","Diamonds":"డైమండ్స్","Hearts":"హార్ట్స్","Spades":"స్పేడ్స్","No trump":"ట్రంప్ లేదు","Bid":"బిడ్","Pass":"పాస్","Double":"డబుల్","Redouble":"రెట్టింపు","No bid is available at that level.":"ఆ స్థాయిలో బిడ్ అందుబాటులో లేదు.","Declarer":"డిక్లరర్","Dummy":"డమ్మీ","Opening leader":"ఓపెనింగ్ లీడర్","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"ఓపెనింగ్ లీడ్ తర్వాత డమ్మీ రివీల్ చేయబడింది.","Your hand":"మీ చేతి","Dummy hand":"డమ్మీ హ్యాండ్","Hidden hand":"దాచిన చేయి","Current trick":"ప్రస్తుత ట్రిక్","Tricks won":"ట్రిక్స్ గెలిచాయి","Duplicate-style score":"డూప్లికేట్-శైలి స్కోర్","North–South total":"ఉత్తర-దక్షిణ మొత్తం","East–West total":"తూర్పు-పశ్చిమ మొత్తం","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"చేతి సెట్టింగ్ని ఎంచుకుని వేలాన్ని ప్రారంభించండి.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"వేలం పూర్తయింది. ఓపెనింగ్ లీడర్ మొదట ఆడతాడు.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"నాలుగు పాస్లు: బోర్డు పాస్ అవుట్ చేయబడింది. సిద్ధంగా ఉన్నప్పుడు తదుపరి చేతితో వ్యవహరించండి.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"కాంట్రాక్ట్ చేయబడింది: {tricks} ట్రిక్స్, {side} కోసం {score} పాయింట్లు.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"కాంట్రాక్టు తగ్గింది: {tricks} ట్రిక్స్, {score} పాయింట్లు {side}.","Hand result":"హ్యాండ్ ఫలితం","Deal next hand":"తర్వాత డీల్ చేయండి","New hand":"కొత్త చేతి","Export score sheet":"ఎగుమతి స్కోర్ షీట్","Choose a legal call.":"చట్టపరమైన కాల్ని ఎంచుకోండి.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"మీకు వీలైనప్పుడు లీడ్ సూట్ను అనుసరించండి.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"కంప్యూటర్ ప్లేయర్లు ప్రారంభ స్థాయి స్థానిక నియమాలను ఉపయోగిస్తారు. ఈ పరికరం నుండి డేటా ఏదీ వదిలివేయబడదు.","Rules reference":"నియమాల సూచన","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"వరల్డ్ బ్రిడ్జ్ ఫెడరేషన్ · డూప్లికేట్ బ్రిడ్జ్ 2017 చట్టాలు, 73 మరియు 89 చట్టాలు 2024న నవీకరించబడ్డాయి"},"ha":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Wasan Kwarewar Gadar Kwangila","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Kwasa Gadar Kwangila Kan Layi Kan Masu Kwamfuta Na Gida","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Bidi, bi kwatance, sarrafa dummy a matsayin mai bayyanawa kuma duba tabbataccen ci. Babu mahaɗan kan layi.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Kwasa cikakkiyar gadar kwangilar hannu guda uku akan ƴan wasan kwamfuta na gida. Harshen mu'amala da yaren ba zai taɓa zaɓar babban yarjejeniya ko takamaiman ƙa'idodin ƙasa ba.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Katunan, tayi da maki sun tsaya a cikin wannan mazugi. Wasan baya amfani da asusu, loda ko abokin gaba na kan layi.","One hand from deal to score":"Hannu ɗaya daga ciniki zuwa ci","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Kasuwancin ya ƙare a cikin 4♠ ninki biyu. Bangaren ayyana dole ne ya ɗauki dabaru goma; jagorar budewa ta fito daga mai kunnawa zuwa hagun mai bayyanawa. Bayan wannan jagorar, ana nuna dummy kuma mai ba da labari ya zaɓi katunan daga hannaye biyu.","A beginner practice version":"Sigar aikin farawa","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Yana aiwatar da odar neman izini na doka, wucewa, sau biyu, sau biyu, wasan bi-da-kai, kwatancen trump, sarrafa juzu'i ta mai bayyanawa da kuma nau'in nau'in nau'in nau'in hannu. Ƙungiyoyin kwamfuta da aka gina a ciki suna amfani da ƙananan yarjejeniyar farawa ta halitta: 1NT yana nuna daidaitattun maki 15-17 babban katin kati; bude kwat da wando farawa a maki 12; amsa da kuma yawan kiran da ake yi da gangan ne. Waɗannan abokan adawar bots ne, ba ƙwararrun gada software ba. Hukunce-hukuncen gasar, faɗakarwa, yarjejeniyar haɗin gwiwa da kwatancen ma'auni suna wajen wannan sigar.","Questions":"Tambayoyi","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Shin wannan gadar roba ce ko gada mai kwafi?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Ba ya ɗaukar maki gaba kamar yadda gadar roba ke yi, kuma baya kwatanta sakamakon ku da sauran tebura.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Wane tsarin bidi'a ne 'yan wasan kwamfuta ke amfani da su?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Yarjejeniyar mafari ta halitta an nuna akan shafin. Haka ne duk yaren da kuka zaɓa; ba tsarin gada ba ne ko kuma cikakken katin taron gasa.","Can I play online with other people?":"Zan iya yin wasa akan layi tare da wasu mutane?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"No. Mutum daya yana buga Kudu da 'yan wasan kwamfuta uku na gida. Babu daidaitawa, lissafi ko wasan uwar garken.","How does the game score a hand?":"Yaya wasan yake cin hannun hannu?\nubG017X","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Yana nuna kwangilar, rauni, dabaru da ake buƙata da ƙima iri-iri dangane da matakin kwangila, iri, sau biyu/sau biyu, wuce gona da iri, da kari na wasa ko slam.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Shin kwamfutar tana wasa kamar abokin gada mai ƙarfi?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"No. Bots suna bin kiran doka da wasan kwaikwayo amma suna amfani da sauƙin mafari heuristics. Hukunce-hukuncen nasu ba samfurin ƙwararru ba ne ko wasan kati.","Scope and limitations":"Iyaka da iyakoki\nUBG021x Yarjejeniyar ƙaddamar da ƙaddamarwa ƙanana ce da gangan kuma a rubuce. Ana nuna makin hannu mai nau'in nau'i; maki, IMPs, rubber score, faɗakarwa, da'awar, soke gyare-gyare da hukunce-hukuncen daraktoci ba a aiwatar da su.","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Wannan tebur na aiki ne, ba sabis na gada kan layi ba, daraktan gasa ko ƙwararrun warwarewa. Yarjejeniyar ƙaddamar da ƙaddamarwa ƙanana ce da gangan kuma a rubuce. Ana nuna makin hannu mai nau'in nau'i; maki, IMPs, rubber score, faɗakarwa, da'awar, soke gyare-gyare da hukunce-hukuncen daraktoci ba a aiwatar da su.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Cikakken hannu na aikin kwafi ɗaya. Kullum ku zauna Kudu; Arewa – Kudu da Gabas – Yamma abokan tarayya ne.","Starter bidding agreement":"Yarjejeniyar ƙaddamar da farawa","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Yarjejeniyar farawa ta dabi'a: 1NT = daidaitattun maki 15-17 babban katin kati; bude kwat din yana farawa a maki 12. Amsa da yawan kiraye-kiraye ne masu saukin aikin heuristics, ba shawarar kwararru ko tsarin kasa ba.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Rashin lahani ga wannan hannun","Neither side vulnerable":"Babu kowane gefe mai rauni","North–South vulnerable":"Arewa–Kudu masu rauni","East–West vulnerable":"Gabas – Yamma masu rauni","Both sides vulnerable":"Duk bangarorin biyu suna da rauni","Dealer":"Dila","North":"Arewa","East":"Gabas","South · you":"Kudu · ku","West":"Yamma","North–South":"Arewa-Kudu","East–West":"Gabas – Yamma","Hand":"Hannu","Auction":"Kasuwanci","Contract":"Kwangila","To act":"Yin aiki","Your turn":"Juyin ku","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} yana tunani…","Level":"Mataki","Strain":"Matsala","Clubs":"Kungiyoyi","Diamonds":"Lu'u-lu'u","Hearts":"Zukaciya","Spades":"Spades","No trump":"Babu trump","Bid":"Bidi","Pass":"Shiga","Double":"Biyu","Redouble":"Mai sau biyu","No bid is available at that level.":"Babu wani tayi a wannan matakin.","Declarer":"Mai Sanarwa","Dummy":"Dummy","Opening leader":"Mai buɗe ido","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy an bayyana shi bayan jagorar budewa.","Your hand":"Hannun ku","Dummy hand":"Dummy Hannu","Hidden hand":"Hannun boye","Current trick":"Dabarun yanzu","Tricks won":"Dabaru sun ci nasara","Duplicate-style score":"Makin Kwafi-style","North–South total":"Arewa-Kudu jimlar","East–West total":"Gabas-Yamma duka","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Zaɓi saitin hannu kuma fara gwanjon.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Kammala gwanjo. Jagoran budewa yana fara wasa.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Wuce huɗu: an wuce allo. Yi hannu na gaba lokacin da aka shirya.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Kwangilar da aka yi: {tricks} dabaru, maki {score} don {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Yarjejeniyar ta ragu: {tricks} dabaru, {score} maki zuwa {side}.","Hand result":"Sakamakon hannu","Deal next hand":"Mayar da hannu na gaba","New hand":"Sabon hannu","Export score sheet":"Fitar da maki","Choose a legal call.":"Zaɓi kiran doka.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Bi jagorar kwat da wando lokacin da za ku iya.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Yan wasan kwamfuta suna amfani da dokokin gida na matakin farko. Babu bayanan da ya bar wannan na'urar.","Rules reference":"Maganar Dokokin","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"Ƙungiyar Gadar Duniya · Dokokin Duplicate Bridge 2017, Dokokin 73 da 89 da aka sabunta 2024"},"tl":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Contract Bridge Practice Game","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Maglaro ng Contract Bridge Online Laban sa Mga Lokal na Manlalaro ng Computer","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Magsanay ng kamay ng duplicate na contract bridge laban sa tatlong beginner-level na lokal na manlalaro ng computer. Mag-bid, sumunod sa suit, kontrolin ang dummy bilang nagdeklara at makakita ng malinaw na marka. Walang online multiplayer.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Maglaro ng isang kumpletong kamay ng contract bridge laban sa tatlong lokal na manlalaro ng computer. Ang wika ng interface ay hindi kailanman pumipili ng convention sa pag-bid o mga panuntunang partikular sa bansa.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Nananatili ang mga card, bid at score sa browser na ito. Ang laro ay hindi gumagamit ng account, upload o online na kalaban.","One hand from deal to score":"Isang kamay mula sa deal hanggang sa puntos","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Nagtatapos ang auction sa 4♠ nadoble. Ang panig na nagdedeklara ay dapat kumuha ng sampung mga trick; ang pambungad na lead ay mula sa player hanggang sa kaliwa ng declarer. Pagkatapos ng lead na iyon, ipapakita ang dummy at pipili ang declarer ng mga card mula sa magkabilang kamay.","A beginner practice version":"Isang baguhan na bersyon ng pagsasanay","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Ito ay isang single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. Naglalapat ito ng legal na order ng bid, pass, double, redoble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control ng declarer at duplicate-style na marka para sa kamay. Gumagamit ang mga built-in na manlalaro ng computer ng isang maliit na natural na kasunduan sa pagsisimula: Ang 1NT ay nagpapakita ng balanseng 15–17 high-card na puntos; ang mga pagbubukas ng suit ay nagsisimula sa 12 puntos; ang mga tugon at overcall ay sadyang basic. Ang mga kalaban na ito ay mga bot ng pagsasanay, hindi ekspertong bridge software. Ang mga desisyon sa tournament, alerto, partnership convention at matchpoint comparison ay wala sa bersyong ito.","Questions":"Mga Tanong","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Gma ba itong tulay o duplicate na tulay?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Ito ay nagbibigay ng marka sa bawat kamay nang hiwalay gamit ang duplicate-style na pagmamarka ng kontrata. Hindi ito nagdadala ng mga part-scores pasulong gaya ng ginagawa ng rubber bridge, at hindi nito ikinukumpara ang iyong resulta sa ibang mga talahanayan.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Anong sistema ng pag-bid ang ginagamit ng mga manlalaro ng computer?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"Ipinapakita sa page ang isang kasunduan sa natural na panimula ng baguhan. Ito ay pareho sa alinmang wika ng interface na iyong pipiliin; ito ay hindi isang pambansang sistema ng tulay o isang kumpletong card ng tournament convention.","Can I play online with other people?":"Maaari ba akong maglaro online sa ibang tao?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Hindi. Isang tao ang naglalaro sa Timog laban sa tatlong lokal na manlalaro ng computer. Walang matchmaking, account o server game.","How does the game score a hand?":"Paano nakakapuntos ang laro?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Ipinapakita nito ang kontrata, kahinaan, mga trick na kinakailangan at isang duplicate-style na marka batay sa antas ng kontrata, strain, double/double, overtrick o undertrick, at mga bonus sa laro o slam.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Naglalaro ba ang computer bilang isang malakas na kasosyo sa tulay?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Hindi. Sinusunod ng mga bot ang mga legal na tawag at paglalaro ngunit gumagamit ng mga simpleng heuristic ng baguhan. Ang kanilang mga desisyon ay hindi isang modelo ng ekspertong pag-bid o paglalaro ng card.","Scope and limitations":"Saklaw at limitasyon","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Ito ay isang practice table, hindi isang online bridge service, tournament director o expert solver. Ang kasunduan sa pagbi-bid ng panimulang ay sadyang maliit at dokumentado. Ang duplicate-style na marka ng kamay ay ipinapakita; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerto, claims, revoke rectifications at director rulings ay hindi ipinatupad.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Isang kumpletong duplicate-style practice hand. Palagi kang nakaupo sa Timog; Ang North–South at East–West ay magkatuwang.","Starter bidding agreement":"Pasimulang kasunduan sa pag-bid","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Natural na kasunduan sa nagsisimula: 1NT = balanseng 15–17 puntos na may mataas na card; nagsisimula ang pagbubukas ng suit sa 12 puntos. Ang mga tugon at overcall ay simpleng heuristic ng pagsasanay, hindi payo ng eksperto o isang pambansang sistema.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Vulnerability para sa kamay na ito","Neither side vulnerable":"Walang panig ang vulnerable","North–South vulnerable":"Hilaga–Timog vulnerable","East–West vulnerable":"East–West vulnerable","Both sides vulnerable":"Maaapektuhan ang magkabilang panig","Dealer":"Dealer","North":"Hilaga","East":"Silangan","South · you":"Timog · ikaw","West":"Kanluran","North–South":"Hilaga–Timog","East–West":"Silangan–Kanluran","Hand":"Kamay","Auction":"Auction","Contract":"Kontrata","To act":"Upang kumilos","Your turn":"Iyong turn","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} ay nag-iisip…","Level":"Antas","Strain":"Pinapilitang","Clubs":"Mga Club","Diamonds":"Mga Brilyante","Hearts":"Mga Puso","Spades":"Mga Spade","No trump":"Walang tramp","Bid":"Bid","Pass":"Pasa","Double":"Doble","Redouble":"Idoble","No bid is available at that level.":"Walang bid na available sa antas na iyon.","Declarer":"Declarer","Dummy":"Dummy","Opening leader":"Pambungad na pinuno","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy ay inihayag pagkatapos ng pambungad na lead.","Your hand":"Ang iyong kamay","Dummy hand":"Dummy na kamay","Hidden hand":"Nakatagong kamay","Current trick":"Kasalukuyang trick","Tricks won":"Nanalo ang mga trick","Duplicate-style score":"Duplicate-style na marka","North–South total":"North–Timog kabuuan","East–West total":"Kabuuan sa Silangan–Kanluran","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Pumili ng setting ng kamay at simulan ang auction.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Tapos na ang auction. Ang pambungad na pinuno ang unang tumugtog.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Apat na pass: ang board ay nahimatay. Harapin ang susunod na kamay kapag handa na.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Kontratang ginawa: {tricks} tricks, {score} points para sa {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Bumaba ang kontrata: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.","Hand result":"Resulta ng kamay","Deal next hand":"Susunod na deal","New hand":"Bagong kamay","Export score sheet":"I-export ang score sheet","Choose a legal call.":"Pumili ng legal na tawag.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Sundin ang led suit kung kaya mo.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Gumagamit ang mga manlalaro ng computer sa mga lokal na panuntunan sa antas ng nagsisimula. Walang data na umalis sa device na ito.","Rules reference":"Sanggunian sa mga panuntunan","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"World Bridge Federation · Mga Batas ng Duplicate na Tulay 2017, Batas 73 at 89 na-update noong 2024"},"ta":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"ஒப்பந்த பாலம் பயிற்சி விளையாட்டு","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"உள்ளூர் கம்ப்யூட்டர் பிளேயர்களுக்கு எதிராக ஒப்பந்தப் பாலத்தை ஆன்லைனில் விளையாடுங்கள்","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"மூன்று தொடக்க நிலை லோக்கல் கம்ப்யூட்டர் பிளேயர்களுக்கு எதிராக டூப்ளிகேட் கான்ட்ராக்ட் பிரிட்ஜின் கையைப் பயிற்சி செய்யுங்கள். ஏலம் எடுக்கவும், பின்பற்றவும், டம்மியை அறிவிப்பாளராகக் கட்டுப்படுத்தவும் மற்றும் தெளிவான மதிப்பெண்ணைப் பார்க்கவும். ஆன்லைன் மல்டிபிளேயர் இல்லை.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"மூன்று லோக்கல் கம்ப்யூட்டர் பிளேயர்களுக்கு எதிராக ஒப்பந்தப் பிரிட்ஜின் ஒரு முழுமையான கையை இயக்கவும். இடைமுக மொழி ஒருபோதும் ஏல மாநாடு அல்லது நாடு சார்ந்த விதிகளைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்காது.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"கார்டுகள், ஏலங்கள் மற்றும் மதிப்பெண்கள் இந்த உலாவியில் இருக்கும். கேம் கணக்கு, பதிவேற்றம் அல்லது ஆன்லைன் எதிரியைப் பயன்படுத்தாது.","One hand from deal to score":"ஒப்பந்தத்திலிருந்து ஸ்கோருக்கு ஒரு கை","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"ஏலம் 4♠ இல் முடிவடைகிறது. அறிவிக்கும் தரப்பு பத்து தந்திரங்களை எடுக்க வேண்டும்; தொடக்க முன்னணி ஆட்டக்காரரிடமிருந்து அறிவிப்பாளரின் இடதுபுறம் வருகிறது. அதன் பிறகு, டம்மி காட்டப்பட்டு, அறிவிப்பாளர் இரு கைகளிலிருந்தும் கார்டுகளைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கிறார்.","A beginner practice version":"ஒரு ஆரம்ப பயிற்சி பதிப்பு","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"இது ஒற்றை-டேபிள் டூப்ளிகேட்-பிரிட்ஜ் பயிற்சி கை. இது சட்ட ஏல ஆர்டர், பாஸ், டபுள், டபுள், ஃபாலோ-சூட் பிளே, ட்ரம்ப் ஒப்பீடு, டிக்ளரரின் போலி கட்டுப்பாடு மற்றும் கைக்கு நகல் பாணி மதிப்பெண் ஆகியவற்றைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது. உள்ளமைக்கப்பட்ட கம்ப்யூட்டர் பிளேயர்கள் ஒரு சிறிய இயற்கை ஸ்டார்டர் ஒப்பந்தத்தைப் பயன்படுத்துகின்றன: 1NT ஒரு சமநிலையான 15-17 உயர்-அட்டைப் புள்ளிகளைக் காட்டுகிறது; சூட் திறப்புகள் 12 புள்ளிகளில் தொடங்குகின்றன; பதில்கள் மற்றும் மேலதிக அழைப்புகள் வேண்டுமென்றே அடிப்படையானவை. இந்த எதிர்ப்பாளர்கள் பயிற்சி போட்கள், நிபுணர் பிரிட்ஜ் மென்பொருள் அல்ல. போட்டித் தீர்ப்புகள், விழிப்பூட்டல்கள், கூட்டாண்மை மரபுகள் மற்றும் மேட்ச் பாயிண்ட் ஒப்பீடுகள் இந்தப் பதிப்பிற்கு வெளியே உள்ளன.","Questions":"கேள்விகள்","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"இது ரப்பர் பாலமா அல்லது டூப்ளிகேட் பாலமா?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"இது நகல்-பாணி ஒப்பந்த மதிப்பெண்ணைப் பயன்படுத்தி ஒவ்வொரு கையையும் தனித்தனியாக ஸ்கோர் செய்கிறது. ரப்பர் பிரிட்ஜ் செய்வது போல இது பகுதி மதிப்பெண்களை முன்னோக்கி கொண்டு செல்லாது, மேலும் இது உங்கள் முடிவை மற்ற அட்டவணைகளுடன் ஒப்பிடாது.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"கணினி பிளேயர்கள் பயன்படுத்தும் ஏல முறை என்ன?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"ஒரு தொடக்க இயற்கை ஸ்டார்டர் ஒப்பந்தம் பக்கத்தில் காட்டப்பட்டுள்ளது. நீங்கள் தேர்வு செய்யும் எந்த இடைமுக மொழியும் ஒன்றுதான்; இது ஒரு தேசிய பாலம் அமைப்பு அல்லது ஒரு முழுமையான போட்டி மாநாட்டு அட்டை அல்ல.","Can I play online with other people?":"மற்றவர்களுடன் ஆன்லைனில் விளையாடலாமா?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"எண். ஒரு நபர் மூன்று உள்ளூர் கணினி பிளேயர்களுக்கு எதிராக சவுத் விளையாடுகிறார். மேட்ச்மேக்கிங், கணக்கு அல்லது சர்வர் கேம் எதுவும் இல்லை.","How does the game score a hand?":"விளையாட்டு எவ்வாறு கைகொடுக்கிறது?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"இது ஒப்பந்தம், பாதிப்பு, தேவையான தந்திரங்கள் மற்றும் ஒப்பந்த நிலை, ஸ்ட்ரெய்ன், டபுள்/இரட்டிப்பு, ஓவர்ட்ரிக் அல்லது அண்டர்ட்ரிக்குகள் மற்றும் கேம் அல்லது ஸ்லாம் போனஸ் ஆகியவற்றின் அடிப்படையில் நகல் பாணி மதிப்பெண்ணைக் காட்டுகிறது.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"கணினி வலுவான பிரிட்ஜ் பார்ட்னராக இயங்குகிறதா?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"எண். போட்கள் சட்டப்பூர்வ அழைப்புகள் மற்றும் நாடகங்களைப் பின்பற்றுகின்றன, ஆனால் எளிய தொடக்கநிலை ஹியூரிஸ்டிக்ஸைப் பயன்படுத்துகின்றன. அவர்களின் முடிவுகள் நிபுணர் ஏலம் அல்லது அட்டை விளையாட்டின் மாதிரி அல்ல.","Scope and limitations":"நோக்கம் மற்றும் வரம்புகள்","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"இது ஒரு பயிற்சி அட்டவணை, ஆன்லைன் ப்ரிட்ஜ் சேவை, போட்டி இயக்குனர் அல்லது நிபுணர் தீர்வு அல்ல. ஸ்டார்டர் ஏல ஒப்பந்தம் வேண்டுமென்றே சிறியது மற்றும் ஆவணப்படுத்தப்பட்டுள்ளது. டூப்ளிகேட்-ஸ்டைல் ஹேண்ட் ஸ்கோர் காட்டப்பட்டுள்ளது; தீப்பெட்டிகள், IMPகள், ரப்பர் ஸ்கோரிங், விழிப்பூட்டல்கள், உரிமைகோரல்கள், திரும்பப்பெறுதல் திருத்தங்கள் மற்றும் இயக்குநர் தீர்ப்புகள் செயல்படுத்தப்படவில்லை.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"ஒரு முழுமையான நகல் பாணி பயிற்சி கை. நீங்கள் எப்போதும் தெற்கே அமர்ந்திருக்கிறீர்கள்; வடக்கு-தெற்கு மற்றும் கிழக்கு-மேற்கு பங்குதாரர்கள்.","Starter bidding agreement":"ஸ்டார்ட்டர் ஏல ஒப்பந்தம்","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"இயற்கை தொடக்க ஒப்பந்தம்: 1NT = சமநிலை 15–17 உயர் அட்டை புள்ளிகள்; ஒரு சூட் திறப்பு 12 புள்ளிகளில் தொடங்குகிறது. பதில்கள் மற்றும் ஓவர்கால்கள் எளிமையான நடைமுறை ஹூரிஸ்டிக்ஸ் ஆகும், நிபுணர் ஆலோசனை அல்லது தேசிய அமைப்பு அல்ல.","Vulnerability for this hand":"இந்தக் கைக்கான பாதிப்பு","Neither side vulnerable":"எந்த பக்கமும் பாதிக்கப்படாது","North–South vulnerable":"வடக்கு-தெற்கு பாதிக்கப்படக்கூடியது","East–West vulnerable":"கிழக்கு-மேற்கு பாதிக்கப்படக்கூடியது","Both sides vulnerable":"இரு பக்கமும் பாதிக்கப்படக்கூடியது","Dealer":"டீலர்","North":"வடக்கு","East":"கிழக்கு","South · you":"தெற்கு · நீங்கள்","West":"மேற்கு","North–South":"வடக்கு-தெற்கு","East–West":"கிழக்கு-மேற்கு","Hand":"கை","Auction":"ஏலம்","Contract":"ஒப்பந்தம்","To act":"செயல்பட","Your turn":"உங்கள் முறை","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} சிந்திக்கிறது…","Level":"நிலை","Strain":"திரிபு","Clubs":"கிளப்புகள்","Diamonds":"வைரங்கள்","Hearts":"இதயங்கள்","Spades":"ஸ்பேட்ஸ்","No trump":"டிரம்ப் இல்லை","Bid":"ஏலம்","Pass":"பாஸ்","Double":"இரட்டை","Redouble":"இரட்டிப்பு","No bid is available at that level.":"அந்த அளவில் ஏலம் எதுவும் கிடைக்கவில்லை.","Declarer":"அறிவிப்பாளர்","Dummy":"டம்மி","Opening leader":"தொடக்கத் தலைவர்","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"டம்மி தொடக்க முன்னிலைக்குப் பிறகு வெளிப்படுத்தப்பட்டது.","Your hand":"உங்கள் கை","Dummy hand":"டம்மி கை","Hidden hand":"மறைக்கப்பட்ட கை","Current trick":"தற்போதைய தந்திரம்","Tricks won":"தந்திரங்கள் வென்றன","Duplicate-style score":"டூப்ளிகேட்-ஸ்டைல் ஸ்கோர்","North–South total":"வடக்கு-தெற்கு மொத்தம்","East–West total":"கிழக்கு-மேற்கு மொத்தம்","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"ஒரு கை அமைப்பைத் தேர்ந்தெடுத்து ஏலத்தைத் தொடங்கவும்.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"ஏலம் முடிந்தது. தொடக்கத் தலைவர் முதலில் விளையாடுகிறார்.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"நான்கு பாஸ்கள்: பலகை அனுப்பப்பட்டது. தயாராக இருக்கும் போது அடுத்த கையை சமாளிக்கவும்.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"ஒப்பந்தம் செய்யப்பட்டது: {tricks} தந்திரங்கள், {side}க்கான {score} புள்ளிகள்.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"ஒப்பந்தம் குறைந்துவிட்டது: {tricks} தந்திரங்கள், {score} புள்ளிகள் {side}.","Hand result":"கை முடிவு","Deal next hand":"அடுத்த கையோடு டீல் செய்யவும்","New hand":"புதிய கை","Export score sheet":"ஸ்கோர் ஷீட்டை ஏற்றுமதி செய்யவும்","Choose a legal call.":"சட்டப்பூர்வ அழைப்பைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"உங்களால் முடிந்தவரை லெட் சூட்டைப் பின்பற்றவும்.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"கணினி பிளேயர்கள் தொடக்க நிலை உள்ளூர் விதிகளைப் பயன்படுத்துகின்றனர். இந்தச் சாதனத்திலிருந்து எந்தத் தகவலும் இல்லை.","Rules reference":"விதிகளின் குறிப்பு","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"உலக பாலம் கூட்டமைப்பு · டூப்ளிகேட் பாலம் 2017 சட்டங்கள், சட்டங்கள் 73 மற்றும் 89 புதுப்பிக்கப்பட்டது 2024"},"fa":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"بازی تمرین پل قراردادی","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"یک پل قرارداد تکراری را در برابر سه بازیکن رایانه محلی سطح مبتدی تمرین کنید. پیشنهاد دهید، دنباله رو کنید، ساختگی را به عنوان اعلان کننده کنترل کنید و یک امتیاز واضح ببینید. بدون بازی چند نفره آنلاین","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"یک دست کامل پل قرارداد را در برابر سه بازیکن کامپیوتر محلی بازی کنید. زبان رابط هرگز یک قرارداد مناقصه یا قوانین خاص کشور را انتخاب نمی کند.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"کارت ها، پیشنهادات و امتیازات در این مرورگر باقی می مانند. بازی از حساب کاربری، آپلود یا حریف آنلاین استفاده نمی کند.","One hand from deal to score":"یک دست از معامله به امتیاز","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"حراج در 4♠ دو برابر به پایان می رسد. طرف اعلام کننده باید ده ترفند بکند. لید افتتاحیه از بازیکن به سمت چپ اعلام کننده می آید. پس از آن لید، ساختگی نشان داده می شود و اعلام کننده کارت ها را از هر دو دست انتخاب می کند.","A beginner practice version":"نسخه تمرینی مبتدی","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"این یک دست تمرین پل تکراری تک جدولی است. ترتیب پیشنهاد قانونی، پاس، دوبل، دوبل، بازی دنباله دار، مقایسه ترامپ، کنترل ساختگی توسط اعلان کننده و امتیازی به سبک تکراری برای دست اعمال می شود. پخشکنندههای رایانه داخلی از یک قرارداد شروع طبیعی کوچک استفاده میکنند: 1NT 15-17 امتیاز کارت بالا را نشان میدهد. دهانه کت و شلوار از 12 نقطه شروع می شود. پاسخ ها و فراخوان ها عمدا اساسی هستند. این مخالفان رباتهای تمرین هستند، نه نرمافزار بریج خبره. قوانین مسابقات، هشدارها، کنوانسیون های مشارکت و مقایسه نقاط مسابقه خارج از این نسخه هستند.","Questions":"سوالات","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"این پل لاستیکی است یا پل تکراری؟","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"با استفاده از امتیازدهی قراردادی به سبک تکراری، هر دست را جداگانه امتیاز میدهد. مانند پل لاستیکی امتیازهای قسمت را به جلو نمی برد و نتیجه شما را با جداول دیگر مقایسه نمی کند.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"بازی کننده های رایانه از چه سیستم پیشنهادی استفاده می کنند؟","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"یک توافقنامه شروع طبیعی مبتدی در صفحه نشان داده شده است. این همان زبان رابطی است که انتخاب کنید. این یک سیستم پل ملی یا یک کارت کنوانسیون مسابقات کامل نیست.","Can I play online with other people?":"آیا می توانم با افراد دیگر آنلاین بازی کنم؟","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"شماره یک نفر جنوب را در برابر سه بازیکن کامپیوتر محلی بازی می کند. هیچ بازی خواستگاری، حساب کاربری یا سرور وجود ندارد.","How does the game score a hand?":"بازی چگونه یک دست را به دست می آورد؟","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"این قرارداد، آسیبپذیری، ترفندهای مورد نیاز و یک امتیاز به سبک تکراری را بر اساس سطح قرارداد، فشار، دوبل/دبل، اورتریک یا آندرتریک، و پاداشهای بازی یا اسلم نشان میدهد.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"آیا رایانه مانند یک شریک پل قوی بازی می کند؟","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"شماره رباتها از فراخوانها و بازیهای قانونی پیروی میکنند اما از اکتشافات مبتدی ساده استفاده میکنند. تصمیمات آنها مدلی از مناقصه کارشناسی یا کارت بازی نیست.","Scope and limitations":"دامنه و محدودیت ها","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"این یک میز تمرین است، نه یک سرویس پل آنلاین، مدیر مسابقات یا حل کننده متخصص. قرارداد مناقصه آغازین عمدا کوچک و مستند است. امتیاز دست به سبک تکراری نشان داده شده است. امتیازات مسابقه، IMP، امتیازدهی لاستیکی، هشدارها، ادعاها، لغو اصلاحات و احکام مدیر اجرا نمی شوند.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"یک دست تمرین کامل به سبک تکراری. شما همیشه در جنوب می نشینید. شمال – جنوب و شرق – غرب شریک هستند.","Starter bidding agreement":"توافقنامه مناقصه آغازین","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"قرارداد مبتدی طبیعی: 1NT = متعادل 15-17 امتیاز کارت بالا. باز شدن یک کت و شلوار از 12 نقطه شروع می شود. پاسخها و فراخوانها یک روش اکتشافی ساده هستند، نه توصیههای تخصصی یا یک سیستم ملی.","Vulnerability for this hand":"آسیب پذیری برای این دست","Neither side vulnerable":"هیچ یک از طرفین آسیب پذیر نیستند","North–South vulnerable":"شمال-جنوب آسیب پذیر","East–West vulnerable":"شرق-غرب آسیب پذیر است","Both sides vulnerable":"هر دو طرف آسیب پذیر هستند","Dealer":"نمایندگی","North":"شمال","East":"شرق","South · you":"جنوب · شما","West":"غرب","North–South":"شمال-جنوب","East–West":"شرق-غرب","Hand":"دست","Auction":"حراج","Contract":"قرارداد","To act":"عمل کردن","Your turn":"نوبت شماست","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} در حال فکر کردن است…","Level":"سطح","Strain":"کرنش","Clubs":"باشگاه ها","Diamonds":"الماس","Hearts":"قلب","Spades":"بیل","No trump":"بدون ترامپ","Bid":"مناقصه","Pass":"گذر","Double":"دوبل","Redouble":"دوبرابر","No bid is available at that level.":"هیچ پیشنهادی در آن سطح موجود نیست.","Declarer":"اعلام کننده","Dummy":"ساختگی","Opening leader":"رهبر افتتاحیه","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy پس از لید افتتاحیه آشکار می شود.","Your hand":"دست تو","Dummy hand":"دست ساختگی","Hidden hand":"دست پنهان","Current trick":"ترفند فعلی","Tricks won":"ترفندهای برنده شد","Duplicate-style score":"امتیاز به سبک تکراری","North–South total":"کل شمالی–جنوبی","East–West total":"مجموع شرق-غرب","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"یک تنظیم دستی را انتخاب کنید و حراج را شروع کنید.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"حراج به پایان رسید. رهبر افتتاحیه ابتدا بازی می کند.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"چهار پاس: برد از بین می رود. بعد از آماده شدن دست بعدی را بزنید.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"قرارداد منعقد شده: ترفندهای {tricks}، امتیاز {score} برای {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"قرارداد از بین رفت: ترفندهای {tricks}، {score} به {side} اشاره می کند.","Hand result":"نتیجه دست","Deal next hand":"معامله دست بعدی","New hand":"دست جدید","Export score sheet":"برگه امتیاز صادرات","Choose a legal call.":"یک تماس قانونی را انتخاب کنید.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"تا زمانی که می توانید از لباس LED پیروی کنید.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"بازیکنهای رایانه از قوانین محلی سطح مبتدی استفاده میکنند. هیچ داده ای از این دستگاه خارج نمی شود.","Rules reference":"مرجع قوانین","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"فدراسیون جهانی پل · قوانین پل تکراری 2017، قوانین 73 و 89 به روز شده در سال 2024"},"am":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"የኮንትራት ድልድይ ልምምድ ጨዋታ","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"የኮንትራት ድልድይ በመስመር ላይ ከአገር ውስጥ ኮምፒውተር ተጫዋቾች ጋር ይጫወቱ","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"የተባዛ የኮንትራት ድልድይ ከሶስት ጀማሪ ደረጃ የሀገር ውስጥ ኮምፒውተር ተጫዋቾች ጋር ተለማመድ። ተጫራች፣ ተከተሉት፣ ዲሚ እንደ አውዋዥ ይቆጣጠሩ እና ግልጽ ነጥብ ይመልከቱ። የመስመር ላይ ብዙ ተጫዋች የለም።","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"አንድ ሙሉ እጅ የኮንትራት ድልድይ ከሶስት የሀገር ውስጥ የኮምፒውተር ተጫዋቾች ጋር ይጫወቱ። የበይነገጽ ቋንቋ የጨረታ ስምምነትን ወይም አገር-ተኮር ሕጎችን በፍጹም አይመርጥም።","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"ካርዶች፣ጨረታዎች እና ውጤቶች በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይቆያሉ። ጨዋታው መለያ፣ ሰቀላ ወይም የመስመር ላይ ተቃዋሚ አይጠቀምም።","One hand from deal to score":"አንድ እጅ ከድርድር ወደ ነጥብ","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"ጨረታው የሚጠናቀቀው በ4♠ በእጥፍ አድጓል። ገላጭ ወገን አሥር ዘዴዎችን መውሰድ አለበት; የመክፈቻው መሪ ከተጫዋቹ ወደ ግራ በኩል ይወጣል. ከዚያ መሪ በኋላ ዱሚ ታይቷል እና የሁለቱም እጆች ካርዶችን ይመርጣል።","A beginner practice version":"የጀማሪ ልምምድ ስሪት","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"ይህ ባለ አንድ ጠረጴዛ የተባዛ-ድልድይ ልምምድ እጅ ነው። ህጋዊ የጨረታ ማዘዣ፣ ማለፊያ፣ ድርብ፣ ድርብ፣ ተከታይ ሱት ጨዋታ፣ ትራምፕ ንፅፅር፣ ዲሚ ቁጥጥር በአዋጅ እና ለእጅ የተባዛ አይነት ውጤትን ይተገበራል። አብሮገነብ የኮምፒዩተር ማጫወቻዎች ትንሽ የተፈጥሮ ማስጀመሪያ ስምምነትን ይጠቀማሉ: 1NT ሚዛናዊ 15-17 ከፍተኛ-ካርድ ነጥቦችን ያሳያል; የሱቱ ክፍት ቦታዎች በ 12 ነጥብ ይጀምራሉ; ምላሾች እና ጥሪዎች ሆን ተብሎ መሰረታዊ ናቸው። እነዚህ ተቃዋሚዎች የተለማመዱ ቦቶች እንጂ የኤክስፐርት ድልድይ ሶፍትዌር አይደሉም። የውድድር ውሳኔዎች፣ ማንቂያዎች፣ የአጋርነት ስምምነቶች እና የግጥሚያ ነጥብ ንጽጽሮች ከዚህ ስሪት ውጪ ናቸው።","Questions":"ጥያቄዎች","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"ይህ የጎማ ድልድይ ነው ወይስ የተባዛ ድልድይ?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"የተባዛ የኮንትራት ነጥብ በመጠቀም እያንዳንዱን እጅ ለየብቻ ይመታል። የጎማ ድልድይ እንደሚያደርገው ከፊል ነጥብ ወደ ፊት አያስኬድም፣ እና የእርስዎን ውጤት ከሌሎች ጠረጴዛዎች ጋር አያወዳድርም።","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"የኮምፒዩተር ተጫዋቾቹ የሚጠቀሙት የመጫረቻ ስርዓት ምንድነው?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"ጀማሪ የተፈጥሮ ማስጀመሪያ ስምምነት በገጹ ላይ ይታያል። የመረጡት የትኛውንም የበይነገጽ ቋንቋ ተመሳሳይ ነው; የብሔራዊ ድልድይ ሥርዓት ወይም የተሟላ የውድድር ስምምነት ካርድ አይደለም።","Can I play online with other people?":"በመስመር ላይ ከሌሎች ሰዎች ጋር መጫወት እችላለሁ?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"ቁ. አንድ ሰው ደቡብን ከሶስት የሀገር ውስጥ የኮምፒውተር ተጫዋቾች ጋር ይጫወታል። ምንም ግጥሚያ፣ መለያ ወይም የአገልጋይ ጨዋታ የለም።","How does the game score a hand?":"ጨዋታው እንዴት አንድ እጅ ያስቆጥራል?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"ውሌውን፣ ተጋላጭነቱን፣ የሚፈለጉትን ዘዴዎች እና በኮንትራት ደረጃ ላይ የተመሰረተ የተባዛ አይነት ውጤት፣ ውጥረት፣ ድርብ/እጥፍ፣ ከመጠን በላይ መጨናነቅ ወይም ማጭበርበር፣ እና የጨዋታ ወይም የስም ቦነስን ያሳያል።","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"ኮምፒዩተሩ እንደ ጠንካራ ድልድይ አጋር ነው የሚጫወተው?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"ቁ. ቦቶች ህጋዊ ጥሪዎችን እና ጨዋታዎችን ይከተላሉ ነገር ግን ቀላል ጀማሪ ሂዩሪስቲክስን ይጠቀማሉ። ውሳኔዎቻቸው የባለሙያ ጨረታ ወይም የካርድ ጨዋታ ሞዴል አይደሉም።","Scope and limitations":"ወሰን እና ገደቦች","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"ይህ የመለማመጃ ጠረጴዛ ነው እንጂ የመስመር ላይ ድልድይ አገልግሎት፣ የውድድር ዳይሬክተር ወይም ኤክስፐርት ፈቺ አይደለም። የጀማሪው የጨረታ ውል ሆን ተብሎ ትንሽ እና በሰነድ የተረጋገጠ ነው። የተባዛ-ቅጥ የእጅ ውጤት ይታያል; የግጥሚያ ነጥቦች፣ አይኤምፒዎች፣ የጎማ ውጤቶች፣ ማንቂያዎች፣ የይገባኛል ጥያቄዎች፣ ማሻሻያዎች እና የዳይሬክተሮች ውሳኔዎች አልተተገበሩም።","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"አንድ ሙሉ የተባዛ አይነት ልምምድ እጅ። ሁልጊዜ በደቡብ ተቀምጠዋል; ሰሜን-ደቡብ እና ምስራቅ-ምዕራብ አጋሮች ናቸው።","Starter bidding agreement":"ጀማሪ የጨረታ ስምምነት","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"የተፈጥሮ ጀማሪ ስምምነት፡ 1NT = ሚዛናዊ 15-17 ባለከፍተኛ ካርድ ነጥቦች; የሱፍ መክፈቻ በ 12 ነጥብ ይጀምራል. ምላሾች እና ጥሪዎች ቀላል የልምምድ ሂዩሪስቲክስ እንጂ የባለሙያ ምክር ወይም የሀገር ውስጥ ስርዓት አይደሉም።","Vulnerability for this hand":"ለዚህ እጅ ተጋላጭነት","Neither side vulnerable":"ሁለቱም ወገን ተጋላጭ አይደሉም","North–South vulnerable":"ሰሜን-ደቡብ ተጋላጭ","East–West vulnerable":"ምስራቅ-ምዕራብ ተጋላጭ","Both sides vulnerable":"ሁለቱም ወገኖች ተጋላጭ ናቸው።","Dealer":"አከፋፋይ","North":"ሰሜን","East":"ምስራቅ","South · you":"ደቡብ · እርስዎ","West":"ምዕራብ","North–South":"ሰሜን-ደቡብ","East–West":"ምስራቅ-ምዕራብ","Hand":"እጅ","Auction":"ጨረታ","Contract":"ኮንትራት","To act":"ለመተግበር","Your turn":"የእርስዎ ተራ","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} እያሰበ ነው…","Level":"ደረጃ","Strain":"ውጥረት","Clubs":"ክለቦች","Diamonds":"አልማዞች","Hearts":"ልቦች","Spades":"ስፋቶች","No trump":"ትራምፕ የለም።","Bid":"ጨረታ","Pass":"ማለፊያ","Double":"ድርብ","Redouble":"ድርብ","No bid is available at that level.":"በዚያ ደረጃ ጨረታ የለም።","Declarer":"አዋጅ","Dummy":"ዱሚ","Opening leader":"የመክፈቻ መሪ","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"ዱሚ ከመክፈቻው መሪ በኋላ ይገለጣል።","Your hand":"የእርስዎ እጅ","Dummy hand":"ዱሚ እጅ","Hidden hand":"የተደበቀ እጅ","Current trick":"የአሁኑ ብልሃት።","Tricks won":"ዘዴዎች አሸንፈዋል","Duplicate-style score":"የተባዛ አይነት ነጥብ","North–South total":"ሰሜን-ደቡብ ጠቅላላ","East–West total":"ምስራቅ-ምዕራብ ጠቅላላ","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"የእጅ መቼት ይምረጡ እና ጨረታውን ይጀምሩ።","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"ጨረታ ተጠናቋል። የመክፈቻው መሪ በመጀመሪያ ይጫወታል.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"አራት ማለፊያዎች፡ ቦርዱ ተላልፏል። ዝግጁ ሲሆኑ የሚቀጥለውን እጅ ይያዙ።","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"ውል ተፈጸመ፡ {tricks} ብልሃቶች፣ {score} ነጥቦች ለ {side}።","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"ኮንትራቱ ወድቋል፡ {tricks} ብልሃቶች፣ {score} ነጥብ ወደ {side}።","Hand result":"የእጅ ውጤት","Deal next hand":"የሚቀጥለውን እጅ ያዙ","New hand":"አዲስ እጅ","Export score sheet":"የውጤት ሉህ ወደ ውጭ ላክ","Choose a legal call.":"ህጋዊ ጥሪን ይምረጡ።","Follow the led suit when you can.":"በሚችሉበት ጊዜ የሚመራውን ልብስ ይከተሉ።","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"የኮምፒውተር ተጫዋቾች በጀማሪ ደረጃ የአካባቢ ህጎችን ይጠቀማሉ። ምንም ውሂብ ከዚህ መሳሪያ አይወጣም።","Rules reference":"የህግ ማጣቀሻ","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"የዓለም ድልድይ ፌዴሬሽን · የተባዛ ድልድይ ሕጎች 2017፣ ሕጎች 73 እና 89 የዘመኑ 2024"},"gu":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"કોન્ટ્રેક્ટ બ્રિજ પ્રેક્ટિસ ગેમ","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"સ્થાનિક કમ્પ્યુટર પ્લેયર્સ સામે કોન્ટ્રાક્ટ બ્રિજ ઑનલાઇન રમો","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"ત્રણ શિખાઉ-સ્તરના સ્થાનિક કમ્પ્યુટર ખેલાડીઓ સામે ડુપ્લિકેટ કોન્ટ્રાક્ટ બ્રિજની પ્રેક્ટિસ કરો બિડ કરો, દાવો અનુસરો, ઘોષણાકર્તા તરીકે ડમીને નિયંત્રિત કરો અને સ્પષ્ટ સ્કોર જુઓ. કોઈ ઑનલાઇન મલ્ટિપ્લેયર નથી.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"ત્રણ સ્થાનિક કમ્પ્યુટર પ્લેયર્સ સામે કોન્ટ્રાક્ટ બ્રિજનો એક સંપૂર્ણ હાથ રમો. ઇન્ટરફેસ ભાષા ક્યારેય બિડિંગ સંમેલન અથવા દેશ-વિશિષ્ટ નિયમો પસંદ કરતી નથી.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"કાર્ડ, બિડ અને સ્કોર્સ આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં રહે છે. આ રમત એકાઉન્ટ, અપલોડ અથવા ઑનલાઇન વિરોધીનો ઉપયોગ કરતી નથી.","One hand from deal to score":"ડીલથી સ્કોર સુધી એક હાથ","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"હરાજી 4♠ બમણીમાં સમાપ્ત થાય છે. ઘોષણા કરનાર પક્ષે દસ યુક્તિઓ લેવી જોઈએ; ઓપનિંગ લીડ ખેલાડી તરફથી ઘોષણા કરનારની ડાબી તરફ આવે છે. તે લીડ પછી, ડમી બતાવવામાં આવે છે અને ઘોષણાકર્તા બંને હાથમાંથી કાર્ડ પસંદ કરે છે.","A beginner practice version":"એક પ્રારંભિક પ્રેક્ટિસ સંસ્કરણ","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"આ સિંગલ-ટેબલ ડુપ્લિકેટ-બ્રિજ પ્રેક્ટિસ હેન્ડ છે. તે કાનૂની બિડ ઓર્ડર, પાસ, ડબલ, રીડબલ, ફોલો-સ્યુટ પ્લે, ટ્રમ્પ સરખામણી, ઘોષણાકર્તા દ્વારા ડમી નિયંત્રણ અને હાથ માટે ડુપ્લિકેટ-શૈલીનો સ્કોર લાગુ કરે છે. બિલ્ટ-ઇન કોમ્પ્યુટર પ્લેયર્સ નાના કુદરતી સ્ટાર્ટર કરારનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે: 1NT સંતુલિત 15-17 ઉચ્ચ-કાર્ડ પોઈન્ટ દર્શાવે છે; સૂટ ઓપનિંગ 12 પોઇન્ટથી શરૂ થાય છે; પ્રતિભાવો અને ઓવરકોલ ઇરાદાપૂર્વક મૂળભૂત છે. આ વિરોધીઓ પ્રેક્ટિસ બૉટો છે, નિષ્ણાત બ્રિજ સૉફ્ટવેર નથી. ટુર્નામેન્ટના નિયમો, ચેતવણીઓ, ભાગીદારી સંમેલનો અને મેચપોઇન્ટ સરખામણીઓ આ સંસ્કરણની બહાર છે.","Questions":"પ્રશ્નો","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"શું આ રબર બ્રિજ છે કે ડુપ્લિકેટ બ્રિજ?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"તે ડુપ્લિકેટ-શૈલી કોન્ટ્રાક્ટ સ્કોરિંગનો ઉપયોગ કરીને દરેક હાથને અલગથી સ્કોર કરે છે. તે રબર બ્રિજની જેમ ભાગ-સ્કોરને આગળ વહન કરતું નથી, અને તે તમારા પરિણામની અન્ય કોષ્ટકો સાથે તુલના કરતું નથી.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"કોમ્પ્યુટર પ્લેયર્સ કઈ બિડિંગ સિસ્ટમનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"એક પ્રારંભિક કુદરતી સ્ટાર્ટર કરાર પૃષ્ઠ પર બતાવવામાં આવ્યો છે. તમે જે પણ ઇન્ટરફેસ ભાષા પસંદ કરો છો તે તે જ છે; તે રાષ્ટ્રીય પુલ સિસ્ટમ અથવા સંપૂર્ણ ટુર્નામેન્ટ કન્વેન્શન કાર્ડ નથી.","Can I play online with other people?":"શું હું અન્ય લોકો સાથે ઑનલાઇન રમી શકું?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"નં. એક વ્યક્તિ ત્રણ સ્થાનિક કમ્પ્યુટર ખેલાડીઓ સામે દક્ષિણ રમે છે. ત્યાં કોઈ મેચમેકિંગ, એકાઉન્ટ અથવા સર્વર ગેમ નથી.","How does the game score a hand?":"ગેમ હેન્ડ સ્કોર કેવી રીતે કરે છે?\nયુબીજી017એક્સ","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"તે કરાર, નબળાઈ, જરૂરી યુક્તિઓ અને કરાર સ્તર, તાણ, ડબલ/રીડબલ, ઓવરટ્રિક્સ અથવા અંડરટ્રિક્સ અને રમત અથવા સ્લેમ બોનસ પર આધારિત ડુપ્લિકેટ-શૈલીનો સ્કોર દર્શાવે છે.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"શું કમ્પ્યુટર મજબૂત બ્રિજ પાર્ટનરની જેમ ચાલે છે?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"નં. બૉટો કાનૂની કૉલ્સ અને નાટકોને અનુસરે છે પરંતુ સરળ શિખાઉ માણસ હ્યુરિસ્ટિક્સનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે. તેમના નિર્ણયો નિષ્ણાત બિડિંગ અથવા કાર્ડ પ્લેનું મોડેલ નથી.","Scope and limitations":"સ્કોપ અને મર્યાદાઓ","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"આ એક પ્રેક્ટિસ ટેબલ છે, ઓનલાઈન બ્રિજ સર્વિસ, ટુર્નામેન્ટ ડાયરેક્ટર અથવા નિષ્ણાત સોલ્વર નથી. સ્ટાર્ટર બિડિંગ એગ્રીમેન્ટ ઈરાદાપૂર્વક નાનો અને દસ્તાવેજીકૃત છે. ડુપ્લિકેટ-શૈલી હેન્ડ સ્કોર બતાવવામાં આવે છે; મેચપોઇન્ટ્સ, આઇએમપી, રબર સ્કોરિંગ, ચેતવણીઓ, દાવાઓ, સુધારણા રદબાતલ અને ડિરેક્ટર ચુકાદાઓ અમલમાં નથી.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"એક સંપૂર્ણ ડુપ્લિકેટ-શૈલી પ્રેક્ટિસ હાથ. તમે હંમેશા દક્ષિણમાં બેસો; ઉત્તર-દક્ષિણ અને પૂર્વ-પશ્ચિમ ભાગીદારો છે.","Starter bidding agreement":"સ્ટાર્ટર બિડિંગ એગ્રીમેન્ટ","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"કુદરતી પ્રારંભિક કરાર: 1NT = સંતુલિત 15–17 ઉચ્ચ-કાર્ડ પોઈન્ટ્સ; સૂટ ઓપનિંગ 12 પોઈન્ટથી શરૂ થાય છે. પ્રતિભાવો અને ઓવરકૉલ્સ એ સરળ પ્રેક્ટિસ હ્યુરિસ્ટિક્સ છે, નિષ્ણાતની સલાહ અથવા રાષ્ટ્રીય સિસ્ટમ નથી.","Vulnerability for this hand":"આ હાથ માટે નબળાઈ","Neither side vulnerable":"કોઈ બાજુ સંવેદનશીલ નથી","North–South vulnerable":"ઉત્તર-દક્ષિણ સંવેદનશીલ","East–West vulnerable":"પૂર્વ-પશ્ચિમ સંવેદનશીલ","Both sides vulnerable":"બંને બાજુઓ સંવેદનશીલ","Dealer":"ડીલર","North":"ઉત્તર","East":"પૂર્વ","South · you":"દક્ષિણ · તમે","West":"વેસ્ટ","North–South":"ઉત્તર-દક્ષિણ","East–West":"પૂર્વ-પશ્ચિમ","Hand":"હાથ","Auction":"ઓક્શન","Contract":"કરાર","To act":"કાર્ય કરવા માટે","Your turn":"તમારો વારો","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} વિચારી રહ્યું છે…","Level":"સ્તર","Strain":"તાણ","Clubs":"ક્લબ્સ","Diamonds":"હીરા","Hearts":"હાર્ટ્સ","Spades":"Spades","No trump":"કોઈ ટ્રમ્પ નહીં","Bid":"બિડ","Pass":"પાસ","Double":"ડબલ","Redouble":"ડબલ","No bid is available at that level.":"તે સ્તર પર કોઈ બિડ ઉપલબ્ધ નથી.","Declarer":"ઘોષક","Dummy":"ડમી","Opening leader":"ઓપનિંગ લીડર","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"ડમી ઓપનિંગ લીડ પછી જાહેર થાય છે.","Your hand":"તમારો હાથ","Dummy hand":"ડમી હાથ","Hidden hand":"છુપાયેલ હાથ","Current trick":"વર્તમાન યુક્તિ","Tricks won":"યુક્તિઓ જીતી","Duplicate-style score":"ડુપ્લિકેટ-શૈલીનો સ્કોર","North–South total":"ઉત્તર-દક્ષિણ કુલ","East–West total":"પૂર્વ-પશ્ચિમ કુલ","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"હેન્ડ સેટિંગ પસંદ કરો અને હરાજી શરૂ કરો.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"હરાજી પૂર્ણ. ઓપનિંગ લીડર પહેલા રમે છે.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"ચાર પાસ: બોર્ડ પાસ થઈ ગયું છે. તૈયાર હોય ત્યારે આગળનો હાથ ડીલ કરો.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"કરાર કરેલ: {tricks} યુક્તિઓ, {side} માટે {score} પોઈન્ટ.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"કોન્ટ્રાક્ટ નીચે ગયો: {tricks} યુક્તિઓ, {score} {side} પર પૉઇન્ટ કરે છે.","Hand result":"હાથનું પરિણામ","Deal next hand":"આગળની ડીલ કરો","New hand":"નવો હાથ","Export score sheet":"સ્કોર શીટ નિકાસ કરો","Choose a legal call.":"કાનૂની કૉલ પસંદ કરો.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"જ્યારે તમે કરી શકો ત્યારે લીડ સૂટને અનુસરો.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"કોમ્પ્યુટર પ્લેયર્સ શિખાઉ માણસ-સ્તરના સ્થાનિક નિયમોનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે. આ ઉપકરણમાંથી કોઈ ડેટા છોડતો નથી.","Rules reference":"નિયમો સંદર્ભ","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"વર્લ્ડ બ્રિજ ફેડરેશન · ડુપ્લિકેટ બ્રિજ 2017ના કાયદા, કાયદા 73 અને 89 અપડેટ 2024"},"nb":{"Contract Bridge Practice Game":"Treningsspill for kontraktsbro","Play Contract Bridge Online Against Local Computer Players":"Spill Contract Bridge online mot lokale datamaskinspillere","Practice a hand of duplicate contract bridge against three beginner-level local computer players. Bid, follow suit, control dummy as declarer and see a clear score. No online multiplayer.":"Øv en hånd med duplikatkontraktsbridge mot tre lokale datamaskinspillere på nybegynnernivå. By, følg etter, kontroller dummy som erklærer og se en klar poengsum. Ingen online flerspiller.","Play one complete hand of contract bridge against three local computer players. The interface language never selects a bidding convention or country-specific rules.":"Spill en komplett hånd med kontraktsbridge mot tre lokale dataspillere. Grensesnittspråket velger aldri en budkonvensjon eller landsspesifikke regler.","Cards, bids and scores stay in this browser. The game does not use an account, upload or online opponent.":"Kort, bud og poengsum forblir i denne nettleseren. Spillet bruker ikke en konto, opplasting eller online motstander.","One hand from deal to score":"En hånd fra avtale til scoring","The auction ends in 4♠ doubled. The declaring side must take ten tricks; the opening lead comes from the player to declarer’s left. After that lead, dummy is shown and declarer chooses cards from both hands.":"Auksjonen ender med 4 ♠ doblet. Den erklærende siden må ta ti stikk; åpningsleddet kommer fra spilleren til spillerens venstre side. Etter den ledelsen vises dummy og spilleren velger kort fra begge hender.","A beginner practice version":"En nybegynnerversjon","This is a single-table duplicate-bridge practice hand. It applies legal bid order, pass, double, redouble, follow-suit play, trump comparison, dummy control by declarer and a duplicate-style score for the hand. The built-in computer players use a small natural starter agreement: 1NT shows a balanced 15–17 high-card points; suit openings start at 12 points; responses and overcalls are deliberately basic. These opponents are practice bots, not expert bridge software. Tournament rulings, alerts, partnership conventions and matchpoint comparisons are outside this version.":"Dette er en enkeltbords duplikat-broøvelseshånd. Det gjelder lovlig budrekkefølge, pasning, dobbel, fordobling, følge-fargespill, trumfsammenligning, dummykontroll av spilleren og en duplikat-stilscore for hånden. De innebygde dataspillerne bruker en liten naturlig startavtale: 1NT viser en balansert 15–17 høykortpoeng; fargeåpninger starter på 12 poeng; svar og overanrop er bevisst grunnleggende. Disse motstanderne er praksisroboter, ikke ekspertbroprogramvare. Turneringsavgjørelser, varsler, partnerskapskonvensjoner og sammenligning av matchpunkter er utenfor denne versjonen.","Questions":"Spørsmål","Is this rubber bridge or duplicate bridge?":"Er denne gummibroen eller duplikatbroen?","It scores each hand separately using duplicate-style contract scoring. It does not carry part-scores forward as rubber bridge does, and it does not compare your result with other tables.":"Den scorer hver hånd separat ved å bruke duplikatscore i kontraktstil. Den fører ikke delpoeng frem som gummibro gjør, og den sammenligner ikke resultatet med andre tabeller.","What bidding system do the computer players use?":"Hvilket budsystem bruker dataspillerne?","A beginner natural starter agreement is shown on the page. It is the same whichever interface language you choose; it is not a national bridge system or a complete tournament convention card.":"En naturlig startavtale for nybegynnere vises på siden. Det er det samme uansett hvilket grensesnittspråk du velger; det er ikke et nasjonalt bridgesystem eller et komplett turneringskort.","Can I play online with other people?":"Kan jeg spille online med andre?","No. One person plays South against three local computer players. There is no matchmaking, account or server game.":"Nei. En person spiller sør mot tre lokale dataspillere. Det er ingen matchmaking, konto eller serverspill.","How does the game score a hand?":"Hvordan scorer spillet en hånd?","It shows the contract, vulnerability, tricks required and a duplicate-style score based on contract level, strain, double/redouble, overtricks or undertricks, and game or slam bonuses.":"Den viser kontrakten, sårbarheten, nødvendige triks og en duplikat-score basert på kontraktsnivå, belastning, dobbel/redoble, overtriks eller undertriks, og spill- eller slam-bonuser.","Does the computer play like a strong bridge partner?":"Spiller datamaskinen som en sterk bridgepartner?","No. The bots follow legal calls and plays but use simple beginner heuristics. Their decisions are not a model of expert bidding or card play.":"Nei. Robotene følger lovlige samtaler og spill, men bruker enkle nybegynnerheuristikk. Avgjørelsene deres er ikke en modell for ekspertbud eller kortspill.","Scope and limitations":"Omfang og begrensninger","This is a practice table, not an online bridge service, tournament director or expert solver. The starter bidding agreement is intentionally small and documented. Duplicate-style hand score is shown; matchpoints, IMPs, rubber scoring, alerts, claims, revoke rectifications and director rulings are not implemented.":"Dette er et treningsbord, ikke en online bridgetjeneste, turneringsleder eller ekspertløser. Startbudavtalen er med vilje liten og dokumentert. Duplikat-stil håndscore vises; matchpoints, IMPs, gummiscoring, varsler, krav, tilbakekalle rettelser og direktøravgjørelser implementeres ikke.","One complete duplicate-style practice hand. You always sit South; North–South and East–West are partners.":"Én komplett øvingshånd i duplikatstil. Du sitter alltid sør; Nord–Sør og Øst–Vest er partnere.","Starter bidding agreement":"Startbudavtale","Natural beginner agreement: 1NT = balanced 15–17 high-card points; a suit opening starts at 12 points. Responses and overcalls are simple practice heuristics, not expert advice or a national system.":"Naturlig nybegynneravtale: 1NT = balansert 15–17 høykortpoeng; en fargeåpning starter på 12 poeng. Svar og overanrop er enkle praksisheuristikk, ikke ekspertråd eller et nasjonalt system.","Vulnerability for this hand":"Sårbarhet for denne hånden","Neither side vulnerable":"Ingen av sidene er sårbare","North–South vulnerable":"Nord–Sør sårbar","East–West vulnerable":"Øst–Vest sårbar","Both sides vulnerable":"Begge sider sårbare","Dealer":"Forhandler","North":"Nord","East":"Øst","South · you":"Sør · deg","West":"Vest","North–South":"Nord–Sør","East–West":"Øst–vest","Hand":"Hånd","Auction":"Auksjon","Contract":"Kontrakt","To act":"Å handle","Your turn":"Din tur","{seat} is thinking…":"{seat} tenker...","Level":"Nivå","Strain":"Strekk","Clubs":"Klubber","Diamonds":"Diamanter","Hearts":"Hjerter","Spades":"Spader","No trump":"Ingen trumf","Bid":"Bud","Pass":"Pass","Double":"Dobbel","Redouble":"Dobles","No bid is available at that level.":"Ingen bud er tilgjengelig på det nivået.","Declarer":"Erklærer","Dummy":"Dummy","Opening leader":"Åpningsleder","Dummy is revealed after the opening lead.":"Dummy avsløres etter åpningsledelsen.","Your hand":"Din hånd","Dummy hand":"Dummy hånd","Hidden hand":"Skjult hånd","Current trick":"Gjeldende triks","Tricks won":"Triks vant","Duplicate-style score":"Duplikat-stilscore","North–South total":"Nord–Sør totalt","East–West total":"Øst–vest totalt","Choose a hand setting and begin the auction.":"Velg en håndinnstilling og start auksjonen.","Auction complete. The opening leader plays first.":"Auksjonen fullført. Åpningslederen spiller først.","Four passes: the board is passed out. Deal the next hand when ready.":"Fire pasninger: brettet er delt ut. Del neste hånd når du er klar.","Contract made: {tricks} tricks, {score} points for {side}.":"Kontrakt inngått: {tricks}-triks, {score}-poeng for {side}.","Contract went down: {tricks} tricks, {score} points to {side}.":"Kontrakten gikk ned: {tricks} triks, {score} peker på {side}.","Hand result":"Håndresultat","Deal next hand":"Deal neste hånd","New hand":"Ny hånd","Export score sheet":"Eksporter resultatark","Choose a legal call.":"Velg en juridisk samtale.","Follow the led suit when you can.":"Følg LED-drakten når du kan.","Computer players use beginner-level local rules. No data leaves this device.":"Dataspillere bruker lokale regler på nybegynnernivå. Ingen data forlater denne enheten.","Rules reference":"Referanse til regler","World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, Laws 73 and 89 updated 2024":"World Bridge Federation · Laws of Duplicate Bridge 2017, lover 73 og 89 oppdatert 2024"}});
